-   "Skill_1006102_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to deal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\nAfter casting this skill, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> within a short time to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air.\n\nIf Hsin moves while on the ground within a short time after casting this skill, she turns into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color>. \n- While in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form and out of combat, Hsin gains <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color>. With <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color>, Hsin can enter the target's aggro range without triggering combat. <color=Highlight>Dustless Tread</color> is removed when Hsin enters combat, is switched out, or ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form by having environmental, gameplay, or feature interactions.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form and out of combat, Hsin restores {0} of Max HP every {1}s.\n- Taking damage, failing to perform a <color=Highlight>Dodge</color> with directional input while on the ground, or <color=Highlight>Dodging</color> in mid-air will end the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form. Switching to another Resonator or {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tapping PC=pressing Gamepad=pressing} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> also ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form. {Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 4</color>, which also ends the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n- The Dash state continuously consumes STA when Hsin is in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n- <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> is disabled when Hsin is in the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> form.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and Hsin is on the ground, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color> to have Hsin command a Colossal Xuanfang Mechanism, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
-   "Skill_1006102_SkillName": "Heartward by Moon",
-   "Skill_1006102_SkillResume": "<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Answering Form</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n{Cus:Ipt,Touch=Tap PC=Press Gamepad=Press} or hold a directional key while casting this skill to turn Hsin into the <color=Highlight>Moon Fox</color> after a short time. While out of combat, She restores a certain amount of HP every 3s.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Illumining Form</color></size>\nDeal <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.",
--  "Skill_1006103_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Formshift</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Formshift</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> to unfurl the Manifold Sanctum. Hsin switches to <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities, and enters the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, engaging in <color=Highlight>quest dialogue</color>, performing an <color=Highlight>environmental interaction with an animation</color>, or using a <color=Highlight>Utility</color> switches Hsin back to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> to perform the corresponding action.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can walk on the surface of water, and will continuously consume STA in deep water areas. In Walking Mode, Hsin in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> can step off a cliff into the air and walk slowly in mid-air, continuously consuming STA in this state. Hsin cannot restore STA while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in mid-air.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Pillars Across Heaven</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> to bring the Manifold Sanctum crashing down, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nHsin returns to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and exits the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Edict</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> grants Hsin <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Edict</color> for {2}s. The effect cannot exceed <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} and all stacks are removed when the duration ends.\nAfter the active Resonator in the team deals DMG, Hsin automatically consumes <color=Highlight>Edict</color> in the following {1}s to trigger the following effect up to once per second. Retriggering the effect resets the duration:\n- When <color=Highlight>Edict</color> is consumed, summon a <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> from the Manifold Sanctum as a Coordinated Attack to strike the target once, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>. \n- <color=Highlight>Edict</color> can be automatically consumed up to 1 stack per second.\n- Damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- When Hsin is knocked out, all <color=Highlight>Edict</color> stacks are removed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heart Manifest</color></size>\nIncreases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> is locked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Answering</color></size>\nHsin temporarily reverts to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Illumining</color></size>\nHsin turns back into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>.",
-+  "Skill_1006103_SkillDescribe": "<size=40><color=Title>Formshift</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Wanderer</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Answering Form: Realm Protector</color> unlocks <color=Highlight>Formshift</color>.\nCast <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> to unfurl the Manifold Sanctum. Hsin switches to <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, unlocking a new set of combat abilities, and enters the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, engaging in <color=Highlight>quest dialogue</color>, performing an <color=Highlight>environmental interaction with an animation</color>, or using a <color=Highlight>Utility</color> switches Hsin back to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> to perform the corresponding action.\nWhile in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, Hsin can walk on the surface of water, and will continuously consume STA in deep water areas. In Walking Mode, Hsin in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> can step off a cliff into the air and walk slowly in mid-air, continuously consuming STA in this state. Hsin cannot restore STA while in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> and in mid-air.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Pillars Across Heaven</color></size>\nAfter casting <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Beholding All Horizons</color> or <color=Highlight>Heavy Attack - Illumining Form: Stilling All Horizons</color>, when in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> with full Resonance Energy, <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> becomes available.\nCast <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> to bring the Manifold Sanctum crashing down, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to the target, considered <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill DMG</color>.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\nHsin returns to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color> and exits the <color=Highlight><te href=131120>Heart Manifest</te></color> state.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Edict</color></size>\nCasting <color=Highlight>Formshift</color> grants Hsin <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} of <color=Highlight>Edict</color> for {2}s. The effect cannot exceed <SapTag=0>{0}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=stack P=stacks SapTag=0} and all stacks are removed when the duration ends.\nAfter a Resonator on the field deals DMG, Hsin automatically consumes <color=Highlight>Edict</color> in the following {1}s to trigger the following effect up to once per second. Retriggering the effect resets the duration:\n- When <color=Highlight>Edict</color> is consumed, summon a <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> from the Manifold Sanctum as a Coordinated Attack to strike the target once, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>. \n- <color=Highlight>Edict</color> can be automatically consumed up to 1 stack per second.\n- Damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Soaring Pillar</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- When Hsin is knocked out, all <color=Highlight>Edict</color> stacks are removed.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Heart Manifest</color></size>\nIncreases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> is locked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.\nBesides, if Hsin is still in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> after exiting <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color>, and <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> is locked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Answering</color></size>\nHsin temporarily reverts to <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Answering Form Stage 2</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Answering Form</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Invoked Form: Illumining</color></size>\nHsin turns back into <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>. When this skill is cast, if Hsin is on the ground, She casts <color=Highlight>Upward Cut - Illumining Form</color>; if She is in mid-air, She casts <color=Highlight>Mid-air Attack - Illumining Form</color>.",
