-   "Skill_1006202_SkillDescribe": "Attack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Within a certain period after opening the umbrella and dashing forward, when attacked by an enemy target, Suoming becomes immune to this damage and stagnates nearby targets. She then becomes immune to interruption and receives 100% less DMG for a certain period, and casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color>.\n- Entering the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state resets the Cooldown of <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 2</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 3</color>.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color></size>\nAttack targets within range, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Awakened Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to cast <color=Highlight>Basic Attack Stage 3</color>.\n- While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting this skill to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color>.",
