--  "Skill_1006203_SkillDescribe": "While in the <color=Highlight>Deep Mind</color> state, <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> becomes available. Casting Resonance Liberation deals <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color> to targets within range.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants Suoming <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color> for {0}s.\nCan be cast in mid-air close to the ground.\n\n<size=40><color=Title>Blight Rain, Miasmic Thunder</color></size>\nWhile casting <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color>, if Suoming has <color=Highlight><te href=131110>Unison</te></color>, when the active Resonator deals damage, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> is summoned as a Coordinated Attack on the target, dealing <color=Thunder>Electro DMG</color>.\n- Within {1}s after this damage is dealt, a <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> can be summoned each second. This effect is triggered once per second. The damage dealt by <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> does not trigger this effect.\n- Only 1 <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> can be summoned per second, up to {2} in total.\n- This effect lasts {3}s, or until the number of summoned <color=Highlight>Thunder Crest</color> reaches the limit.",
