--  "Skill_1006205_SkillResume": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and casts Outro Skill, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect.\nWithin a certain time after Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>, if she gains or has <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color>, her <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> grants the incoming Resonator Electro DMG Bonus.\n\nWhen Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and the <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> on her, then grants the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: increases the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color>, makes each stage of the skills restore extra Concerto Energy on hit, and increases Suoming's Crit. DMG.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
