-   "Term131118_Title": "Illumining Heart",
-   "Term131119_Desc": "When Hsin triggers <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color>, She gains <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, and this cast of <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</color>, dealing greater DMG.\nWhen Hsin casts an <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> without triggering <color=Highlight>Unison Response</color> while holding <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color>, She consumes <color=Highlight>Source Intent</color> instead, and the <color=Highlight>Intro Skill</color> is replaced with <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Manifold Unison</color>, dealing greater DMG.",
-   "Term131119_Title": "Source Intent",
--  "Term131120_Desc": "Increases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> has not been unlocked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.",
-+  "Term131120_Desc": "Increases Hsin's resistance to interruption for {2}s.\nEntering the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state resets Hsin's <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>.\nWhile in the <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color> state and in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color>, if <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> is locked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>. While in <color=Highlight>Answering Form</color>, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Illumining</color>.\nBesides, if Hsin is still in <color=Highlight>Illumining Form</color> after exiting <color=Highlight>Heart Manifest</color>, and <color=Highlight>Pillars Across Heaven</color> is locked, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> to have Hsin cast <color=Highlight>Invoked Form: Answering</color>.",
-   "Term131120_Title": "Heart Manifest",
-   "Term131201_Desc": "Can hold up to {0} points of Delusion.\n- Hitting a target with <color=Highlight>Basic Attack</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color>, <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter</color>, <color=Highlight>Dodge Counter - Unfurled Canopy</color>, or <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Crimson Gleam</color> grants Delusion if Suoming is the active Resonator.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> grants <SapTag=1>{1}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=1} of Delusion.\n- Casting <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Thunder Rending</color> or <color=Highlight>Intro Skill - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder (Unison)</color> grants <SapTag=2>{2}</SapTag> {Cus:Sap,S=point P=points SapTag=2} of Delusion.",
-   "Term131201_Title": "Delusion",
-   "Term131203_Desc": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and casts Outro Skill, she gains the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect for {0}s.\nWithin {1}s after Suoming casts <color=Highlight>Resonance Liberation</color> or <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Umbral Canopy: Engraved Heart</color>, if she gains or has <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color>, her <color=Highlight>Outro Skill</color> grants the incoming Resonator {2} Electro DMG Bonus, plus an additional {3} for each stack of <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> they have, up to {4}. This effect lasts for {5}s or until the Resonator is switched out.",
-   "Term131203_Title": "Aligned Seals",
--  "Term131204_Desc": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and the <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> on her, consumes 20 points of Concerto Energy, and clears all <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>, granting the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: increases the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color> by {0}, makes each stage of the skills additionally restore {1} points of Concerto Energy on hit, and increases Suoming's Crit. DMG by {2}. This effect lasts for {3}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n- Gaining <color=Highlight>Unison</color> ends this effect early.\n- Gaining the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect ends this effect early.\n- The <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect cannot be gained while the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect is active.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
-+  "Term131204_Desc": "When Suoming has <color=Highlight>Unison</color>, casting <color=Highlight>Resonance Skill - Furled Canopy: Rift Cleaver</color> removes <color=Highlight>Unison</color> and the <color=Highlight>Unison Boon</color> on her, consumes 20 points of Concerto Energy, and clears all <color=Highlight>Delusion</color>, granting the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect: increases the DMG Multipliers of <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy</color> and <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy: Whirling Thunder</color> by {0}, makes each stage of the skills additionally restore {1} points of Concerto Energy on hit, and increases Suoming's Crit. DMG by {2}. This effect lasts for {3}s or until the Resonator is switched out.\n- Gaining <color=Highlight>Unison</color> ends this effect early.\n- Gaining the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect ends this effect early.\n- The <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect cannot be gained while the <color=Highlight>Aligned Seals</color> effect is active.\n- While the <color=Highlight>Seal Master</color> effect is active, {Cus:Ipt,Touch=tap PC=press Gamepad=press} or hold <color=Highlight>Normal Attack</color> shortly after casting <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 4</color> to chain into <color=Highlight>Basic Attack - Unfurled Canopy Stage 2</color>.",
