- {
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_1": "It feels like yesterday when we last parted before this chessboard. How is everything in Mengzhou now, {PlayerName}?",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_10": "Sitting across from Changli, you recount the stories of your recent journey as the chess pieces click against the board.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_11": "She listens with a gentle smile, her gaze warm and focused on you.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_12": "So, you met Qingxiao the Perfected in the Land of Xuanfang... Master used to take me to her back then, hoping to find a way to handle this flame of mine.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_13": "She told us her arts couldn't cure me, looking a bit guilty even. Hearing that her cultivation has reached new heights truly gladdens my heart.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_14": "{PlayerName}, before I even realized it, your journey has become so vibrant. I'm certain many more wondrous encounters await you in the future.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_15": "Hearing your tales... I must admit, I find myself longing for a taste of it too.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_16": "If the day comes when I finally lay down my duties, perhaps I will follow in a certain someone's footsteps to see just how wide the world really is.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_17": "By then, I imagine my state of mind will be quite different from the past.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_2": "It's been a while, Changli. And don't worry, things are almost settled there.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_3": "What about you? I heard you went to Mingting to deliver your report. How did it go?",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_4": "Hehe... it went smoothly enough. I even had the chance to catch up with some old friends. Many of them spoke quite highly of you, {PlayerName}.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_5": "Of me?",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_6": "Yes. From Jinzhou to Mingting... you have no shortage of admirers across Huanglong.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_7": "Your care for Jinhsi is appreciated as well. She handles Jinzhou's affairs with far more ease these days, leaving very little that requires my oversight.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_8": "Thanks to that, I now have the leisure to sit back, enjoy the snow, and wait for a good game of chess.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_1_9": "I've caught word of your recent exploits. What do you say, {PlayerName}? Care to share your stories over a game?",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_2_1": "Experiencing the wonders of the world with a companion brings a unique kind of joy.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_2_2": "The same goes for chess—a great game requires a worthy opponent.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_2_3": "Yet, the one sitting across from me has long since wagered {Male=himself;Female=herself} in a game of endless complexity.",
--  "ChangLi_Shengtai_2_4": "That is why my only wish for {Male=him;Female=her} is to always put {Male=his;Female=her} own feelings first, and in the end... see all {Male=his;Female=her} wishes come true.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_1": "Welcome to the Xuanyuan Domain, honored guest of the Sentinel, and first disciple of the Xuanyuan School, {PlayerName}.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_10": "But it shouldn't be long before this place is fully restored as Xuanfang Hold's control mainframe.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_11": "There is one thing, though. We have recently detected certain abnormal signals from other sectors...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_12": "What are they?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_13": "Ah, nothing too concerning. In any case, you don't need to worry about any more trouble from the Xuanyuan Domain.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_14": "At least until the Xuanyuan Domain is fully restored, I suppose my work continues?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_15": "The Sentinel hasn't given me any new orders. But I can occasionally slip out for some fresh air. You know, through \"Jadie.\"",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_17": "Shh. Don't tell the Sentinel. That is me bending the rules a little...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_18": "The people here haven't disappeared? I still see passersby.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_19": "Yes. They are data fragments stored in the Xuanyuan Domain. Projections of people from the past.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_2": "That title is far too long.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_20": "This layer is set to resemble Xuanfang two hundred years ago. The Domain allows them to appear here.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_3": "You ran out of breath saying all that.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_4": "Heh. Enough joking. What brings you here today?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_5": "How is the Xuanyuan Domain now?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_6": "Will you be staying here permanently?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_7": "The people here haven't disappeared?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_8": "That is all for now.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_100_9": "The Reverberation corruption Muyu caused has mostly been handled. There are only a few data zones between the Tian and Di Realms that still need repair.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_101_1": "Jadie is curled up, seemingly in a dormant state...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_101_2": "(Poke.)",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_101_3": "(Do nothing.)",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_101_4": "Hey! A little heads up, \"I\" am right here watching!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_10_1": "A battle of this scale, and only a handful were wounded. It's a miracle...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_10_2": "If Paragon Qingxiao hadn't been there, I shudder to think what might have happened.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_10_3": "That's right. One moment I could barely stand. The next, I felt strength surging through me...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_10_4": "My mace tore through those Tacet Discords like they were nothing but overipe melons.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_115_1": "Young folks sure are quick on their feet. Said they would take a detour, and off they went.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_115_2": "I should be heading back to the village myself soon...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_120_1": "Why did the sky keep flickering like that earlier? And the ground shook so hard.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_120_2": "For a moment, it was so bright I couldn't even open my eyes.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_120_3": "I heard that was the Sword Transcendent drawing her sword.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_120_4": "...What could cause such a commotion in the sky? It isn't like the sky itself is about to fall, is it?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_125_1": "This rubble needs to be cleared away soon.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_125_2": "Leaving it piled up like this is no way to go about it.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_125_3": "I'll contact the Yuan Fortress artisans later.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_12_1": "Brother, thank you. Truly, we couldn't have done this without you fighting beside us.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_12_2": "Save your thanks. Jinzhou and Mengzhou have always been of one blood.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_12_3": "Our ancestors fought side by side against the Threnodian horde during the Fortress and Gorges War.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_14_1": "You know, the new Watcher Yangyang was truly something else out there on the battlefield.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_14_2": "Her and Watcher Liangyu together? Devastating. It's just a pity that... Ah.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_14_3": "Why the sigh?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_14_4": "I was just thinking... if only Duzhong and the others could've seen them. They would've been so proud.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_16_1": "Those shut-down Autopuppets and mechanisms... they all sprang back to life in the blink of an eye...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_16_2": "Was that Lady's Hsin's doing?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_19_1": "Earlier... did you see a pillar of light rising from the Sanctum?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_19_2": "I did. And we all heard Paragon Qingxiao's voice too.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_1": "Friend sent a nudge",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_11": "This is...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_12": "This is...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_13": "This qin... is one of only two in this world. The other is mine. It has remained silent with me for a century. I believed the opportunity to find an owner for it had passed.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_14": "But it would appear the day has finally come. Henceforth, it now belongs to you.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_15": "If the way of music speaks to you, I hope you will play it often.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_16": "Thank you. I will not decline such a gift.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_17": "Thank you. I will not decline such a gift.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_18": "Even if you did, I would still insist that you take it.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_19": "...?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_2": "...I accidentally tapped your profile picture again.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_20": "...?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_21": "Should you ever have questions about the qin, you may come to me. I will teach you.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_3": "Disciple, I find that I neglected to give you a proper initiation gift.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_4": "There's more than one?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_5": "Oh? I like the sound of that.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_6": "What about the sword talisman? There's more than one initiation gift?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_7": "Oh? I like the sound of that.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_8": "The sword talisman was a symbol of our bond as master and disciple. An inaugural gift for the first disciple in my school is its own matter.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_1_9": "Here it is. I only finished crafting it recently.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_20_1": "Earlier... did you see a pillar of light rising from the Sanctum?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_20_2": "I did. And we all heard Paragon Qingxiao's voice too.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_20_3": "When she said \"the sky is about to fall,\" I looked up through that pillar of light and saw a swirling vortex of clouds.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_20_4": "It looked like the sky itself was about to collapse. For that moment, I couldn't breathe.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_20_5": "It was different for me... I kept my eyes shut. But I still saw something similar.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_20_6": "In that moment, all I could think was, \"If only I could do something to help.\"",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_20_7": "Now that we're safe, it means the \"swords\" we sent out must've reached them in time!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_22_1": "Hello there! Greetings, Great Hero of Xuanfang!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_23_1": "I salute you, {PlayerName}!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_30_1": "Hey, didn't that man who just passed by look familiar?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_30_2": "The one in the hood? I think I've seen him around the village before.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_35_1": "How does a perfectly good pavilion just cave in like that?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_35_2": "Might not be just this one spot, either. The entire Hold may not be far behind.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_36_1": "How does a perfectly good pavilion just cave in like that?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_36_2": "Might not be just this one spot, either. The entire Hold may not be far behind.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_36_3": "Don't be so dramatic. It was probably the Tacet Discords.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_36_4": "Then how are the surroundings still intact? Come now, don't you see the day will come when every last Tacet Discord in Xuanfang is finally purged?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_36_5": "Perhaps. But that day is still far off. Plenty of 'em are still locked in Censure Courts.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_36_6": "Ah, you just refuse to think too deeply about it. Xuanfang's purpose... may be drawing to a close.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_37_1": "Please don't come any closer. There are no crowds allowed.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_37_2": "The cause of the collapse is still under investigation.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_40_1": "Grandfather, I saw the great Lady Qingxiao again.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_40_2": "Hah! Your imagination's outpaced the truth again, boy. As if you'd run into Paragon Qingxiao.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_42_1": "Grandfather, I saw the great Lady Qingxiao again.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_42_2": "Hah! Your imagination's outpaced the truth again, boy. As if you'd run into Paragon Qingxiao.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_42_3": "It's true! I saw her walking through the market. She went to eat at the Fillet Fairmaiden's restaurant.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_42_4": "I've seen her with that black-haired, golden-eyed {Male=man;Female=lady} a lot lately. She's even been smiling more!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_42_5": "Tch... black-haired, golden-eyed? Could it be the Paragon has taken that hero from Jinzhou as her disciple?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_45_1": "That quirky young Taoist has also been spotted in Xuanfang.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_45_2": "Ah...? Hold on, who are you referring to?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_46_1": "That quirky young Taoist has also been spotted in Xuanfang.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_46_2": "Ah...? Hold on, who are you referring to?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_46_3": "I've told you about her. Daoist Master Jiufeng's favorite disciple? She has a history with Qingxiao the Perfected.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_46_4": "Seems the turmoil in Xuanfang is drawing all the major sects into the game.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_46_5": "Listen, Wu. Do yourself a favor and lay off the storyteller yarns.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_50_1": "I've got a feeling. This time, I'm definitely making it into the Ministry of Development.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_50_2": "I've seen Paragon Qingxiao twice just recently. That's got to be a lucky omen.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_50_3": "...Well then, I wish you success.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_50_4": "Lady Hsin, surely You will show Yourself soon as well!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_51_1": "I heard that a Nethermancer played a big part in the battle.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_51_2": "...Is that so? Would that be Yanshu's boy?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_51_3": "Most likely. The Ministry of War's already come by.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_51_4": "It's about time their name was cleared. They are good people.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_55_1": "The Waking Moon Festival isn't far off now. We should start getting ready.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_55_2": "With all this trouble finally settling down, it's about time we thought about celebrating.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_55_3": "Right. No matter how hard things get, a festival's still a festival.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_57_1": "Mengzhou Fish in Vinegar, recommended by Transcendents themselves!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_57_2": "A taste of tradition, passed down for two hundred years!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_60_1": "Hello there. I remember you were dining with Paragon Qingxiao earlier.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_60_2": "She seems to have left behind an old book. Could you return it to her?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_60_3": "Leave it with me.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_60_4": "I'll take it to her.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_60_5": "Thank you. I left it on the counter.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_61_1": "This looks like... a sword manual?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_1": "(Talk about the sword manual you brought.)",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_10": "...Disciple, I wanted to tell you sooner. But...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_11": "I think finding that manual was only the beginning. What truly set her on the path was her own refusal to give up.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_12": "And in time, she wandered Huanglong, searching for the Golden‑Eyed One. She wanted to find the \"roots\" of those sword techniques.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_13": "She wanted to stand before {Male=him;Female=her}—to learn, to trade insights. But again and again, she missed {Male=him;Female=her}. Always a step behind...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_14": "It was not until they finally met, two hundred years later, that she realized the manual's techniques did not fully match  {Male=his;Female=her} own swordcraft.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_15": "Perhaps, that manual was not written by {Male=him;Female=her} after all.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_16": "But now she knows their swords share the same root.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_17": "Yes. So there is no need to return this manual.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_18": "You no longer need it?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_19": "Would you mind if I kept it?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_2": "Master, this manual... you left it at Yuan's Flavors. I came to return it.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_20": "I have long since committed it to memory. From now on...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_21": "We should continue to add to its pages.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_22": "Yes... She added her own understanding to those pages. Her own style grew from them.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_3": "...I was planning to retrieve it myself. I did not expect it to fall into your hands.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_4": "The techniques in it remind me of my own. What is its connection to you?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_5": "It's a long story... Long ago, a village girl found this manual while tending livestock. She treasured it above all.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_6": "In her spare time, she practiced with a branch in place of a sword. She had no teacher, just the pages. But over time, she grew skilled.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_7": "That fortuitous training saved her when Tacet Discords destroyed her home.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_8": "It carried her far from that place, and eventually, it led her to the path of the sword she walks today.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_72_9": "...So that is how it all began.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_80_1": "...\nOn Mt. Firmament, there dwells a Tacet Discord. Its form resembles a tiger, with golden eyes and a cyan face. Its back is covered in scales, and its long tail is tipped with spines. It is called the Lightstrider. Fierce by nature, it shuns company and claims the open wilds as its own. It fights with teeth and claws, its strength enough to shatter stone. When angered, it can transform its gleaming scales into projectiles, moving through the air as swiftly as a beam of light.\n\nWhen an ordinary person sees its radiance in the distance, they should fall silent and take a wide berth. On no account should they provoke it.\n\nIf caught in a narrow encounter with no way to retreat, one must still the heart and act according to the moment. When it lunges from above, meet it head‑on to break its momentum. If strength proves insufficient, seize the first chance to flee and avoid its edge. Above all, do not hesitate. A moment of doubt is a moment of ruin.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_90_1": "Our reinforcements sent to Xuanfang Hold have reported in.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_90_2": "How's it looking? The fighting there should have settled by now.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_90_3": "Everyone is safe. They will return to the Midnight Ranger garrison after a few days of rest.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_91_1": "The Threnodian's movements this time are strange. It came in force, and now it has gone quiet.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_91_2": "The timing is suspicious too. It picked the exact moment the Land of Xuanfang was in crisis.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_91_3": "Think the Threnodian sensed what was occurring there?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_91_4": "Not impossible. After all...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_91_5": "The Tacet Discords sealed in Xuanfang are all its spawn from years past.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_92_1": "During the Fortress and Gorges War, the Midnight Rangers' forebears held the line at the Gorges of Spirits against the Tacet Discord hordes.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_92_2": "I know. Jinzhou didn't even exist yet back then.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_95_1": "During the Fortress and Gorges War, the Midnight Rangers' forebears held the line at the Gorges of Spirits against the Tacet Discord hordes.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_95_2": "I know. Jinzhou didn't even exist yet back then.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_95_3": "The elders say those Rangers were once border troops stationed at Jinmen Pass. Many of them came from Hongzhen.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_95_4": "Did you know the legendary Golden‑Eyed One came to support the battle efforts?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH2_95_5": "It is in the history books. Besides the Golden‑Eyed One, the Sword Transcendent from Mengzhou was there too.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_100_1": "It seems the mountain gate does not open from this side...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_105_1": "...\n\nThe beacon fires of the Fortress and Gorges War at last burned low, and peace was restored across the realms.\n\nMingting issued a proclamation, calling upon the full might of Huanglong to raise a new fortified city south of the Central Plains and naming it Jinzhou. Thenceforth, the lands east of the Mountains of Spirits and south of the Norfall Barrens fell under Jinzhou's jurisdiction.\n\nThe first Magistrate of Jinzhou decreed that the city would bear no emblem of its own. Instead, it would share the insignia of Huanglong, in remembrance of the bond forged in aid with the one capital and five cities.\n\n...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_1": "Hey there, {PlayerName}. It's been a while, huh?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_10": "And you contacted me because...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_11": "So you contacted me because... you need my help with something?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_12": "Why would I? Of course it's because... I've got an important picture for you!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_14": "Sent a copy to Qingxiao too. She seemed pretty happy after seeing it.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_15": "Care to explain?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_16": "Care to explain? How did you get your hands on that picture?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_17": "Well, that's a secret. We got to have a keepsake for such a moment, right?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_18": "Well... if you don't have anything else to ask, I'll get going now. See you!",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_19": "Friend has gone offline.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_2": "You're out of the Xuanyuan Domain?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_3": "Drop the act, Ruoyun.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_4": "You got out of the Xuanyuan Domain, Jadie? How did you get my contact info?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_5": "Well, just some techs. Easy peasy.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_6": "Drop the act, Ruoyun.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_7": "Shh... It's Jadie, okay?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_8": "I came out for some air a while back, but I'm back in the Xuanyuan Domain now.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_10_9": "There's still so much cleanup work to do.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_110_1": "I completely forgot about it. Yuan Fortress's mountain gate is still under maintenance.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_110_2": "These shipments will just have to wait, I guess...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_120_1": "Wait... Is that Qingxiao the Transcendent I'm seeing?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_120_2": "Heard there's always a Xuanling Bird next to her, but I didn't see one just now.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_120_3": "Maybe it wasn't the Xuanling Bird who asked her to come down the mountain this time?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_132_1": "Besides us, did the Gorges of Spirits get hit by the TD Outbreak too?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_132_2": "Yeah. Heard the Threnodian hit hardest there. Even the Crownless showed up.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_133_1": "Besides us, did the Gorges of Spirits get hit by the TD Outbreak too?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_133_2": "Yeah. Heard the Threnodian hit hardest there. Even the Crownless showed up.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_133_3": "Splitting up to hit both fronts and cut off communication between us. Crafty bastard.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_133_4": "True. As long as the Gorges of Spirits are still in a mess, the Threnodian's gonna keep sending TDs our way.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_133_5": "If it weren't for the Cloud Shuttles, this battle would've gone a whole different way...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_133_6": "Don't dwell on it. Truth is, you and I barely set foot out there, and it was nearly over.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_135_1": "I came to Yuan Fortress to learn how Cloud Shuttles are manufactured.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_135_2": "Well, not down here you won't. You'll need to find a way to go up there.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_135_3": "You mean... on a Cloud Shuttle?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_135_4": "That's right. You can apply for a Cloud Shuttle maintenance team someday.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_140_1": "The passage this side is undergoing maintenance. Please stand clear.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_141_1": "Road. Maintenance. Closed.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_145_1": "My stomach just turns every time the Cloud Shuttle takes off...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_145_2": "Oh, I've got my own problem... I'm scared of heights. My legs are shaking already.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_145_3": "Spend enough time up in the air and we'll get used to it.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_150_1": "This large sphere... Is that the control kernel of the Cloud Shuttle?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_150_2": "Right you are. It's also the power source that propels the Cloud Shuttle during its flight.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_151_1": "This large sphere... Is that the control kernel of the Cloud Shuttle?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_151_2": "Right you are. It's also the power source that propels the Cloud Shuttle during its flight.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_151_3": "I can hardly imagine how it manages to support the Cloud Shuttle's operations. How does it even work?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_151_4": "I'm not entirely sure either. It must be one of those \"miracles\" of mechanist arts.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_151_5": "What happens if it breaks down one day?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_151_6": "Don't worry. They've been around since forever, and I've never heard of any Cloud Shuttle's kernel having problems.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_15_1": "Is it just me, or are there more TDs showing up around lately?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_15_2": "Let's keep an eye on this. We'll report any confirmed anomalies to the Ministry of War.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_160_1": "Never expected we'd meet on a Cloud Shuttle. How are things over at Zhuojun Atelier?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_160_2": "Can't complain. Lot more freedom than back at the Ministry of Development. Fewer hoops to jump through when you're doing research.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_161_1": "Never expected we'd meet on a Cloud Shuttle. How are things over at Zhuojun Atelier?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_161_2": "Can't complain. Lot more freedom than back at the Ministry of Development. Fewer hoops to jump through when you're doing research.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_161_3": "So what's this about, old friend? Here to check up on me for the Ministry?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_161_4": "Don't be ridiculous. Up here on the Cloud Shuttle, we're all just maintenance crew. Nobody's keeping tabs on anybody.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_161_5": "Fair enough. Looking forward to working together again.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_170_1": "Come on, spit it out. How did you get on board the Cloud Shuttle?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_170_2": "Well... I hid inside a cargo crate when the Cloud Shuttle was refueling. Haha...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_170_3": "All right, I think you've seen enough. I'll have the Ministry of War take care of you once we land.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_170_4": "Wait, wait, please, ma'am. Can't you just let this one slide? I'll be gone before you even know it.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_171_1": "The mechanisms run on their own anyway. A little extra rest won't hurt...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_172_1": "The scenery here is really breathtaking. And the breeze is so nice...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_175_1": "Say, which one do you think is faster? The Sword Transcendent's flying sword? Or the Cloud Shuttle?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_175_2": "Probably the flying sword. The last time I saw the Sword Transcendent, she whizzed past like a beam of light.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_175_3": "Wait, wasn't that the Sword Transcendent just now?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_190_1": "...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_191_1": "...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_191_2": "... Someone must've altered my memories.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_191_3": "Who exactly is controlling me to stay on the Cloud Shuttle?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_200_1": "Listen up, everyone, we're well ahead of the maintenance schedule for the day. So we all get early rest.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_200_2": "Why's he talking to empty space...?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_20_1": "We should form a patrol team soon to help ease the burden on the Ministry of War.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_20_2": "Quite a few of the young folks in the village have already brought up the idea. They're just waiting on your word.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_21_1": "We should form a patrol team soon to help ease the burden on the Ministry of War.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_21_2": "Quite a few of the young folks in the village have already brought up the idea. They're just waiting on your word.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_21_3": "I'll get them together later. At least we'll be ready next time the TDs show up.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_21_4": "I'll join you. Say, remember that heavy downpour years ago?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_21_5": "Of course. If the Rafter Kite hadn't brought Paragon Qingxiao at the time, us kids would've been swept away in the flood.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_21_6": "The village really owes her for her protection all these years.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_220_1": "That lightway in the distance connects to a higher region beyond.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_220_2": "How do you know? Have you been there?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_221_1": "That lightway in the distance connects to a higher region beyond.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_221_2": "How do you know? Have you been there?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_221_3": "I don't quite remember, but yeah, I have been there.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_221_4": "The place's gloomy. The sky is nowhere near as clear as it is here. And they have so many Cloud Shuttles running as well...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_240_1": "The Cloud Shuttle's control kernel seems to be spinning at an abnormal rate...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_30_1": "Old Qian! I-I want to join the patrol. We all ought to do our part for our home.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_30_2": "Oh, you old fool. You're still nursing a bad leg. Don't go making trouble for everyone.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_40_1": "I spoke with Commander Qiuhong. We can start by organizing the villagers ourselves.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_40_2": "The Xuanfang Wardens need to focus on the defenses. Let's spare them the trouble where we can.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_40_3": "The Ministry of War doesn't have enough beds for everyone, so we'll need to set some up in the courtyard.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_40_4": "Same as last time. The elderly, the frail, and the wounded get indoors first. I'll be sleeping outside tonight as well.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_50_1": "Is it true that both the Skywatch Rings and the Mingshen System went down?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_50_2": "Yes, now we can only rely on Rafter Kites to scout the surrounding area.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_51_1": "Is it true that both the Skywatch Rings and the Mingshen System went down?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_51_2": "Yes, now we can only rely on Rafter Kites to scout the surrounding area.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_51_3": "Look on the bright side. At least this time the Autopuppets aren't our enemies anymore.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_51_4": "But the Autopuppets can't help us either. Setting up defensive lines is much harder than it used to be.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_51_5": "In any case, we're on our own now. Hop to it.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_60_1": "A lot of folks haven't had a chance to eat. We should prep some snacks later.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_60_2": "Sounds good. We should borrow some utensils from the Fillet Fairmaiden.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_62_1": "So, what did the Commander mean by \"we must fall back, line by line\"?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_62_2": "Basically, we set up several defense lines around the perimeter, and put most of our manpower on the spots that matter most.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_62_3": "So it means... the area around the Ministry of War is our final stronghold?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_62_4": "Ugh, if I hadn't gotten careless and let that TD swipe at me, I'd be out there helping build the defenses right now.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_65_1": "The TDs were literally by our door back then. What were you doing rummaging through the home?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_65_2": "What could possibly be worth more than your life? What if you get left behind for missing the evacuation?",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_65_3": "Ah, it's just an old habit I can't shake. Don't worry, I won't do it again.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_65_4": "Well, I certainly hope there won't be another evacuation...",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_70_1": "These are volatile times. Please remain inside the Ministry of War.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_71_1": "For your safety, this area is now off-limits. Sorry for the inconvenience.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_72_1": "Defense preparations are proceeding on schedule. Take a rest, everyone. No need to worry.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_80_1": "Paragon Qingxiao, {PlayerName}, I wish you both a safe journey.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_81_1": "Paragon Qingxiao, {PlayerName}, I wish you both a safe journey.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_81_2": "As things stand, even Lady Hsin's residence may not be called safe. Do take the utmost care.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_81_3": "Take care, sir.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_81_4": "Don't worry. We have Ms. Yangyang and all the soldiers keeping watch. We'll be fine.",
--  "GNNPC_QXJRSPH_81_5": "The Land of Xuanfang has weathered countless calamities, yet the will of our ancestors endures through the generations. I have faith that things will turn out for the best.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_1": "{PlayerName}... you're back from Mengzhou. It seems you've tied up all the loose ends there.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_10": "Where have you been since then? And what have you experienced along the way?",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_11": "Under the same gentle moonlight as nights past, you share the tale of your journey with Jinhsi.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_12": "Stern and focused, the young Magistrate listens intently to your every word. Her expression tightens with worry whenever you mention the perils you faced, only to soften upon hearing how you saved the day.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_13": "I see... what a journey of twists and turns you've had so far, {PlayerName}.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_14": "Watching over Jinzhou is my duty. I cannot leave it, nor do I wish to. Yet, after hearing your stories, I find myself longing to experience such things first-hand.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_15": "Should \"adventures\" like that cross your path again, would you share them with me when you return to Jinzhou?",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_16": "Of course. I left Jinzhou in such a rush last time that we didn't have the time to catch up. Jinhsi... how have you been lately?",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_17": "Everything is well. Thanks to your help, the matters that weighed on me after Mt. Firmament have finally been resolved.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_18": "Since waking up, Master Changli and the Sentinel have been guiding me in my daily duties.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_19": "Even while Master was away giving her official report, I found myself handling problems that once troubled me with ease. So... I suppose I've grown a little more mature?",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_2": "Mm-hmm. Appreciating the moonlight here, Jinhsi?",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_20": "You even went out to find the Sentinel's token all on your own. Aside from growing more mature, you've become quite flexible, Madam Magistrate.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_21": "You think so? Ahem, well... truth be told, I was simply adapting to an urgent situation.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_22": "But it worked out perfectly, didn't it? Though you really need to keep yourself safe, Jinhsi.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_23": "....Alright. I will keep that in mind.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_24": "It seems I still have much to learn to become the calm, reliable Magistrate I strive to be.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_25": "If you ever return to Jinzhou, please... bear witness to my growth. I, Hsi, shall not fall short of your expectations.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_3": "Not exactly. I usually spend my days handling affairs at the City Hall, so by the time I finally have a moment to myself, the night has already stolen in.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_4": "Stealing a quiet moment like this to gaze at the moon and feel the breeze... over time, I have found it deeply comforting.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_5": "...It also brings back memories sometimes. The moon shone just like this back then.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_6": "Right, our three-day agreement.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_7": "Feels like yesterday.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_8": "Ever since what we faced on Mt. Firmament, our reunions have always been too brief to truly catch up on your recent travels.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_1_9": "Yangyang told me about your journey after leaving Jinzhou, and how you always managed to turn the tide. But I know so few of the details...",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_2_1": "Gazing at the moon now, I can't help but feel it holds so many more memories than it used to.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_2_2": "At the Moon-Chasing Festival after that storm, everyone in Jinzhou smiled so brightly, their faces cleared of their usual worries.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_2_3": "For a border city plagued by constant warfare, moments like that are incredibly precious. I will always cherish that sight.",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_2_4": "And so, whenever I bathe in the moonlight, I think to myself...",
--  "JinXi_Shengtai_2_5": "Beneath its glow, I have truly received so many beautiful things.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_1": "Well, look who we have here! Finally, a stroke of good luck after a day full of headaches.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_10": "...In the end, I realized the guy who walked in with me had been replaced by whatever thing was lurking in the Mirage Realm.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_11": "What could I do? I had no choice but to drag that clueless cat back in for another round, throw punches to that menace, and barely manage to fish the poor Nethermancer out.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_12": "You sound like you actually enjoyed it, Jingran.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_13": "And why wouldn't I? Diving into the unknown is a risky business. If you don't trade the danger for a bit of fun, you're just running a deficit every single day.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_14": "Come to think of it, this little stunt is definitely getting its own spin-off chapter...",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_15": "Right, {PlayerName}. Since you were the very first audience, why don't you do the honors and name this new release for me?",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_2": "Jingran... you look a bit rough.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_3": "That obvious, huh? Tch. Gotta work on the poker face.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_4": "Just got myself trapped in a nasty Mirage Realm earlier. The deeper I went, the more illusions it threw at me—all dreadfully vivid. My head's still spinning.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_5": "But those golden eyes of yours... yeah, way too sharp to be a cheap illusion. In other words, seeing you here means I actually made it out alive. Nice job, me.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_6": "Anyway, it's fresh material for the Mirage Seeker's Tales. The second I get home, I'm writing all of this down and updating the next chapter ASAP.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_7": "So, {PlayerName}, since you're here, care for a story? It's a good one, promise.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_8": "Leaning in next to Jingran, you lose yourself in the wild tale of his recent plunge into the Mirage Realms.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_1_9": "You've faced your fair share of high-stakes adventures, but none of them carry quite the same eerie, twisted horror that leaks from Jingran's storytelling.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_2_1": "Back in Xianling Village, time moved both slow and fast.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_2_2": "Days felt long whenever I watched Shifu's old lady make Moonlit Splendor in the kitchen. Hot steam would rise from the bamboo steamer, the rice cake tasted perfectly sweet, and the twilight seemed to stretch on forever.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_2_3": "When I followed Shifu into the Mirage Realms, everything felt incredibly fast. We always ran into all kinds of anomalies. At first, I was in a frantic rush, with those chaotic whispers echoing in my ears, annoying as hell.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_2_4": "But I've long gotten used to it by now, and living on the road suits me just fine.",
--  "JingRan_Shengtai_2_5": "Whenever I happen to come back, seeing that the mountains and rivers haven't changed a bit since those days... It's a good feeling. Really.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_100_1": "Sounds like this \"Granny Yanshu\" has some connection to those Nethermancers.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_100_2": "I know the old woman they mentioned.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_100_3": "...Her late husband was a Nethermancer.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_1": "This is...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_10": "(If I remember right, Xuanling Birds have been extinct since the <te href=750053>Fortress and Gorges War</te> two centuries ago...)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_11": "Paragon Qingxiao, may I ask your age?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_12": "...How long have you been in the Land of Xuanfang?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_13": "No need for formality. A Cultivator seeks to live long and see true. Age holds little meaning to me now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_14": "Besides... you are not the younger of us.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_15": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_16": "It has not been long. Just over two hundred years.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_17": "...And that's not long?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_18": "She has come.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_19": "At the Yanshu family's home, you find an old painting of Qingxiao and a Xuanling Bird from years past. Reading the frequency left on the painting, you catch a hazy glimpse of Qingxiao protecting an unfamiliar young girl. As you're discussing the painting, Yanshu steps into the courtyard.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_2": "Ah... I thought there would be no need to send a Xuanling to trouble you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_3": "But Bladepuppets alone could not hold back this tide of Tacet Discords...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_4": "Evacuate the others. I will handle what remains.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_6": "...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_7": "What troubles you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_8": "The figure in that old portrait... is that you and a Xuanling Bird?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_110_9": "Yes. It never could settle. Always pecking at my hair.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_1": "Heh heh. An ancestor of mine left that painting a hundred years back. Said it would ward off evil and invite good fortune. Look at those colors, haven't faded a bit after all this time...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_10": "Since olden times, Mengzhou has had many places of strange fengshui where Reverberations gather. Left untended, they grow into <ano=Sonoro Spheres>Mirage Realms</ano>, and from them, Tacet Discords are born.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_11": "Nethermancers practice Vein Prospecting, the art of reading the land's hidden golden veins. Their trade is exploring Mirage Realms. It is an old, old craft.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_12": "Sounds like the Pioneer Association's work.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_13": "Hehe... Far less noble than that, I'm afraid. Nethermancers dispel Mirage Realms to stop disasters, yes. But also peddle the ownerless relics they find inside. That is the Jianghu way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_14": "Their rules are loose, their ranks mixed. They walk where the dead walk, so misunderstandings cling to them like flies to honey.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_15": "There are fewer Nethermancers each year. Few in that line meet a peaceful end. My late husband, Sandao, was no different... He did not even leave me a keepsake.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_16": "Forgive me. I have drifted from the question. The pendant you asked about is a common token they carry.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_17": "It is a mark of reverence for gods, spirits, and the dead. In a Mirage Realm, such a token often serves a special purpose.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_18": "(Then the reason he left it behind likely has to do with a Mirage Realm. The anomalies in Fogveil Pagoda may be linked to whatever he did.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_19": "Wait. This knotwork... I think I've seen it before...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_2": "Oh, Paragon Qingxiao! You are here too. If I'd known, I would have prepared a pot of good tea.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_20": "Could this belong to... Jing? But how...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_21": "{PlayerName}, Paragon Qingxiao!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_22": "A nearby Censure Court has stopped functioning. We need to evacuate these people to Xuanfang Hold right away.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_23": "The Celestial Ring Formation...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_24": "Do Nethermancers always bring such pendants when they enter one?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_25": "Yes. Rarely do they go without.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_26": "Yanshu explains that the Qingfu pendant is the kind Nethermancers carry when entering a Mirage Realm, meaning the Cat of the Nether Lamp's clue likely points to one. Just as Yanshu seems to realize something, Yangyang arrives with the Xuanfang Wardens, bearing bad news: a nearby Censure Court has stopped functioning. The villagers need to be evacuated to Xuanfang Hold immediately. In that moment, Qingxiao looks toward Xuanfang Hold and senses the Celestial Ring Formation gradually grinding to a halt...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_3": "Please do not trouble yourself. We came to ask you about a pendant.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_4": "We found this inside Fogveil Pagoda.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_6": "The villagers said the copper coins on it have ties to Mengzhou's Nethermancers.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_7": "They do. They are \"Yin coins,\" said to speak between the <ano=the living and the dead>Yin and Yang</ano>. Nethermancers carry them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_8": "What exactly do Nethermancers do?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_111_9": "You have likely heard the ugly rumors. But in truth, they are a band of \"old-world relics\" who do not hold their own lives dear.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_120_1": "It isn't safe here! Everyone, get to the Sky Pier at Shaftpost Yard!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_120_2": "I will buy us time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_121_1": "A few Tacet Discords slipped past the formation already. I will deal with them swiftly.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_121_3": "I'll go with you. We need to keep the evacuation route clear.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_121_4": "Shaftpost Yard needs you more.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_121_5": "It'll be fine. Yangyang and the Wardens have that side covered.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_122_1": "The Wardens holding the line need backup.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_122_2": "Let's go.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_123_1": "The Tacet Discords inside the formation have been mostly cleared.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_123_2": "To the Sky Pier, then. Yangyang and the others must be ready to set off.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_124_1": "You're here! This is the last group of people. You should board the Skybarge too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_124_4": "There are still plenty of seats inside. Enough for everyone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_124_6": "There's no need. I will ride escort from the sky, in case anything goes wrong.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_124_7": "Under the Ministry's contingency plan, Commander Qiuhong has already set up a receiving party for those who left earlier.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_124_8": "No time to waste. Let's go.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_125_1": "Your Cloud Ride...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_125_2": "What about it?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_125_3": "The Ministry of War issued me one. I never could grow used to it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_126_1": "Signs of evacuation everywhere. Most people have already left.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_130_1": "(Pheeew... We finally got everyone to the Ministry of War in one piece.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_130_2": "You say that like you did it all yourself.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_130_3": "(Uh, I did stuff too! That kid's shoe? The old man's bag? Who zoomed into the middle of those TDs to snatch 'em back? Me, that's who!)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_130_4": "I know, I know. Everyone was quick on their feet this time. Soldiers and civilians both.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_130_5": "(Yeah, well, the same thing happened not long ago. Everyone has an idea of what to do now.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_131_1": "We really owe you for showing up this time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_131_2": "Don't mention it, brother. We're all here to defend Xuanfang Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_132_1": "Those Tacet Discords would have had me if not for Paragon Qingxiao's sword formation...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_133_1": "Strange. The control kernel is completely intact...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_133_2": "Looks more like it's been \"shut down.\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_134_1": "The warehouse should still have some medicine left. I'll fetch it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_134_2": "I'll send someone with you. Tacet Discords could show up along the way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_1": "Ngh... Mm...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_10": "...The pain will not trouble him for now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_11": "Thank you... Thank you!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_12": "Why do you not speak?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_13": "What did you just do?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_14": "That's a handy skill.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_15": "It is only a simple Quietude Art. It can help induce sleep, nothing more.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_16": "...It cannot dispel their true pain.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_17": "You still helped him, though.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_18": "Come. The Warden Commander is expecting you up ahead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_19": "He looks like he's really hurting.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_2": "Is the pain from his wound keeping him conscious? What did the Huaxu medic say earlier?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_20": "A family is tending to a badly wounded Xuanfang Warden who was hurt covering their escape. At a little girl's request, Qingxiao uses her Quietude Art to ease the soldier into peaceful sleep. You notice she seems a little downhearted, aware that her ability cannot take away the soldiers' true pain.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_3": "The wound is dressed, and it will not worsen. But... we've no medicine for the pain. He must endure for now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_4": "A young man barely in his first posting... He threw himself in front of us. Took those strikes so we wouldn't.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_5": "Lady Transcendent, please help him. Can you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_6": "I will.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_7": "Ah... It's... Paragon... Qingxiao...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_8": "...How pathetic. I've dragged everyone down again...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_140_9": "You did well. Now rest easy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_141_1": "How are things looking right now?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_141_2": "The contingency measures have proved effective. Only a few were injured during the evacuation, and most Tacet Discords remain outside the Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_141_3": "Still, we have taken a heavy blow. Even with aid from other cities, we are short on supplies.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_141_4": "We can't let this drag on. Our priority should be to find the source of this disturbance.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_1": "...The Hold's Autopuppets have all shut down. Even our defensive apparatuses, including the <te href=800049>Xuan Shield</te>, have failed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_10": "It is Hsin's residence, and the control mainframe of Xuanfang Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_11": "Precisely. There may have been a change inside. Looking back, we overlooked something in our earlier operations—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_12": "Tacet Discords and Autopuppets were not a concern within the Hold, so we assumed the Sanctum was safe. We posted only a handful of guards along the main approaches.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_13": "When the Ministry of War searched for Muyu's true body, did anyone search inside the Sanctum?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_14": "{PlayerName}, you mean... Muyu...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_15": "He might be hiding inside the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_16": "He might be hiding in plain sight.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_17": "During the fight... Muyu hinted that his attack on Xuanfang Hold had another purpose—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_18": "...Pathetic fools. You have guarded this Hold for over two hundred years, yet still you're blind to its fundamental nature.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_19": "I am but a single step away from my <b>destination</b>. Anything that stands in my way now is nothing more than a momentary diversion.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_2": "Holding the main gate is no longer viable. We must fall back, line by line, and rally everyone around the Ministry of War. It is the sturdiest ground we have left.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_20": "He sowed such chaos. Threw lives away... just so he could clear a path to the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_21": "During the Siege of Xuanfang Hold, all eyes were on the fierce battle around the main gate... The Sanctum could indeed have been infiltrated.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_22": "In any case, we should inspect the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_23": "We can't be sure yet, but too many signs point to the Sanctum: Muyu's escape. The Censure Courts shutting down. The Sentinel missing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_24": "It may well be the source of this disturbance. If we're lucky, we might find the truth and some trace of Hsin the Moon Fox there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_25": "I will go with you. The Sanctum's mechanisms are intricate and ever-shifting. A moment's carelessness could make you lose your way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_26": "Hsin once received me there as a guest. I can serve, at least, as a guide.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_27": "\"None may enter the Sanctum without the Sentinel's leave\" has always been the Hold's iron law. But now... we cannot afford to observe it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_28": "If the Mengzhou City Hall assigns blame afterward, I will bear full responsibility. Let them strip my rank again. It matters not. But...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_29": "The city's fortifications are not yet finished. I must ask you both to stay the night and leave at dawn. We can't be too careful.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_3": "Only a few Tacet Discords have slipped into the Hold so far. We still have time to set up our defenses... Ah, you're here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_30": "I'll see the rest of the preparations through with the Wardens. Come what may, we'll be ready.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_31": "{PlayerName}, you and Paragon Qingxiao should relax tonight. Prepare for whatever awaits you in the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_32": "Then I will rely on you, Yangyang.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_33": "...Qingxiao?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_34": "I have preparations to attend to.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_35": "You regroup with the Warden Commander and Yangyang to plan your next move. You suspect something may have gone wrong inside the Sanctum, the home of Xuanfang Hold's control mainframe, and that Muyu's true body could be hiding there, in the one place no one has searched. After discussion, you and Qingxiao are chosen to investigate the Sanctum while Yangyang and the others hold the line around the Ministry of War. Since defenses are not fully in place yet, you will rest for the night and set out the next day. Qingxiao slips away, apparently to make some preparations of her own...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_4": "Any word on what caused this incident?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_5": "Our tally shows nearly three in ten Censure Courts have stopped cold. The Ministry of Development has yet to determine why. This is not a simple malfunction.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_6": "Earlier, while patrolling near the Skyworks with the others, we ran into a pack of Tacet Discords that had just broken loose.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_7": "We fought our way through and found a nearby Censure Court shut down. Autopuppets fallen all around. It was as if every mechanism... gave out at once.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_8": "If anything could trigger anomalies of this magnitude, it would have to be...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_150_9": "The Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_1": "We meet again. Xuanfang has been anything but quiet this past while.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_10": "...It has been years since I last laid eyes on him. He said he wanted to travel the world alone. But for six months now, pastries and money have been showing up at home every so often.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_11": "I told myself it must be one of Sandao's old friends. Now I see that the boy must've been sneaking home all along, just can't bear to let me see him.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_12": "If I run into him, I'll send word.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_13": "Thank you. I hope Jing hasn't caused you any trouble. It's late now. You should rest.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_14": "Yes, I will.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_15": "I will after I take another look around.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_2": "Are you all right?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_3": "I didn't see you when everyone evacuated.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_4": "Bless you, child. Paragon Qingxiao looked after me well, and the young lady Yangyang was a great help too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_5": "You came at the right time... I've been thinking about that pendant. The knotwork looked familiar to me, like something my Jing would make.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_6": "Jing...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_7": "His full name is Jingran. Sandao and I raised him. He followed at Sandao's heels, learned what he could, and became a Nethermancer himself.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_8": "He's one too? Does the name \"Cat of the Nether Lamp\" mean anything to you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_151_9": "Heh... What a strange Jianghu moniker. Jing never spoke of it, but it does sound like something he would dream up.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_152_1": "Aw... I lost the little picture book the big brother gave me on the road.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_152_2": "What kind of big brother?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_152_3": "I met him near the village half a month ago. He wore a hat and had a grin like a bandit.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_152_4": "But he was so nice to me! He shoved a picture book into my hands before he left. It was about adventurers in some old desert city.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_153_1": "I wish Paragon Qingxiao could show me a few sword moves, then I wouldn't be afraid of Tacet Discords.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_153_2": "I'd rather learn how to play the qin...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_153_3": "I've been hearing her music a lot lately.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_154_1": "The wound has been dressed. I'll have someone take you inside the Ministry of War to rest shortly.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_154_2": "When the Tacet Discords had me surrounded, I swear I saw a light coming off me...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_154_3": "Maybe you need more examining... you're starting to spout nonsense.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_160_1": "(This is... the same music I heard after saying goodbye to Suisui.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_160_2": "(No, not quite the same. This time it sounds... sad.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_160_3": "(Open your eyes.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_1": "Couldn't sleep either, I see.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_10": "How are the wounded?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_11": "The Ministry of War has people looking after them. There's no need to worry.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_12": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_13": "We go to the Sanctum while the Wardens guard the Hold. Everyone agreed this was the best arrangement for now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_14": "Just as they trust us to do our part, we should trust them to do theirs.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_15": "...Xuanfang Hold should never have come to this. As the Xuan Paragon, I cannot shirk my duty here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_16": "The recent chain of incidents started with an abnormal Tacet Discord reading in one of the Censure Courts. I was on the investigation team.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_17": "I heard... you stayed behind to cover the retreat so they could escape the rogue Autopuppets.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_18": "...That was exactly what Muyu wanted.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_19": "He laid the trap. He split our ranks. He bet that I would go back for the soldiers dragged deep into the Courts.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_2": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_20": "Paragon Qingxiao. These Autopuppets cannot stop you. These Tacet Discords cannot defeat you. Even an entire Censure Court cannot bar your way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_21": "But... can the same be said of these Wardens? Frail. Trembling. Mortal.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_22": "So, stay to protect the weak and be buried by endless enemies, or walk away and save the next battlefield? Your choice.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_23": "Come to think of it, during the <b>Fortress and Gorges War</b>, did our great Sword Transcendent not choose to send a group of soldiers... to their deaths?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_24": "...I know this was the best everyone could do. But... there may have been a better choice...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_25": "We've already made our choice now, haven't we?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_26": "Now we just have to see this choice through. The same way you always have.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_27": "Think of all the people who are still here because you stayed true to that choice.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_28": "Tomorrow, we finish the investigation as fast as we can and rejoin the others. Then no more worrying. Not about Xuanfang, or these impossible choices.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_29": "...Very well.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_3": "So this is what you meant by \"preparations.\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_31": "(So... it's her.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_32": "Following the sound of a qin, you find Qingxiao playing in a pavilion near the Ministry of War. She is using the music to distribute protective Sword Intent to Xuanfang's soldiers and civilians as a safeguard. She explains why she arrived late to the earlier crisis: Muyu had set a trap, taking wounded soldiers hostage and forcing her to single-handedly fight off an entire Censure Court while protecting them. Now, with the Land of Xuanfang badly weakened and another crisis looming, Qingxiao cannot help blaming herself. Your words help her let go of her guilt and focus on what she can do now, sharing her Sword Intent with everyone who needs it. Under the bright moon, to the drift of her music, you stay quietly by her side...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_4": "Yes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_5": "Through music, I can pass a wisp of my <b>Sword Intent</b> to another.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_6": "I saw that same light in Xianling Village.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_7": "It is a sword without form, forged from my will. If danger comes, it will release Sword Energy to keep its bearer alive.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_8": "You're worried something may happen out here while we're in the Sanctum?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_161_9": "If more Censure Courts fall, it is hard to predict what may happen. A few safety measures put my heart at ease.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_162_1": "Was that... a taste of her Quietude Arts?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_163_1": "(Daybreak already. Time to head for the Sanctum.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_163_2": "(...I'll check in at the Ministry of War first.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_165_1": "(Everyone else is asleep. But the qin is still playing...)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_166_1": "(I'm getting closer. Whoever's playing should be nearby.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_1": "{PlayerName}, did you get enough rest? Paragon Qingxiao has been waiting for you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_10": "Ovathrax...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_11": "Only a small group could come, but they're elite Rangers. They will make a difference.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_12": "We can manage the Tacet Discords within the Hold. It's just... some strange mechanism parts have appeared nearby. Look—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_13": "It's like they spilled over from somewhere else into the Hold. The Ministry's Artisans examined them, and so far, they don't pose any danger.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_14": "I will complete the Sanctum investigation quickly. Once the situation is clear, I shall return at once.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_15": "If things get bad, don't risk yourself needlessly.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_16": "Mm. You too. I'll hold the line with everyone. Xuanfang Hold will remain standing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_17": "Yangyang.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_18": "This blade is shaped from my Sword Intent. It cannot break an army, but it should be able to protect you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_19": "Paragon Qingxiao... Please come back safe, both of you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_2": "I did.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_20": "The next day, you meet up with Qingxiao and Yangyang at the Ministry of War. Defenses around the Ministry are now complete, and a fresh unit of Midnight Rangers has arrived as reinforcement, though some abnormal modular parts have appeared nearby. After saying goodbye to Yangyang, you and Qingxiao set off for the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_4": "That's good. We don't know what awaits in the Sanctum, so conserve your strength.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_6": "Is everything all right here?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_7": "The surrounding defenses are complete. Many civilians volunteered to help. And another wave of reinforcements from Jinzhou just arrived.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_8": "So the Midnight Rangers showed up with backup.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_170_9": "Jinzhou answered at once, but recent activity from the Threnodian in the Norfall Barrens has tied down their main force.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_171_1": "These strange parts look as if the mechanism itself fell into a state of disorder.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_172_1": "A few Tacet Discords are here too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_172_2": "Let's make it quick.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_1": "Just as I expected, it's locked tight.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_10": "...Wait, what?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_11": "Hey, that coin pendant you picked up is reacting to your Resonance Ability!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_12": "...That door looks like a <ano=Sonoro Sphere>Mirage Realm</ano> entrance.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_13": "It connects to a passage. It may lead directly into the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_15": "...So this coin pendant is the key?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_17": "The one who left that pendant in the secret chamber must have foreseen that its finder would eventually seek out Hsin at the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_18": "Hmm... So that shady guy left you a side door into this fancy schmancy place on purpose. Where d'ya think he is now?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_19": "Maybe we'll find out once we're inside.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_2": "The Ministry of War has sent several parties here recently, and I came here as well, but there has been no answer from within.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_20": "Bleh... It stinks in there. So, uh, if there's nothing else, I'm headed back. Yell if you need me!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_21": "It appears we have no other path into the Sanctum. Let's go.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_22": "Well, here goes nothing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_23": "Stay on guard after we enter.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_24": "The Sanctum's gate remains sealed, and not even using your Resonance Energy to activate the Prism of Fate can force it open. Surprisingly, it activates the Qingfu pendant instead, revealing a hidden passage that appears to lead inside the Sanctum. It seems whoever left the pendant intended for you to find this way in. With no other option, you and Qingxiao enter.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_3": "It wasn't like this before?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_4": "In the past, Hsin would send an attendant to receive those seeking an audience. If She did not wish to see guests, She would say so plainly.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_5": "But now...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_7": "Looks like... that won't work.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_8": "In that case—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_180_9": "We break the gate open.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_181_1": "A compact Mirage Realm created by Resonance Ability. And I see quite a few Reverberations around us...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_182_1": "Give me a number. How many years of life to crack this passage open?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_182_2": "Half a year.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_182_3": "Hah... Greedier every time, ain't ya?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_182_4": "Take it or leave it. And keep your voice down unless you want him to find us!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_182_5": "Cough—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_182_6": "Oh, you rotten brat... Four months!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_182_7": "Deal.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_183_1": "Those voices...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_183_2": "The Reverberations must have captured them not long ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_1": "Conceal your presence.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_10": "...Muyu.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_11": "Oh? Seems there's no need to bar your way. Catch me... if you can.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_12": "That's my cue.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_13": "Catch ya... in the underworld.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_14": "They escaped.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_17": "I think so. Probably checking if I was worth working with. But with Muyu watching, he couldn't risk blowing his cover.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_19": "Look ahead, {PlayerName}.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_2": "This fog... has Reverberations mixed in with it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_20": "That's...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_21": "The control mainframe. It governs every mechanism in Xuanfang Hold, great and small. Reverberations have already eaten into it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_22": "Muyu used Reverberations to alter Autopuppet programming before. This looks like a similar trick.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_23": "Then this is where the disturbances we're now facing began.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_24": "...The Prism of Fate is flickering?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_25": "That man was testing your skill... Is he the Cat of the Nether Lamp?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_26": "Inside the Sanctum, you encounter Jingran, the Cat of the Nether Lamp, amid a thick fog. He attacks without warning. After a brief clash, you gain the upper hand, while Qingxiao faces off against a phantom projection of Muyu nearby. Muyu shows little interest in stopping you, and Jingran withdraws as well, apparently satisfied with merely testing your skill in battle. You discover that Xuanfang Hold's control mainframe has been corrupted by Reverberations and is likely the source of the disturbance. At that moment, the Prism of Fate begins to react...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_5": "...Someone is here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_6": "Well, well. Who dares trespass in the Sanctum?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_7": "You're...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_8": "Just a lackey on door duty.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_190_9": "Whew. No beating you, huh? I surrender.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_191_1": "...Careful!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_191_2": "Xuanfang Hold... is flying?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_1": "{PlayerName}, are you free right now?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_10": "Where is Suisui now? She hasn't left yet, has she?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_11": "She's with me... We're almost at the checkpoint to leave the Land of Xuanfang.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_12": "Wait for me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_13": "Wait for me. I'll be there right away.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_14": "Okay. We'll wait.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_4": "Friend sent a nudge",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_5": "What happened?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_6": "What's going on? Did something happen?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_7": "My sister...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_8": "She's about to go back to Mengzhou City!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_1_9": "Isn't that a bit sudden?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_1": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_11": "I wonder if Yangyang and the others in the Hold were affected. We need to find a way back.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_12": "My Terminal won't connect... It looks like the signal got cut off.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_13": "...Abby. Abby?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_14": "This valley is no ordinary place. It may not even be real.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_15": "Hsin's authority can cause all things to proliferate as fractal forms of themselves. It is not impossible.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_16": "There are signs of fighting all around us, as if a great battle occurred not long ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_17": "It shouldn't be like this...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_18": "Qingxiao?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_19": "We should leave the valley and find open ground.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_2": "(Did we fall all the way here from the air...? Why couldn't I fly with my wing?)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_20": "The Prism of Fate flickered, and we ended up here... Could this be something Hsin the Moon Fox is doing?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_21": "You lost me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_22": "...That is, she can make mechanisms multiply... or decrease.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_23": "Can the Hold's structures transform into what we just saw?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_24": "I have never seen such a thing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_25": "You shield Qingxiao as the two of you fall and crash to the ground. You wake one after another in an unfamiliar valley. Your Terminal is unresponsive, and Abby does not answer your calls. Traces of battle are scattered around, and Qingxiao senses something deeply off about the place. You decide to find higher ground to get your bearings.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_3": "Qingxiao... Are you all right?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_4": "Mm... {PlayerName}...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_5": "Are you all right?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_6": "...I'm fine. It happened so suddenly. The impact stunned me, that is all.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_200_7": "We were still inside the Sanctum only moments ago. But now...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_201_1": "More fallen Autopuppets. Wreckage from the Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_201_2": "Their condition is fresh... They were damaged in recent combat.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_202_2": "I see people up ahead. Let's ask them about this place.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_1": "Suisui... are you sure you won't stay a few more days?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_10": "Moreover, I plan to make full use of the Guild's connections and channels to dig into Zhuojun Atelier. Into Muyu.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_11": "Muyu... He fled the last battle inside a puppet vessel. We still don't know where his true body is, or what he's scheming.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_12": "For now, I'll join the Ministry of War patrols around Xuanfang Hold to search for any sign of him.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_13": "To think, that man sowed chaos on such a scale in Xuanfang, yet Mengzhou City Hall shows so little concern... Makes you wonder, doesn't it?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_14": "So you're going back to Mengzhou to try to find answers.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_15": "I am. That's where I shine. You have bigger fish to fry. Like tracking down a certain <ano=Hsin the Moon Fox>Mengzhou Sentinel</ano> I once made a deal with.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_16": "She never told me where She was, but I've always had the feeling She was close to Xuanfang Hold. And wouldn't you know...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_17": "The Sentinel is our best chance at understanding what's happening in Xuanfang.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_18": "You obtained Her token and saw her frequency at Fogveil Pagoda. If there are clues anywhere, they'll be there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_19": "Yes, you two chase down the leads here. I'll worry about Mengzhou. Divide and conquer.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_2": "Come now, don't give me that face, darling. When I'm gone, get plenty of rest, eat on time, and don't push yourself when things get hard. And...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_20": "Stay safe in Mengzhou City.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_21": "Be careful. This is bigger than it looks.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_22": "Relax, darling. I am esteemed Chairwoman of the <b>Zhaoming Commerce Guild</b>. The eldest daughter in a family of musicians. And... Yangyang's big sister!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_23": "I trust you, Suisui. But if anything happens that you can't handle alone, you need to contact us.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_24": "...I was really trying not to make a fuss.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_25": "...I grew far too fond of the time we all spent together. So before I leave, one last reminder—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_27": "Take care of Yangyang. If you let her get lost... you'll have to answer to me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_28": "Sister... I can hear you, you know...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_29": "Well then, let's say goodbye now. One of these days, I'll give you both a proper tour of Mengzhou!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_3": "There you are at last, {PlayerName}.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_30": "That qin music... I think I've heard it before.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_31": "...It sounds expectant. Like the person playing is waiting for something.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_32": "The Elseway Shroud I entered before has appeared again.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_33": "At the crossroads leading towards Mengzhou, you and Yangyang see Suisui off. Suisui plans to head to Mengzhou to gather intel on Mengzhou City Hall and Zhuojun Atelier, while Yangyang joins Ministry of War patrols around Xuanfang Hold. You, meanwhile, set out for Fogveil Pagoda, the place where Suisui once obtained a Prism of Fate, to search for leads on Sentinel Hsin. Just before you leave, you and Yangyang hear the distant melody of a qin...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_4": "Why didn't you leave a message?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_5": "I only just heard you're heading back to Mengzhou.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_6": "Well, I meant to slip away quietly. I didn't expect Yangyang to catch me halfway.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_7": "What, going to miss me already?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_8": "It's very sudden, that's all. Has something pressing come up in Mengzhou?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_20_9": "Nothing major. It's just now that I've found my little sister, and she's grown strong enough to stand on her own, I can relax and return to minding the Guild's affairs.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_210_1": "Hello! Good morning, Sword Transcendent!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_1": "Oh, Sword Transcendent, you've come down the mountain! Some time has passed since your last visit.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_12": "It happened about half a month ago. They said a Threnodian vanguard attacked. Tacet Discords blackened the land as far as the eye could see.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_13": "We thought we were doomed. But then the Shuttles came down, all together. In one day and one night, they destroyed every last monster.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_14": "That Threnodian was called Ova... uh... something. I can never quite remember the name.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_15": "...Ovathrax.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_16": "Yes, that's the one! Fancy name, sounded fierce enough. But in the end, the Shuttles and the Autopuppets still sent it running.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_2": "You are...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_3": "We saw something fall from the sky in the distance, so we came to take a look.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_4": "That something was us, actually.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_5": "Is that so... Can't say I've seen you before, {Male=sir;Female=miss}. Are you from outside Xuanfang?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_6": "Ah, I know. The Sword Transcendent brought you down in a <b>Cloud Shuttle</b> from the Hold, right?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_7": "What's a Cloud Shuttle?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_8": "You've not heard of them? The great airships flying overhead. If they had not fought in the battle a while back, we'd have been done for.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_211_9": "\"The battle a while back\"? I don't recall seeing any of these Cloud Shuttles before.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_212_1": "Ovathrax, Retroact Rain, and the Gorges of Spirits... They're talking about the battle that occurred years ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_212_2": "...The Fortress and Gorges War, two hundred years past.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_212_3": "If their perception of events is true, then we might be standing in some kind of illusion.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_213_1": "That grand structure... Is it the gate to Yuan Fortress?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_213_2": "A fortress built not with the Sentinel's wisdom or divine might, but by mortal hands.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_213_3": "Yangyang told me about it. A City of Mechanisms, built long before Xuanfang Hold. The Mengzhou Ministry of Development led it, and Zhuojun Atelier carried out the construction.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_213_4": "Then you know what became of it...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_213_5": "Yes. It was destroyed in the Fortress and Gorges War. A last resort to stop the Tacet Discords.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_214_1": "If only I'd known sooner! I'd have brought my sister along. How often does one get to meet a Transcendent?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_1": "The Sword Transcendent herself! What a surprise to see you here. Are you here to help someone?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_10": "Just follow this mountain road and you'll see it for yourself.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_2": "I would ask about \"the great battle\" that happened not long ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_3": "Ah, I only know bits and pieces. Grandfather, Grandmother, and I were too frightened to leave the house for those two days.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_4": "I heard two moons appeared in the sky above the Gorges of Spirits. And the rain was going up, not down.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_5": "Sounds like \"The Day of Twin Moons\" and Retroact Rain.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_6": "Yes, Retroact Rain! People who came back alive said they saw phantoms of the past. Even family who had long since passed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_7": "The Cloud Shuttles and Autopuppets weren't bothered by that strange rain. After they cleared the Tacet Discords in Xuanfang, they went on to the Gorges of Spirits and destroyed the source of the outbreak.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_8": "...Is Yuan Fortress still standing?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_215_9": "Sword Transcendent... Why do you ask? Yuan Fortress is fine, of course.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_219_1": "That's odd... Why is the mountain gate closed?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_1": "That's odd... Why is the mountain gate closed?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_10": "Sword Transcendent, it has been some time since we offered incense to you. Please do not worry. When the Tacet Discords came, the whole village took refuge in Yuan Fortress. Every soul is safe.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_11": "Then all is well.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_12": "If you wish to reach the Fortress, you will need to find another way. The mountain gate is closed today.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_13": "Near Yuan Fortress's mountain gate, an elderly woman and a young man tell you Jinzhou is soon to be established. Although, it appears the mountain gate is closed to visitors.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_2": "Heh. You're not from around here, are you, lad? The gate is under repair. No one will be allowed through for a while.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_3": "Oh, I see. I came from Taoyuan Vale to visit my brother. He's an Artisan in the Fortress.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_4": "Taoyuan Vale? Heard it's about to become part of a new city. Soon enough, you'll all be calling yourselves Jinzhou folk.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_5": "It is hard not to feel something. We traveled such a long way from Hongzhen to Taoyuan Vale. Now it finally feels like home.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_6": "...Jinzhou is about to be founded?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_7": "Are you talking about Jinzhou's founding?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_8": "Yes. The war is over. Mingting's decree has been proclaimed. Huanglong is soon to have its sixth city.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_220_9": "Excuse me, if I may ask... has Xianling Village fared well?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_1": "The elder's words were true. Yuan Fortress's gate remains closed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_10": "Ahhhh—! That almost killed me!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_12": "Is that... an Autopuppet?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_13": "Eep...! Mercy! Mercy!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_14": "I-I'm Jadie! I know I look suspicious, but please believe me! I'm here to help.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_15": "If you want to uncover the secrets of this place, find a way to get to the sky.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_16": "So those are Xuanfang Hold's Cloud Shuttles.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_17": "Yes! They're heading for the lightway that runs through the <b>Skyend Barrier</b>, up into the higher sky.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_18": "Skyend Barrier?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_19": "It may look like regular cloud and mist, but get up close and you'll see what it really is.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_2": "Locked out again. Shocking.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_20": "To catch those Shuttles, you need to head for that lightway... Go through the Barrier to reach the <ano=Human>Ren</ano> Realm...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_21": "This one has stopped functioning completely.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_22": "A puppet that talks. That's rare.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_23": "It talks. Too bad it was all riddles.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_24": "It laid out a route for us, at least... A fork nearby leads straight to that lightway.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_25": "As we were falling from the Sanctum, we saw Xuanfang Hold flying on those very Cloud Shuttles.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_26": "It could be lying or telling the truth. Either way, we need to see for ourselves.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_27": "Look! The Cloud Shuttles are coming!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_28": "It all appears so real... This is no ordinary Mirage Realm.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_29": "The gates of Yuan Fortress do not open. This Mirage Realm you and Qingxiao find yourselves in resembles the Land of Xuanfang from two hundred years ago and feels unnervingly real, except history has taken a different course here: Yuan Fortress was never destroyed in the Fortress and Gorges War. A mysterious Autopuppet calling itself Jadie appears before you and points you skyward, explaining that to catch up with the speeding Cloud Shuttles, you'll need to take a side path leading to a distant lightway. The moment it finishes speaking, it shuts down. You head for the path near the mountain gate.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_3": "You'd think doors would get tired of refusing us...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_4": "This resembles Xuanfang from two centuries ago, yet history has taken a different course. The Fortress and Gorges War left no deep wounds, and Yuan Fortress still stands.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_6": "The villagers we met all seemed to know you. They called you \"Sword Transcendent\"...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_7": "At this point in time, I hadn't yet accepted Hsin's request to serve as the Xuan Paragon. The \"Sword Transcendent\" title only came from an embellished tale.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_8": "With the gate closed, we either detour, or—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_230_9": "Wait, you mean to break it?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_240_1": "There are the Shuttles again. They fly toward the lightway.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_241_1": "Flying on a sword. And here I thought I'd seen everything.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_241_3": "Sword Flight is not as rare as you think. I've seen Magistrate Jinhsi and her counselor both possessing the skill.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_241_4": "...You know Jinhsi and Changli?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_241_5": "Shortly after the Magistrate took office, Counselor Changli visited Xuanfang Hold for a Ministry of War conference on regional defense. That was where I first met her.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_242_1": "The lightway is just ahead. Looks like this mechanism track will take us right up to it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_242_2": "This realm does not allow ordinary means of flight. Our fall taught us that.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_242_3": "What lies ahead demands vigilance.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_243_1": "Brace yourself. The lightway is just ahead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_250_1": "The power...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_250_2": "Here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_250_3": "Focus on the sword.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_250_4": "Remember, will and sword as one, that the edge follows your heart.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_251_1": "When all this is over, how about a few lessons?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_251_2": "...Teaching is not my strength. I once instructed a disciple of the Thunder Spells. She spent most of her time trying to escape.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_251_3": "Don't worry, I'll be the judge of whether your methods suit me. Plus, I trust you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_251_4": "...As you say.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_260_1": "I've passed the fundamentals of Sword Flight to you through my Sword Intent. But to master it, you still need to practice.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_260_2": "Guess I'm a quick study, huh?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_260_3": "You may credit your unique constitution and disciplined foundation in swordcraft.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_260_4": "My <b>Heart Sword</b> technique is simple: keep an unshaken will, and your Sword Intent will cut through anything.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_260_5": "So, does that make me your disciple now, Qingxiao?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_260_6": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_261_1": "I would not have believed it if I had not seen it myself. The mechanist craft of these Cloud Shuttles surpasses even that of the Xuanfang Hold we know.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_261_2": "Still, you can see the Hold's influence in their design.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_262_1": "Those Artisans ahead may know a thing or two.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_1": "Sword Transcendent? Why are you... If we had known you were coming, we would have prepared tea. And the young {Male=man;Female=lady} at your side is...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_12": "This is the City of Mechanisms built with the aid of Mengzhou's Sentinel, right?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_13": "Sentinel...? Forgive me, but I don't quite follow.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_15": "Sentinel Hsin, the Moon Fox. Isn't she the reason Xuanfang Hold and these Shuttles exist?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_16": "Why would you also—Never mind. I shall brief you on the recent tidings.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_17": "A <b>Transcendent</b> excelling in mechanist arts came to Xuanfang and taught us wondrous techniques. It was like learning how to turn stone into gold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_18": "Mountains, pebbles, pearls, rough stone—anything could be turned into a mechanism. And those mechanisms could evolve and replicate on their own. With that knowledge, the Ministry and Zhuojun Atelier raised this magnificent city in just a few months.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_19": "As for the Shuttles, they were first tested in real combat two weeks ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_2": "Just call me {PlayerName}.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_20": "We were on board, yet we barely had to lift a finger. They hunted and exterminated the Tacet Discords on their own.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_21": "And for the tight spots they couldn't reach, we deployed Autopuppets. Like soldiers falling from the sky, scouring the earth clean.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_22": "In a single day and night, from Yuan Fortress to the Gorges of Spirits, the Threnodian of War's vanguard was reduced to nothing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_23": "Now, our Shuttles provide reinforcement across all of Huanglong. One fleet has already left for the Norfall Barrens, to protect the newly founded Jinzhou City.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_25": "...I'd like to know more about this Transcendent.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_29": "Strange thing is, none of us can remember his face. Or his voice. Probably another one of his mystical tricks.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_3": "I'm the Sword Transcendent's very first disciple.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_30": "If you want answers, board the Shuttle at the head of the fleet. The Transcendent is staying there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_31": "Aboard a Cloud Shuttle, you question an Artisan who appears to be in charge and learn what has transpired. According to local accounts, a \"Transcendent\" recently appeared and taught the people miraculous mechanist arts, enabling the Ministry of Development and Zhuojun Atelier to build this Shuttle-borne Xuanfang Hold in mere months. Not long ago, the newly launched fleet wiped out a Tacet Discord outbreak unleashed by Ovathrax and won the Fortress and Gorges War without incident. The Artisan adds that the Transcendent is currently stationed on the foremost shuttle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_4": "A pleasure. Welcome to Xuanfang Hold—or rather, to the Cloud Shuttle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_5": "Ah, so you are under her tutelage... That is why she keeps company.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_6": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_7": "I remember you. You are Anyan.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_8": "Indeed, I am. I was once with the Ministry of Development's Defenseworks. Now, I serve on the Cloud Shuttle's maintenance crew.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_270_9": "Had you not held back the Tacet Discords when Yuan Fortress was first built, none of us would have lived to see Xuanfang Hold rise.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_280_1": "A Xuanfang Hold with no Sentinel, but a Transcendent who preaches mechanist arts...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_280_2": "Whoever he is, he's probably connected to Muyu.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_280_3": "To the lead Shuttle, then. Let's see who's really pulling the strings in this shadow play.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_285_1": "Those Autopuppets over there... They look like they're guarding the Shuttle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_286_2": "...It seems we've been flagged as hostiles.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_286_3": "Then we'll just have to cool their systems down.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_287_1": "These Autopuppets show no signs of malfunction, yet they attacked us without hesitation.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_287_2": "We'll know if this was just an isolated glitch at the next Shuttle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_287_3": "The airflows between the Shuttles are remarkably stable. Perfect for Sword Flight.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_287_4": "You mean...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_287_5": "Let's fly to the next one. Manifest a blade from your Sword Intent, then guide it at your will.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_288_1": "Your form is steady. You learn quickly. All you need now is more practice.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_290_1": "As we suspected. The first attack was no isolated incident.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_290_2": "Does this mean... the entire fleet is turning against us?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_291_2": "This mechanism looks like your sword formation.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_291_3": "Years ago, a Court of Savantae Artisan had me test a similar device designed to snare Tacet Discords.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_291_5": "I do not know its inner workings, but I know how to break it. Strike the \"core,\" the eye of the formation, with a flying sword.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_291_6": "I will handle this side. You take the other.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_292_1": "All change in this world is but a shift in frequency. When you face an obstacle, find its pivot. Strike true and your blade will do the rest.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_292_2": "The way you describe martial arts is always a bit... quaint.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_292_3": "...What I mean to say is, these mechanisms can be dismantled with flying swords.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_295_1": "This one is more intricate. You must locate all the cores.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_296_1": "This sword has a unique frequency.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_297_1": "(Looks like I'll need to form more blades with my Sword Intent to break it.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_1": "Ah, you came. Jing just stopped by to see me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_10": "Here, take this to him, please. Before he vanishes again. He's always had a sweet tooth for these.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_11": "Yanshu tells you Jingran stopped by to see her right after he returned, and that the Ministry of War even sent him an official commendation. He is currently out in a clearing in the nearby woods. She asks you to bring him some freshly made pastries.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_2": "Hard to say what that boy's been doing all these years. But the Ministry of War sent him an official commendation.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_3": "How did he look?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_4": "Oh... Not the best. But he flashed that sly grin of his when he saw me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_5": "Back when Sandao and I took him in, he was like a stray cat. Just fire in his belly and wild to the bone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_6": "Didn't happen overnight, but he simmered down eventually. No more talk about Mengzhou. No more talk about throwing his life away for his parents.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_7": "...His parents?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_8": "Ah, I've said too much. Happens with age. You'd best ask him yourself. He's out in the field by the woods nearby.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_10_9": "Perfect. I have something to return to him anyway.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_1": "It's been some time, {PlayerName}. I trust you've been well?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_10": "Liangyu passes along a message from Granny Yanshu: Jingran is back. You decide to go see him.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_2": "How's your recovery going?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_3": "Yangyang mentioned you've already returned to duty.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_4": "I have recovered. Yangyang was with me in the last battle, and we made a good team. A few close calls, but we came through unharmed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_5": "But on to pressing matters. Granny Yanshu asked me to pass you a message. She said, \"Jing is back. Do you want to see him?\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_6": "I see. I think I'll pay them a visit.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_7": "The Paragon's report to the Ministry of War mentioned a Nethermancer who has been a great help... That must've been him, right?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_8": "Do you know him?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_1_9": "Xianling is a small village. The young ones grow up together. You cannot help but know each other.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_20_1": "Hey, what's that ya got? Smells kinda scrumptious.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_20_2": "This is for someone else. Don't you be getting any ideas.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_20_3": "(Aww—what crummy luck!)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_2_1": "(I still have Jingran's Qingfu pendant. It's time to return it.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_30_1": "(The pendant is vibrating. He must be close by...)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_1": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_10": "You probably guessed already. This is that old score I told ya 'bout. The one I got with Muyu.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_11": "This is where your...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_12": "Relax, they're empty.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_13": "Couple decades back, Mengzhou had a real bad day. Some of the Atelier's Bladepuppets went haywire. Killed a bunch of folks. Two of 'em were Artisans. My parents.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_14": "After that? No family. Nothin'. Ended up on the street. Then Shifu found me, dragged me back here to Xuanfang.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_15": "Back then, all I wanted was to sneak into Mengzhou and cut the guts out of whoever did it. But he knocked me around, set me straight. Then he brought me here. Had me build these two graves. Empty ones.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_16": "Said, \"Kid, worry about moving forward first. You can settle scores when you're older.\" Ever since, whenever I start to lose my cool, I come here. Just... sit.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_17": "A few years later, I went back to Mengzhou to dig into what happened. The patrol records proved it—those Bladepuppets had Reverberation marks on 'em.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_18": "So I followed that thread... and it led me right to Muyu.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_19": "Guess I can finally tell my folks it's settled. Shame I can't give Shifu a proper thank-you. Face-to-face, I mean.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_2": "Hmph. Well, look who's here. Was gonna find you once I wrap things up.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_20": "...Why not?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_21": "The old coot made me promise that when he kicks it, no grave, no marker, no nothing. Tch, live clean, die clean. He locked himself away in some Mirage Realm, lamp and all.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_22": "Jingran, I think it's time... to give you this back.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_23": "Nah, keep it. Call it a souvenir. Thing ain't worth much, and the Resonance Energy stuck to it just burnt out anyway.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_24": "I mean, I could charge it up for ya. Maybe... three months. Tops.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_25": "Knock off throwing your life away, would you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_26": "Ain't many things in this world I give a crap about. But I gotta say, lately... I've finally met someone interesting.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_27": "Looks like the great Nethermancer, the \"Cat of the Nether Lamp\" himself didn't find any treasure this time. Just ended up losing a trinket.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_28": "Don't count my losses yet. I never do a bad deal.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_29": "Hmph.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_3": "Jingran, your eye...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_30": "...Already down to my last.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_31": "Are those... Reverberations?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_32": "They used to be people.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_33": "You find Jingran at a grave in the woods, and he opens up about his past. Years ago, Muyu triggered a Bladepuppet incident in Mengzhou that killed Jingran's parents—the reason he has hunted Muyu ever since. His master took him in when he was a homeless orphan bent on revenge, and taught him that vengeance need not be rushed. Jingran gives you his Qingfu pendant as a memento of your meeting. Together at a cliffside, you help him release the Reverberations of the dead, letting the departed finally find peace.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_4": "Huh? Oh, been stayin' up late. Readin' too much. Nothing Huaxu's miracle eyedrops won't fix, though.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_5": "Come on, be serious.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_6": "You're not fooling anyone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_7": "It's nothing, just told \"Mimi\" to collect a little extra this time. Not the first time, won't be last. It'll pass.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_8": "The boy runs his mouth. If I hadn't jumped in, you'd be down there playing cards with your Shifu already.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_40_9": "Heh, the old lady must've roped you into this. Thanks.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_1": "...Must survive... The truth is within reach...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_10": "All I need is time... Just give me a little more time... and the Sentinel's secret will be laid bare...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_11": "Two things you got wrong. First? You got nothing to bargain with. Second? Yeah, this thing's nice, but it ain't that nice... not to me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_12": "Hey, remember that Bladepuppet incident in Mengzhou... what, ten, fifteen years back?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_13": "Bladepuppet incident... what was that? I... do not recall...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_14": "Tch. Amazing the things you big shots forget. Or did your \"escape by execution\" stunt scramble your brains?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_15": "...Just who are you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_16": "Forget it, then. Don't matter.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_17": "But you'll remember this. The one who ends you... was just an ordinary peasant from Xuanfang.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_18": "...Humanity... could have been... perfect...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_19": "You stopped being human a long time ago. Where's the perfect in that?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_2": "There is still a chance... My path does not end here...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_20": "...Why didn't you stop me? Coulda squeezed him for more info, if you'd wanted.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_21": "Matters of revenge, only the wronged can decide.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_22": "Besides... his corpse is not without use.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_23": "Here. You lot'll put it to better use than me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_25": "It could be yours... For Nethermancers... No, for Xuanfang, it would mean everything...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_26": "As the previous crisis draws to a close, Jingran tracks Muyu to a garden somewhere in Xuanfang Hold. Muyu, having fled the last battle in puppet form, seems only a step away from uncovering the Sentinel's secrets. Muyu tries to make him an offer, but Jingran refuses, ending Muyu's life proudly as an ordinary citizen of Xuanfang. He then hands the technology core containing the Sentinel's data to Qiuyuan, who has just arrived in Xuanfang Hold. As the two men part ways, the garden slowly crumbles into ruin...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_3": "Whoa there. And where d'you think you're slitherin' off to—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_4": "Former Helmsmaster of the <te href=800056>Jianshui Branch</te>, Muyu?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_5": "Traitor... How did you find me?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_6": "Think I read about this in some old storybook. The old <ano=Bingjie>\"sacrifice the body, save the spirit\"</ano> trick?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_7": "You let someone cut you loose from your old shell, then slipped away in the chaos. Clever. Real clever.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_8": "But you went and bent your psyche into a Reverberation. You really think I couldn't track that? 'S kinda what I do.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_50_9": "I admit defeat... That core contains data on the Sentinel. Its worth is incalculable...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_1": "What's taking so long... Why isn't the contact here yet? Could the former Helmsmaster's arrangements have gone wrong...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_10": "I'm afraid I'll have to restrain you. Just a little.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_11": "Why you—?!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_12": "Shh. For your own sake, I recommend you save your breath.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_13": "Ah... Lady Suoming. What brings you to Xuanfang?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_14": "Don't misunderstand. I'm not here for the Atelier's affairs.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_15": "The Ministry of Sentinel Affairs governs the Sentinel's business. You being here... Could it be—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_16": "You already know all you need to know. Take care.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_17": "See you around, {PlayerName}... If we're lucky.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_18": "So, you are the Jinzhou Patroller seconded to Mengzhou?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_19": "At the crossroads leading into the heartland of Mengzhou, Yinlin, posing as a contact for Zhuojun Atelier, intercepts intel Muyu was sending to Mengzhou. Meanwhile, Suoming of the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs arrives in Xuanfang, seemingly on business tied to Mengzhou's Sentinel...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_2": "Don't lose your head. If something has changed, we will simply report to headquarters ourselves.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_3": "Aw, didn't see me here?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_4": "You're the contact for the Zhijiang Branch?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_5": "Spare me the little tricks. You were waiting for the Jianshui Branch. What, do I not look the part?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_6": "Uh... \"Windingflow Vessel\"?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_7": "\"Hundredfold Assemblage.\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_8": "Pardon our disrespect. You came at the right time. We have <ano=Muyu>the former Helmsmaster's</ano> manuscripts from his time in Xuanfang, and a recent secret letter.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_2_60_9": "Top-notch work, fellas. The Grand Helm will definitely know your names after this. No time to waste, you'll be coming with me. Except...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_1": "...Are you the legendary Sword Transcendent from the mountain?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_10": "But... why would I see Ruoyun here?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_11": "You find a sword embedded upright in the ground. The frequency clinging to it conjures a vision of the past: a young girl named Ruoyun, guided up the mountain by a Xuanling Bird, once sought out Qingxiao and pleaded with her to quell the Tacet Discord outbreak threatening the village.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_2": "I am not the one you seek.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_3": "If not you, then who else could it be?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_4": "Please, Sword Transcendent. The Tacet Discords are coming! Can you help us? They roam the Clouded Cliffs and are almost at our village!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_5": "Lead the way. And your name is...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_6": "Ruoyun. Ruo as in \"if,\" Yun as in \"cloud.\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_7": "What I saw just now, was it a memory from your past?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_8": "Yes... that girl was the Court of Savantae Artisan I mentioned. She grew up in Xianling Village.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_300_9": "When I first came to the Land of Xuanfang, the Xuanling Birds guided her up the mountain to seek my help. She returned often after that, though usually on behalf of others.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_302_1": "Well done. Leave the final core to me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_303_1": "Qingxiao, you've been trying to teach me this whole time, haven't you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_303_2": "Was it that obvious? I told you, I'm not good at this.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_303_3": "Quite the opposite, actually. Come on, let's keep moving.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_304_1": "Sword Transcendent? We didn't expect to see you here. This way, please!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_305_1": "The Artisans here seem completely blind to the rogue Autopuppets.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_1": "That sudden rampage from the Autopuppets caught us off guard. It's like their alert systems just triggered for no reason.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_10": "Hmm... haven't seen anyone by that name, no. But we did host a Transcendent recently. Helped us solve a few technical hurdles.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_11": "I can't remember much else about him... Only that he had an answer for everything. No airs about him at all.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_12": "We've been looking for him.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_13": "I heard he's on the lead Shuttle now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_14": "If you are heading that way, could you check on a friend of mine? She's sitting at the bow, watching the scenery.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_15": "She's been acting very strange lately. It's like she's lost interest in everything and everyone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_16": "Most of the Artisans aboard the Cloud Shuttle appear indifferent to the Autopuppets' unrest. From Shitang and Chigong, you learn that many Artisans have been acting strangely lately, even admitting to themselves that something feels wrong. Shitang asks you to check on a friend of hers who has seemed particularly listless recently.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_2": "...It seems only you two noticed what was happening.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_3": "It's working hours. We can't just abandon our posts.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_4": "Is your job really that important?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_5": "It's more like a habit. When we are assigned to a Shuttle, we tend to lose ourselves in the work.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_6": "Though now that you mention it, more and more of us have been working around the clock. Some don't even know when to stop anymore.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_7": "It is strange... My mind has been hazy for a while. I don't feel much of anything lately.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_8": "That happened to me as well. I can't even enjoy a good novel like I used to.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_306_9": "Have you met a certain Transcendent who teaches mechanist arts? Does the name \"Muyu\" sound familiar?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_307_1": "So... this Xuanfang Hold isn't as perfect as it seems.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_309_1": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_309_2": "Are you alright?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_309_3": "I watched the sunrise earlier. My memory told me it was beautiful, but I felt nothing. Just emptiness.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_309_4": "I can no longer feel as a human should. It is as if I've become just another gear in this Shuttle's mechanisms.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_309_5": "What if... I jumped?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_309_6": "...I will not, of course. But the thought does not trouble me. Nothing does.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_309_7": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_309_8": "[You try to press for more, but she falls into a heavy, dead silence.]",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_10": "I did not. I do have something to ask of you this time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_11": "Paragon Qingxiao, should disaster one day befall Xuanfang Hold, I hope you will raise your sword for its people.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_12": "Should the tide become irreversible, then you may exercise <ano=Sentinel>my</ano> authority in my stead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_13": "You... What has happened?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_14": "Qingxiao accepts your charge.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_15": "With you here, I am at ease. Perhaps soon... you will find the <b>answer</b> to that which you have asked the heavens.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_16": "...Where will you go now?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_17": "Shh. That is still a secret.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_18": "So the time has come.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_2": "...<b>Hsin</b>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_20": "Let us descend the mountain.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_21": "Now it feels exactly like the day we first met.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_22": "Qingxiao the Transcendent? Little, Qing, Xiao—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_23": "High in the mountains, Qingxiao sits in quiet meditation, playing her qin, when she catches a Rafter Kite and recognizes it as a messenger from Hsin the Moon Fox. The sight stirs a memory—Hsin once came to her in person, entrusting her with the safety of Xuanfang Hold's people and granting her the authority to act in the Sentinel's stead, should the situation ever reach a point of no return. Sensing that the time has come, Qingxiao sets out at once for Fogveil Pagoda, determined to find the long-missing Hsin.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_3": "...Qingxiao the Perfected? Are you there?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_4": "I am listening.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_5": "So, when will you finally consider moving to Xuanfang Hold? I've even had a quiet room set aside for you in the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_6": "No need to hide away on this cold, lonely mountain. Hm... the damp is getting to my tail.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_7": "This place is quiet. Remote. Free from worldly disturbance. It suits cultivation.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_8": "That answer again.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_30_9": "...Hsin. You did not come only to chat.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_1": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_10": "What is done is done.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_11": "Don't lose yourself in a past that never was.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_12": "This can't be called a better world. Everyone we've met here isn't in a normal state of mind.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_13": "That \"Transcendent\" isn't just handing out lessons. I think he's done something to them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_14": "Mm. Onward, then.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_15": "Something is suppressing their feelings.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_16": "Qingxiao confides that, as far as she can recall, most of the Artisans aboard this Shuttle are among those who perished when Yuan Fortress self-destructed. Back then, the last Artisans and soldiers holding the Fortress had no choice but to detonate it to prevent the Tacet Discords from reaching Mengzhou. Qingxiao had been in the Gorges of Spirits supporting local forces at the time, and by the time she returned to Xuanfang, Yuan Fortress was already in ruins, and with it, those who had made their final stand there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_2": "What's wrong?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_3": "I remember these people. Most of the Artisans on these Shuttles died when Yuan Fortress was destroyed during the war.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_4": "And they are only alive here because this Xuanfang survived it?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_5": "Yes. In the world we know, the soldiers and Artisans defending the Fortress detonated it themselves. A final sacrifice to stop the Tacet Discords from overrunning Mengzhou.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_6": "Were you there when it happened?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_7": "No. I was... with the defending troops in the Gorges of Spirits.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_8": "By the time I returned to Xuanfang, the Fortress was already in ruins.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_310_9": "If only I had been faster. If only this version of Xuanfang were real... everything could have been different.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_311_1": "So this is how that Transcendent treats his guests, hm?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_312_1": "Careful!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_312_2": "...Nearly lost my footing there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_312_3": "Follow the airflows ahead. Navigate your sword to get closer.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_313_1": "We can use this Shuttle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_314_1": "Keep your stance steady. These attacks cannot touch you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_1": "Oh... Did you forget I gave you a locator back at Shaftpost Yard?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_10": "?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_11": "Forgot what?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_12": "A little gesture, nothing more.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_13": "Yangyang's share is in there too. I'll leave it with you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_2": "Anytime you miss me, just take a peek. A little insight into my comings and goings, hm?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_3": "...I don't think that's appropriate.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_4": "No. I'll contact you first.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_5": "That was a unique situation. I needed to know where you were and if you were still alive. But now...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_6": "If I need to check on you, I'll reach out first. Using that to see where you are should be for emergencies only.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_7": "All right, I was only teasing, darling. I know how you are. The locator has a range limit anyway, so it'll be useless once I'm in Mengzhou City.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_31_9": "Speaking of which... I left in such a hurry that I forgot.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_1": "At last, you arrive. I hope my little \"roadblocks\" weren't too much trouble for you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_10": "Those Artisans are shadows of the past. I offered them a kindness— adjusted their perception, excised their emotional flaws. Now they are on their way to becoming perfect.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_12": "You should understand, Qingxiao. A heart unsullied by desire or feeling, is that not the ideal state you Cultivators chase?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_13": "Cultivation is not about making oneself an unfeeling lump of wood.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_14": "Lump of wood...? No, no. This is perfection. Xuanfang Hold as it was always meant to be.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_15": "Everything you see runs itself. Perfect order. Perfect efficiency. With mechanisms like these, we could fight another Fortress and Gorges War and lose no one.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_16": "I am sick to death of those \"Hero Plays\" about devotion and sacrifice.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_17": "They stir the heart, yes. But that is all they do. The weak swallow them because the truth is too bitter to bear.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_20": "You have no right to judge them, Muyu.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_21": "Heh... I built Yuan Fortress. I understand the limits of humanity far better than powerful Resonators like you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_22": "When the Fortress fell, when our struggle meant nothing against the Lament, the one meant to \"guide civilization\" just stood there. Watching.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_23": "The Xuanfang Hold you see now? This is what it was supposed to be. I just restored it from the blueprints in the database. Which is to say—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_24": "It could have changed the course of the war. So what do you think? Did our Sentinel Hsin lack the power? Or... did She lack the will?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_25": "Suspect the Sentinel all you want. Your fall from grace is your own doing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_26": "All I see is a coward hiding in a Mirage Realm, running experiments that are only fooling himself.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_27": "Wherever your true body is hiding, I will find it. And I will end you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_28": "I look forward to it. There's just one thing...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_29": "Where did you get the idea that this place couldn't affect reality?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_30": "The so-called \"Transcendent\" proves to be Muyu, as expected. He is using this Mirage Realm as his personal laboratory, rewriting the memories of the departed Artisans to construct a perfect \"Xuanfang Hold as it was always meant to be.\" He informs you that every Cloud Shuttle here was rebuilt from technical blueprints already in the database, blueprints Hsin the Moon Fox could have used to change the course of the Fortress and Gorges War, yet chose not to...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_4": "And where is that ignorant, chattering little girl? The strike she landed last time... It left an impression.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_5": "I will grant you a swifter end this time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_6": "Easy now, Sword Transcendent. Surely you realize I am but a phantom.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_7": "Why not stay for a chat? You must have questions. I would be disappointed if you didn't.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_8": "What have you done to the minds of the Artisans in this Mirage Realm?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_320_9": "This is Xuanfang as I have shaped it. A better version of what stood here two hundred years ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_325_1": "The fog disrupts the stability of our Resonance Abilities.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_325_2": "Skywatch Lancers... Another Autopuppet series that never made it past the prototype stage.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_326_1": "You've seen these before?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_326_2": "They were Ruoyun's work, too. She asked me to test them once, and I ended up shattering the prototype.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_1": "Aaagghh! Those traitors are such big bullies! Lucky for me you showed up again! Thanks for saving me!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_10": "The sky here is split into levels. Right now, we're in the <ano=Human>Ren</ano> Realm. Up there will be the <ano=Earth>Di</ano> Realm.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_11": "Why is this Mirage structured in such levels?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_12": "Because it's extra special! Don't worry, you're super close to the source of it all now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_13": "But I do have some bad news. Things are getting messy in the Hold outside.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_14": "You mean the real Xuanfang Hold?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_15": "Mm-hmm. A lot of evil things are swarming toward it as we speak. If you take too long, things might get really bad.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_16": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_17": "Ah! I just ran out of juice. Lucky me, I woke up and found some spare power cells from the others. Then I flew all the way here!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_18": "You know things we don't, and it's clear you've been keeping them from us this entire time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_19": "...If I could help it, I wouldn't want to be like this either.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_2": "You're the one from Yuan Fortress...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_20": "If you're after that creepy one‑eyed jerk, just keep heading up, up, up!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_21": "You rescue Jadie from an Autopuppet attack. It appears to have just caught up with you. Jadie directs you higher into the sky, toward the \"Di Realm.\" Pressed for more information, Jadie hesitates, clearly torn, but admits that conditions in the real Xuanfang Hold are deteriorating.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_3": "Hello again, little riddle-box.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_4": "Yep. You two are so fast. Took me forever just to catch up to you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_5": "Call me Jadie. That's my name now. You two are too fast. Took me forever just to catch up to you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_330_6": "The Fortress gate is indeed far from here. We thought you had gone offline when we left.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_1": "Commander Qiuhong's Rafter Kites have detected a large Tacet Discord swarm approaching from the eastern peaks. All units, prepare to engage!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_10": "Word is, those roaming Tacet Discords have begun to close in on the Hold. I will not let you face this alone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_11": "We will fight together. The new Xuan Triad... Well, duo, for now. I will not let Qingzhi and Duzhong down.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_12": "Yes. Shoulder to shoulder, once more.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_13": "The villagers... are they safe?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_14": "Don't worry. Even the final stragglers have been evacuated behind the defensive line.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_15": "Huh? What is that...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_16": "Watcher—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_17": "An urgent report from the Ministry of Development. Another Censure Court has just gone offline.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_18": "I see... Thank you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_19": "Conditions around Xuanfang Hold continue to worsen: more Censure Courts have gone dark, and Tacet Discord hordes are closing in. As Yangyang rallies the vanguard troops before battle in her new role as Xuan Watcher, Liangyu returns, recovered and ready to fight alongside her. Together with the soldiers, they prepare to meet the oncoming hordes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_2": "I will intercept the biggest threats. Vanguards, stick to the formation we practiced. Do not break ranks.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_3": "Yes, Watcher Yangyang!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_4": "{PlayerName}, Paragon Qingxiao... It's been so long...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_5": "Please, please come back safely.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_6": "Think I'd let you fight without me, Yangyang?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_7": "Watcher Liangyu, reporting for duty.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_8": "Liangyu? But your injuries...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_340_9": "Do not worry. My injuries have mostly healed. I was only staying at the Ministry of War because the medics insisted on quiet rest.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_1": "I know you're here to save the Hold. You don't need to trust me, but I'm trusting you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_10": "Please, Qingxiao. You both have to keep going.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_11": "Jadie asks you to press on without it, warning you to beware of the Di Realm's Reeling Fog, and claiming time to make preparations before rejoining you. You head for the lightway leading into the Di Realm.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_2": "I never told you my name.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_3": "I, uh—I heard that one‑eyed jerk say it. Ahem... anyway! Once you enter the <ano=Earth>Di</ano> Realm, watch out for the <te href=800050>Reeling Fog</te>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_4": "The Reeling Fog?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_5": "It makes your head all spinny. You ran into a bit of it earlier.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_6": "Are you not coming with us?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_7": "I'd just slow you down. But don't you worry! I'll catch up as soon as I'm ready!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_341_9": "It is true your words have not been false.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_350_1": "That's Cloud Shuttle wreckage scattered among the cliffs.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_350_2": "So, not as perfect as Muyu made it out to be. The next level is probably going to be a mess.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_351_2": "(...Guess I'll just leave it here.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_352_1": "(That's about all I can do for now. Time to go play nice with the crazy man.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_352_2": "Are you sure they will find that little breadcrumb you left?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_352_3": "Sure? Nah. But you don't win bets by not playing. And so far, I'm on a roll.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_1": "You've been gone for quite a while.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_10": "Before, I proved that Reverberations could influence an Autopuppet's behavioral logic. Now, I have gone a step further...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_11": "Reverberations can drive a shell entirely on their own. Granting it new life.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_12": "Waking the dead from their nap? You sure they won't have a bone to pick with you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_13": "I have adjusted their perceptions. Scrubbed away the redundant emotions and petty desires.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_14": "Progress takes time. For now, they are just the \"intermediate products\" of my experiment.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_15": "Which is why I need a small favor... Dispose of that sample for me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_16": "I agreed to help you out, Grand Helm's orders. I didn't agree to being your trash man.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_17": "...How dull.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_18": "Impressive. A necessary cost, nothing more. One must discard the defects to make room for perfection.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_19": "I guess you know that {PlayerName} and the Paragon have entered this Mirage Realm. Doesn't that concern you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_2": "Not every day I get to hitch a ride on a fancy airship like this. Had to do a little sightseeing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_20": "...That \"fox\" actually did us a favor.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_21": "Hah. Well, you'd better pray when they find you. I'm not sticking around to fight them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_22": "Guardians always suffer from the same delusion. They think that if they strike down the mastermind, the problem vanishes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_23": "But the end was decided long ago. Until the time is right, I shall let them play their little game.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_24": "(Boy. Why have me save the Reverberation from that broken puppet? Keeping it as a souvenir?)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_25": "(Just let it go. Same as always.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_26": "Not quite alive, and not quite dead. This really what you wanted?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_27": "Trifles no longer trouble them, so they have no reason to care about things like that.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_28": "Not long ago, the Cat of the Nether Lamp meets with Muyu aboard a Cloud Shuttle. Muyu asks for his thoughts on the Reverberations of the dead, then demonstrates how a Reverberation can drive an Autopuppet entirely on its own. Once the Autopuppet stirs to \"life,\" Muyu orders him to dispose of it. The Cat of the Nether Lamp outwardly complies with Muyu's test, but secretly preserves the Reverberation instead...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_3": "Hmph. I'm interested to know what the Reverberations of the dead mean to a Nethermancer like yourself?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_4": "Still hung up on that? They're just lingering obsessions.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_5": "To me, they are the raw materials of transcendence. <b>Resources</b> to be shaped as I see fit.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_6": "Where... am I...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_353_7": "You are on a Xuanfang Hold Cloud Shuttle. Get acquainted with your new body. Go on.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_354_1": "By the way, still no sign of that Cat of the Nether Lamp. But since he was at the Sanctum with us, he must've been pulled into this Mirage Realm too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_354_2": "If he has not blown his cover, he should be with Muyu.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_360_1": "This must be the Reeling Fog Jadie warned us about. We shouldn't stay in it for long.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_360_3": "Do you hear that? The Autopuppets nearby are speaking.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_360_4": "They are not hostile.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_361_1": "Watch out. Something's not right. The fog... it's getting thicker.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_361_2": "Rogue Autopuppets... too many. Tacet Discords... attack.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_362_1": "Village ahead... No entry...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_362_2": "I... protect... village...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_363_1": "The cut on this Autopuppet is clean. It has not been down for long.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_363_2": "The frequency left on it feels like the Cat of the Nether Lamp's Resonance Ability. Probably his work.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_365_1": "These mechanisms have been corrupted by the fog, but our flying swords can still dismantle them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_366_1": "It is as if... they live here as people do.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_1": "Thank you... breaking seal. Here... our village. I... Chief.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_10": "We fled back to the village during the chaos. Not long after, we were trapped by these strange mechanisms.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_11": "Many villagers were left out there... If you leave, could you help them?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_13": "Thank you. I just remembered... a young lass I did not recognize left a sword here. She said to give it to the outsiders who would come.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_15": "...Muyu implants the Reverberations of the deceased and binds them to these shells. Forces them to \"live\" like this.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_17": "Another one of his sick experiments. What he did in the Ren Realm... this goes much further.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_18": "...Huff.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_19": "You don't... look well.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_2": "...Well, I think I'm fluent.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_20": "I'm fine. It will not hinder our mission.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_21": "Did she have any distinguishing features?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_22": "Forgive me, I can no longer recall her face. Let me fetch the blade for you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_23": "We should examine that sword. It is likely the one we have seen before.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_24": "Aboard a Cloud Shuttle in the Di Realm, you stumble on an unusual \"Autopuppet village\" where its inhabitants appear to live ordinary lives like regular villagers. With the pendant's help, you see the truth: they are all souls of the departed, another one of Muyu's cruel experiments, it seems. While the Autopuppet village chief retrieves a sword left behind by someone, you notice Qingxiao appears unwell...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_3": "Why is there a village in a place like this?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_4": "We... have no home. We... gather here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_5": "It carries Reverberations, just like the Autopuppets Muyu controlled during the Siege of Xuanfang Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_7": "...Seems I can speak normally now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_8": "Much has faded from my mind. But I remember being human. I lived in Xianling Village long ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_370_9": "Do you remember what happened back then?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_371_1": "Its frequency resembled my own Sword Intent...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_1": "Sword Transcendent, I have come to bid you farewell. It was Lingfang who finally convinced me to do this.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_10": "What you saw just now was the day Ruoyun came to say goodbye.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_11": "Where did she go after that?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_12": "The Fortress and Gorges War broke out soon after. She was in the squad tasked with the Fortress's self-destruction.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_13": "Later, I returned to the ruins to search for her... I found nothing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_14": "The frequency on the sword reveals a memory of Ruoyun bidding farewell to Qingxiao. Qingxiao tells you the Fortress and Gorges War broke out soon after, and that Ruoyun was among those who carried out Yuan Fortress's self-destruction.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_2": "Where are you going?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_3": "I am staying in Xuanfang Hold. The construction is nearing completion. I just... wanted you to know.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_4": "I love this land. I love the people here. I want to use my mechanisms to give everyone the strength to protect themselves.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_5": "That way... I will not have to keep sending Xuanling Birds to beg for your help.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_6": "I have a question. If you spend your life chasing a goal so difficult that it has already cost you dearly, is it still worth it?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_7": "...I cannot answer that for you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_8": "That's alright. I have plenty of time ahead of me to think about it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_372_9": "Farewell... Qingxiao.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_374_1": "...Onward. We should be able to break this seal together.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_375_1": "Autopuppets are attacking those \"villagers.\" We should help them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_376_1": "Thank you. Some friends... they are trapped on the Shuttle ahead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_376_2": "Something went wrong with the Shuttle's mechanisms. It sent the Autopuppets into a blind rampage... we couldn't stop them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_376_3": "We'll handle things there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_376_4": "You are from the world outside, aren't you? How is Yuan Fortress now?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_376_5": "...What do you mean?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_376_6": "I... I remember defending that Fortress. So many of us... we did our best. But the Tacet Discords were endless. Tell me... did we lose?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_376_7": "You did not. It was your sacrifice that ensured two centuries of peace for Xuanfang.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_376_8": "That's good... Somehow, my chest does not feel quite so empty.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_377_1": "There are no Reverberations bound to the Autopuppets that attacked the villagers.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_377_2": "Muyu must have been controlling them directly, just as he did back in the Ren Realm.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_379_1": "Why... why did you save me?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_379_2": "I can move now. But... I don't know where I should go...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_381_1": "This is... a note left by the Cat of the Nether Lamp.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_381_2": "He's been through here. He made sure to leave this intelligence for us.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_382_1": "The Autopuppets up ahead look like they're repairing those heavy artillery pieces...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_383_1": "So, Qingxiao. Between that cannon and your flying swords...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_383_2": "...Within a hundred paces, the sword is faster.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_385_1": "(They all have a flame‑like frequency, same as before. I'll use the pendant to reveal their true forms.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_386_1": "(Those unique frequencies again. I should use the pendant.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_387_1": "Go on ahead. I'll stay to maintain the Xuan Bombards.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_387_2": "I will not let any rogue Autopuppet get past this point.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_388_1": "No enemies around. Xuan Bombards... I fix.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_389_1": "I must restore the Xuan Bombards before the next wave of rogue Autopuppets arrives.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_389_2": "Xuan Bombards?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_389_3": "A Cloud Shuttle's most advanced defense system. It can track and fire on multiple hostile targets at once.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_389_4": "Think of it as a very powerful automated cannon.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_389_5": "Almost there... I will fix them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_390_1": "Ugh...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_390_2": "Let's stop and find somewhere to rest.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_390_3": "Okay. Let us board that looming Shuttle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_1": "Welcome aboard this Cloud Shuttle, modeled after the Ministry of War headquarters. Though, as you can see, it no longer requires the service of human soldiers.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_10": "They were nothing but Reverberations haunting the ruins of Yuan Fortress. Left alone, they would have inevitably devolved into Tacet Discords.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_11": "But now, they serve a great experiment. If Reverberations can be perfectly fused into mechanical shells, the line between life and death vanishes. Immortality becomes possible.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_12": "If the shell wears out, we replace it. As long as consciousness remains, life is not extinguished. Death becomes obsolete, and the dead may rise once more.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_13": "Is this also Zhuojun Aterlier's true purpose?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_14": "Then, the Séance Society...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_15": "Please. The <b>Flowerveil Puppet</b> sees nothing beyond Mengzhou's gilded little playground. Do not compare me to that narrow-minded woman.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_16": "Ah, an amusing name. That little Jinzhou organization has not even come close to understanding the nature of the soul. They only use memories to fashion mockeries of life.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_17": "Their <te href=750058>Dollmaker</te>... A third-rate puppeteer. A man so mired in his own past that a few offhand remarks, and I saw the weakness eating him from the inside.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_18": "How about we discuss a topic you find more pressing? Say... the Ministry of War in the real world?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_19": "Take a guess. As the Censure Courts continue to release Tacet Discords, how long do you think those Wardens can hold the line?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_20": "They might survive the wave from one Court. But two? Three? Even if they hold, what will it cost?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_21": "You underestimate the people of Xuanfang. Just as you never understood what they fight for.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_22": "Hmph. You cling to the fragility of emotion and human will. Blind to the truth that only in superior technology will you master your fate.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_24": "...Xuanfang Hold and its people will survive.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_25": "No matter how great you are, Paragon Qingxiao, you cannot protect those beyond your reach.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_26": "They will break soon enough. All I am doing... is accelerating the inevitable shutdown of the Censure Courts.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_27": "When you confront him, Muyu's phantom reappears and lays out his \"resurrection of the dead\" experiment. In his view, every Autopuppet currently hosting a Reverberation is a failed specimen, which is why he has been sending other Autopuppets to destroy them. He tries to pressure you by revealing how dire the real Xuanfang Hold has become, but Qingxiao remains certain that everyone will make it out alive.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_5": "Muyu... you've bound the Reverberations of the dead to these machines, but you still send Autopuppets to hunt them down. Why?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_6": "Because they are failed experiments.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_7": "Failing minds, faded memories, with nary a shred of self left to act on their own... It is time for a fresh batch of samples.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_8": "You defile the souls of the innocent treating them as disposables for your experiment.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_391_9": "I prefer to call it... \"resource optimization.\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_392_1": "Thank you. I... continue the repairs.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_39_1": "Hmph... Ugh... Pretty sure I just heard Yangyang. Did she leave already?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_39_2": "Up at last? Suisui's already on her way to Mengzhou City, and Yangyang's out on routine patrol.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_39_3": "Aw, what? Everyone's gone... So where are you off to, then?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_39_4": "Fogveil Pagoda, where Hsin's frequency appeared before.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_400_2": "As the heart wills, so the sword moves.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_400_3": "Victory will be ours!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_1": "You... what have you done?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_10": "Muyu's illusion being here means we're closing in on his real location.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_11": "You look pale. Leave the rest of the fighting to me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_12": "You need not worry about me... Keep your focus on the enemies.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_13": "Once you confirm Xuanfang's soldiers and civilians have launched a counterattack, you push past Muyu's phantom without a second glance. Muyu is stunned to learn Qingxiao shared her Sword Intent with nearly everyone across Xuanfang. His phantom vanishes abruptly, and you are forced to fend off another wave of Autopuppets while Qingxiao appears increasingly exhausted...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_2": "This can't be... your frequency is all but drained...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_3": "This whole time, that unique frequency the Shuttles detected affecting the real world... that was you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_4": "How many are you propping up? The garrison? The entire city?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_5": "Or could it be... the Land of Xuanfang itself?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_6": "You are even more foolish than I thought, Sword Transcendent. Do you really think you can shield them forever?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_7": "You of all people should know how fragile human lives are compared to a Resonator's. Xuanfang Hold will fall, and those people will fall with it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_8": "You cannot change what is coming. Everything you are doing is just piling more weight on your own—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_405_9": "...Hm?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_406_1": "You said the Sword Intent you shared could only release one burst of Sword Energy. But now...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_406_2": "It is alright. As long as I maintain the link to my Sword Intent, the power I shared to protect the people will not run dry.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_406_3": "No, what I want to know is who's paying the price for all that power?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_406_4": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_40_1": "This is the path Suisui described. But I'm not seeing any of the Disorienting Fog she mentioned.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_40_2": "(...Yep, even I can't smell that nasty head-spinning fog anymore. Seems like it's all cleared out.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_40_3": "Let's go inside and take a look around.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_1": "Hahh... {PlayerName}.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_10": "The Sword Intent I gave out was only seeds. What made them grow was each person's will.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_11": "Ungh... It is because they have the heart to protect that the Heart Sword answers.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_14": "I'll take it from here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_15": "Cough... cough...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_16": "Let's go. Somewhere the fog can't reach.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_17": "...Ever since the Siege of Xuanfang Hold, I've spread my Sword Intent among the people. I've been using most of my Resonance Energy to sustain the link.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_18": "With the battle intensifying, I have had to... Overclock... to maintain the link. Once the pressure eases, I will recover.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_19": "...Easy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_2": "What do you need me to do?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_20": "Remember what you said last night? \"See your choice through.\" This is me doing just that.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_21": "You can't expect to carry the world on your own shoulders.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_22": "If it had been you...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_23": "Let's find a place to rest.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_24": "After destroying the pursuing Autopuppets, you notice Qingxiao showing signs of Overclocking. Pressed for the truth, she admits she has nearly depleted her Resonance Energy sustaining the Sword Intent she distributed to everyone. She confides the inner turmoil she has been carrying, and you remind her, as you did that one other night, to stay true to the \"choice\" she made. You decide to stand by her and find a safe place to rest.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_3": "I am fine...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_4": "Not good enough, Qingxiao. I'm your partner, and if I'm going to keep you safe, I need to know what's happening to you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_410_6": "I will not allow another tragedy to befall the Land of Xuanfang. To protect everyone, this is the only certain path.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_411_1": "You should go after Muyu, {PlayerName}...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_411_2": "Partners should watch each other's backs.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_411_3": "You also taught me Sword Flight. And you've not stopped teaching me since.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_412_1": "We need to lose that Shuttle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_412_2": "Hahh... Y-yes...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_413_2": "Put me down... You will move faster without me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_414_1": "I... will aid you with my swords.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_414_2": "You need rest.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_414_3": "...Do not worry. I know my limits.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_1": "I will be fine... I just need a moment with my <ano=stringed instrument>guqin</ano>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_10": "Promise me one thing... {PlayerName}.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_12": "Argh...!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_13": "Save me... Sword Transcendent...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_14": "Tacet Discords... They just keep coming!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_15": "Everyone is dead... Even the Xuanling Birds...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_16": "Sword Transcendent... Where were you? Did you... abandon us?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_17": "Sword Transcendent.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_18": "...Ruoyun.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_19": "Qingxiao, you don't have to be so tense all the time. I know you are not the ice-cold statue you pretend to be.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_2": "That will be enough?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_20": "Inside, you are just like the rest of us. You feel joy, anger, resentment... and regret.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_21": "You died... You died two centuries ago when Yuan Fortress was destroyed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_22": "Dead? And? No one sewed my mouth shut.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_23": "I should thank you for looking after my descendants.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_24": "After all these centuries, it seems you still... cannot let go of that war.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_25": "...You are just a manifestation of my fractured mind. The Inner Demon I must destroy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_26": "Heh... Once again, you stake mortal lives on your sword. All for a rescue that means nothing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_27": "Come now. This long duel between us shall meet its end today.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_30": "If, in the moments to come, I turn my sword on you... do not hesitate.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_31": "My master saw the unrest in my heart... and taught me the guqin to calm my spirit.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_32": "You find a relatively safe cabin to rest in. Qingxiao plays her qin to restore her inner balance, but the music only grows more chaotic. When a string finally snaps, the two of you are pulled apart. Alone in the fog-filled cabin, Qingxiao comes face to face with the dead of years past, a manifestation of the inner demon she has yet to overcome. It takes on her likeness and drags her into the depths of her own mind...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_4": "I have always had a fiery temperament... Each pluck of the string helps to restore my balance and calm my mind.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_5": "...You? Fiery?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_6": "...Before I took to the mountain, I had only my sword. I fought the Tacet Discords as if my life did not matter.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_7": "Ngh... Please... watch over me for a moment. I will recover soon, then we may move forward.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_8": "...Your playing sounds unsettled.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_415_9": "I—Ugh...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_417_1": "I have to get that Shuttle out of our way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_418_1": "You holding up? Let's get you inside that cabin above there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_418_2": "Mhm... I have burdened you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_418_3": "Promise me, Qingxiao. No more carrying everything alone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_418_4": "I promise.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_420_1": "(The cabin has been affected by the fog. Qingxiao...)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_421_2": "They gave me a bowl of food.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_421_3": "So you risked your life to protect the mortals from a whole tide of Tacet Discords.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_421_4": "I was frail anyway. Not long for this world. Better to take those monsters with me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_421_5": "With a broken blade...? Jingwei is my name. Would you like to become my disciple and walk the path of cultivation with me?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_421_6": "Those villagers... what were they to you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_422_1": "Your Resonance Ability has always been unstable. For longevity, you must anchor your heart in absolute stillness.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_422_2": "Seeing people get hurt just... makes me sad. And when those monsters attack, it makes me so angry my blood boils.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_422_3": "Then close your eyes. Cover your ears. Distance yourself from the world. Quiet your mind, and your desires will fade.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_422_4": "Remember, do not let the world stir your heart. Forsake earthly attachments.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_423_1": "...You left the mountain to hunt evil again.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_423_2": "I went only to purge the Tacet Discords. I formed no bonds. My heart did not waver.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_423_3": "Saving mortals from the Lament is like trying to push back the tide. The tide always returns.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_423_4": "If I sit back and do nothing, how is this long life of mine any different from the cold existence of a stone? Even you, Master... you saved me once.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_423_5": "...Then tell me, what is your <b>Way</b>?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_423_6": "I have... yet to find my <b>answer</b>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_424_1": "(It looks like I'm in Qingxiao's inner world... I need to find her quickly.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_1": "One need not rush. A few hours here are but a fleeting moment in the world outside.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_10": "Strike her down.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_11": "You meet Qingxiao's master, Jingwei, who tells you that Qingxiao's struggle with her inner demon has reached its final stage. You are the one Qingxiao has chosen to be her sword. Should the inner demon ever seize control of her, it will fall to you to strike her down.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_2": "Are you... Qingxiao's master?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_3": "I am but a lingering frequency. Besides, my Qing already knew how to fight when she came to me. I merely taught her the methods of cultivation.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_4": "These bodies... what happened here?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_5": "We who walk the path of cultivation must shed all worldly desires. Cut down our Inner Demons.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_6": "What you see are the remnants of her past duels with herself. This duel... is the final reckoning.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_7": "Fellow Cultivator, since you have found your way here, it means she has chosen you to be her sword.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_8": "Her... sword?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_430_9": "Should she succumb to her demon...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_440_1": "Why do you involve yourself in Xuanfang's affairs? You don't belong here. Or have you forgotten?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_440_2": "...Qingxiao. Wake up?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_440_3": "Because—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_1": "After bidding Master farewell",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_10": "Our gratitude for the rescue...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_11": "Good day, Sword Transcendent!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_12": "Whenever I sought to leave...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_13": "Xuanling Birds would bring another plea",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_14": "Years flowed like water...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_15": "I had strayed so far from the path of cultivation",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_16": "Just like that, yes! Perfect!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_17": "Sword Transcendent!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_18": "Over here, Sword Transcendent!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_19": "Told you the Waking Moon would be good fun, Qingxiao!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_2": "I wandered the world",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_20": "...Mm.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_21": "Here!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_22": "Not long after",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_23": "The Threnodian... descended",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_3": "eventually settling in Xuanfang",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_4": "I planned to cultivate in solitude...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_5": "Please, Sword Transcendent. Tacet Discords are coming!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_6": "Can you help us?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_7": "Did you lead this child here?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_8": "Just this once",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_450_9": "After that, more came to offer their thanks",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_452_1": "Two hundred years since the Fortress and Gorges War. And you still have not found peace.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_452_2": "That day, the Xuanling Bird told you the Gorges of Spirits and Yuan Fortress were burning. Where did you go?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_452_3": "I went to the Gorges of Spirits.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_452_4": "Ah, yes. So confident. So sure your blade could cut down the Lament's source. Save everyone. And then—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_452_5": "You were held back. Trapped by Retroact Rain. Pinned down by the Threnodian's blade of ruin. By the time you returned to Xuanfang, what did you find...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_452_6": "A brutal end. A silent battlefield.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_453_1": "Sword Transcendent... Yuan Fortress... is gone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_453_2": "I am here. You are safe now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_453_3": "(This man... He once sent a Xuanling Bird to beg for my help. Civilians were trapped in a mountain flood.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_453_4": "Ugh... P-please... help them...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_453_5": "I will. Rest now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_453_6": "Liar! You know he is beyond saving. Just like all the others.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_454_1": "(I remember this man from the Waking Moon Festival. He was haggling over a lantern for his two-year-old child.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_454_2": "He even taught the child to cheer your name. \"Sword Transcendent! Sword Transcendent!\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_455_1": "(A Xuanling brought me her wish. She prayed for her missing family to come home.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_455_2": "You followed that stupid bird's lead and searched half the mountain. Eventually, you found her father at the bottom of a cliff.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_456_1": "Lingfang...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_456_2": "Ruoyun's childhood friend. One of the first you saved in Xuanfang. A musician who marched off to war and threw her life away.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_456_3": "...Ah, you've come, Sword Transcendent... Ruoyun... She is still in the Fortress... waiting for you...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_456_4": "I understand. I will find her.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_456_5": "Then... I can rest my eyes now...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_456_6": "Another hollow comfort. You searched every crater left by the Fortress's collapse. You never found anyone alive.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_457_1": "The years pass. Your cultivation advances. But the memory of this failure only becomes clearer and clearer.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_457_2": "Everything you once saved in Xuanfang was ground to dust by the Lament.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_457_3": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_457_4": "So, let us begin.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_460_1": "You are back at the Gorges of Spirits... The battlefield that haunts you. Your fear. Your regret.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_460_2": "I will destroy the source of this Tacet Discord outbreak.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_460_3": "Show me, Sword Transcendent. Prove your resolve with your sword. Answer their pleas.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_460_4": "This time, will the tragedy of the Fortress and Gorges War be redeemed?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_461_1": "Remarkable. These monsters cannot withstand your onslaught. You are faster than you ever were back then.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_461_2": "A pity you cannot reach Yuan Fortress in time. The defense there is crumbling. One soldier after another...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_471_1": "We lost the Central Plains... They came too fast...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_471_2": "Save your breath, soldier. The bleeding has stopped for now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_471_3": "Thank you... Please... The Threnodian is just ahead...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_471_4": "I know. Leave the rest to me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_471_5": "How confusing. They are long dead, so why the tender words? They are only your memories. Proof of your futile rescue.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_472_1": "The Crownless... the Threnodian's blade of ruin.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_472_2": "It now stands at the zenith of its strength. And you? You have already given away most of your Sword Intent to shield those mortals.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_473_1": "Yes, as long as the Threnodian's power flows, it will continue to rise from the dead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_473_2": "Ovathrax is watching now. Its dominion is absolute, undefeated since the dawn of its birth.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_473_3": "Your sword can split mountains and rivers. But it cannot shake war from its throne, nor the countless engines of war born from civilization's shadow.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_474_1": "This time, it seems you have finally repelled the Threnodian's puppeted blade and cut down the source of the outbreak.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_475_1": "Yuan Fortress still stands. You might actually make it in time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_475_2": "Truly impressive. You were still fighting the Crownless when you heard the Fortress explode into rubble all those years ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_476_1": "Your Resonance Energy is nearly exhausted... how much longer can you force this?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_476_2": "...Hahh... Hahh...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_476_3": "Onward... just a little further. The gates of Yuan Fortress are almost in sight.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_485_1": "...It will all be over soon.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_485_2": "How do you endure this agony? Draining your Resonance Energy like having your nerves flayed from your body?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_485_3": "Even at your limit, you refuse to cut the link. Why not stop this pointless waste?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_1": "You killed the Crownless and flew back to Xuanfang without a moment's rest. And still... too late.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_10": "...Until you can endure no more and fight me. Like every time before.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_12": "...Qingxiao?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_13": "...You didn't block?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_14": "Ngh... Do not run.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_15": "You want my power?!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_16": "Have you lost your mind? I am the <ano=Three Corpses Poison>Sanshi Poison</ano> in your body! The emotions and desires you cut away for the sake of cultivation!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_17": "Every dark thought, every shadow your sword ever cast... They are me! Other Cultivators would have slain me long ago, yet you seek my help?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_18": "...Our Heart Swords were always meant to be one.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_19": "You... You kept me for two centuries. Fed me your feeings. All so you could use me when the day came.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_2": "Mortal lives are but motes of dust. You know this. Even if this war had never come, another would. Or the Lament would burn it all to ash.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_20": "You are Qingxiao too, after all.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_21": "Cultivation is, above all, being true. If I killed you... how could I claim an honest heart?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_22": "You will regret this. I will eat away at you until nothing is left. No mind. No heart. In the end, your own hand will tear down everything you tried to protect.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_23": "Even if that day comes... I have someone by my side who can stop me. I am willing to entrust myself to {Male=him;Female=her}.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_24": "Qingxiao, the things you treasure are not the things I treasure. You care for the world. But I...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_25": "I only care about your Way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_26": "Yes. I know.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_27": "You will be bound to me forever. Never to see through the world's illusions. Never to transcend. Never to attain the Way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_28": "I was never a Transcendent. I need not bother with any great Way. Besides... I have already found my <b>answer</b>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_29": "How very stubborn... <ano=you are>I am</ano>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_3": "Since this ending is already destined, why did you bother? Why destroy your inner peace for a lost cause?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_30": "From Yuan Fortress, to the Gorges of Spirits, to the Land of Xuanfang... No matter how hard I try, my sword cannot save everyone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_31": "From this day forth, you will never be able to sever the full tide of mortal feeling, or break free from the karma of this world.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_32": "Again and again, the inner demon insists it is meaningless for Qingxiao to keep helping others, urging her to cut away that part of herself to advance unburdened on the path of cultivation. But for the sake of her true self and the people she protects, Qingxiao chooses to accept her own imperfection and merge with her inner demon. Drawing on its power to replenish her Resonance Energy, she forfeits any chance of transcending and attaining the Way. And yet, in that moment, she finally arrives at the \"answer\" to the question her master once posed to the heavens.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_4": "Qingxiao, this is your inner world. You can try again. But you know, every single time—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_5": "Every single time, I realize my own weakness.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_7": "But this is the path I chose. I must go. There are people waiting for me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_8": "No, no, no... That shouldn't be your reaction.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_490_9": "You should be drowning in agony. You should be trapped in a loop of futile attempts until you break...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_10": "Now, I feel a flood of stray thoughts swirling within me. But I need not, and will not, suppress them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_11": "Is that for the better or the worse?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_12": "I am nothing but a prideful mortal, always believing there was nothing my sword could not protect. Sometimes I even forgot—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_13": "I started cultivating just to stay alive. Back then, I was only a wanderer whose hometown had been taken by the Lament.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_14": "This thread is all my family left behind. It is the only link between the Sword Transcendent and Qing, the wandering village girl.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_15": "I wear it to remember where I came from. No matter how many years pass, I cannot turn a blind eye to the suffering of others.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_16": "Strength has its limits, but I only ask for a clean heart. Even if my sword cannot promise a perfect end, I will not stay my hand.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_17": "Even if it's not enough...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_18": "There will always be another to carry <ano=our>your</ano> burden. And another after that. <ano=We>You</ano> aren't walking this road alone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_19": "You... truly are different from who you were two centuries ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_2": "{PlayerName}... I am back.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_20": "At the end of the Fortress and Gorges War, when I was about to fall, I heard a Loong's roar echoing across the battlefield. I looked up and saw—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_21": "The Golden-Eyed One and Jué.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_22": "You struck the source of the disaster. You rewrote the fate of that war.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_23": "I looked for you after the battle, but you were gone. I wanted to know if someone like you ever had to face such impossible choices.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_24": "I still don't know my past. And nothing I've been through since I woke up has been simple or easy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_25": "But even though we didn't always know how things would turn out, we still followed our hearts anyway. And we gave it everything we had.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_26": "Yes, we did. I must confess, {PlayerName}, I... lied to you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_27": "The Ministry of Foreign Affairs's reach is not that wide. I actually traced your footsteps by asking many people.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_28": "Come, my disciple. Time to settle things in the world outside.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_29": "Say that again?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_3": "I used my Inner Demon's strength to replenish my depleted Resonance Energy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_30": "...I want to be honest with myself. Since I taught you Sword Flight, I do consider you my disciple.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_31": "You need not answer, but I shall call you such... even if only for this short while.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_32": "You're a sight for sore eyes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_33": "Neither. They are simply my thoughts.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_34": "At any rate, you're still the Qingxiao I know.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_35": "As Qingxiao wakes, you finally meet within her inner landscape. She has come to understand the path she will walk from here on. She tells you of the Fortress and Gorges War two hundred years ago, and how the two of you once crossed paths at the Gorges of Spirits. Even when aid offers no guarantee of a good end, you will both still follow your hearts and do all you can. In this shared calling to protect, neither of you stands alone. Fellow guardians at heart, you lay yourselves bare to one another, and Qingxiao sets aside her reserve and claims you as her disciple.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_5": "Forgive me. I forced you to bear the risk of my losing control.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_491_6": "It's alright. If that Inner Demon had really taken control, I still would've found a way to wake you up.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_1": "Before we depart, is there anything you wish to ask? Time flows much faster here than out there. We still have a moment.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_12": "Do not worry. My mind has settled. My Resonance Ability is stabilizing. I am far from full strength, but I will not lose control again.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_14": "You have me. No more soloing it, okay?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_15": "Yes. I have you by my side.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_16": "I have been sensing the battle through my Sword Intent. The line is holding. The soldiers and people of Xuanfang stand united. They will protect the Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_17": "But that is all we can burden them with. The rest falls on us... We must end Muyu's schemes without delay.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_18": "I do have a few questions.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_19": "I'll stay here a bit longer.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_2": "Is this place your inner world?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_20": "Let's head out.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_21": "I see. Ask away.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_22": "That's all for now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_23": "It was also my wish. If I failed, you would've had the strength to stop me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_3": "What of your inner demon? Are you alright?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_4": "What's the situation at the Ministry of War?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_6": "Yes. This <te href=800052>Inner Landscape</te> manifests during my meditations. It is a reflection of my state of mind.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_7": "How did I get in here?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_8": "...That strand of <te href=800055>Lifebound Sword Intent</te> I gave you has, to a certain extent, bound our lives to the same wellspring.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_500_9": "When my Resonance Energy ran dry, my Inner Demon surfaced. My inner landscape began to collapse. That is how you were pulled in. But...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_501_1": "Looks like we don't need to do anything.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_501_2": "The pendant is reacting... It's guiding us forward.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_502_1": "While we were in the cabin, others were keeping watch outside.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_1": "Be on guard. Tacet Discords have escaped from nearby Censure Cages.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_10": "You have come for Hsin the Moon Fox as well?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_11": "I know of your deeds in Jinzhou. Alongside <b>Jué</b> and the Jinzhou Magistrate, you resolved the Temporal Disruption on Mt. Firmament.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_12": "That someone connected to a Sentinel should be at Fogveil Pagoda, a place tied to <b>Hsin</b>, is likely no accident.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_13": "Guess I'm more famous than I thought...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_14": "Do not trouble yourself. Few know the details.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_15": "\"Bloom Bearer,\" \"Hero of Jinzhou,\" \"Dark Thunderbolt,\" \"Laureate,\" \"Hero of Heroes,\" \"Voidworm Rider\"... These are the stories the <te href=750048>Ministry of Foreign Affairs</te> recorded in broad strokes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_16": "...Sounds like the Ministry of Foreign Affairs knows a little too much.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_17": "I came seeking Her too, only to find many Censure Cages failing, and the fog meant to confuse Tacet Discords has dispersed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_18": "A nearby secret chamber stores the Sentinel's Relic. It may have been affected as well.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_19": "By \"Sentinel's Relic\"... do you mean something like this?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_2": "You must be... Paragon Qingxiao. We've met before.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_20": "It does resemble an ornament worn by Hsin.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_21": "Not long ago, Suisui met the Moon Fox in that very secret chamber and was given this <te href=750059>Prism of Fate</te>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_22": "Paragon Qingxiao, we're here for the same reason. Why don't we travel together? Watch each other's backs?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_23": "I suppose we can.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_24": "...From now on, please just call me Qingxiao.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_25": "You know about Mt. Firmament too?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_26": "How do you know that?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_27": "You and Qingxiao cross paths at Fogveil Pagoda, both searching for Hsin. The pagoda's mechanisms are malfunctioning, and Tacet Discords are breaking loose for unknown reasons. Together, you decide to investigate the chamber that once held the Prism of Fate.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_3": "But the siege at the Hold's gates didn't give us much time for introductions. What brings you here?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_50_7": "A Rafter Kite guided me. I am searching for someone of great importance.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_1": "Heh. {PlayerName}, Paragon Qingxiao. Took you long enough. Any later, and I wouldn't've held out.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_10": "Your cover must be blown now, right?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_11": "I hit him first.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_12": "While he was running his mouth at you, I gave him a little love tap in the back. Shame he slipped away behind a wall of Autopuppets.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_13": "I see... that's why Muyu's phantom vanished so suddenly.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_14": "Right, let's skip the chit‑chat. We're all hunting the same soulless fart, so why not team up?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_15": "You've helped a great deal, and I've no reason to refuse. I need your intel. But you... what do you need from me?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_16": "You get right to it, huh? Love it. I want to stick with you because it's better odds for making sure Muyu doesn't get away again.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_17": "I don't have any of your \"noble\" motives, just an old score to settle with that bastard.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_18": "That's your only condition?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_19": "Yeah, well... if we trip over any Sanctum relics or Hsin's secret stash of treasure, maybe toss one my way? Hah. Kidding.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_2": "That pendant and those notes I left... They did the trick, I s'pose?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_20": "Let me be clear, no Nethermancer stands by while someone toys with the dead's <ano=obsessions>Reverberations</ano>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_21": "Then... pleasure working with you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_22": "(Extend your hand to Jingran)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_23": "Likewise.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_24": "Where's Muyu's true body hiding?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_25": "He took the Shuttle up to the top level. The <ano=Heaven>Tian</ano> Realm. That's his playground.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_26": "According to \"Lucky,\" there's a sea of Reverberations up there. Almost like... all of Xuanfang's Reverberations got sucked into one place.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_27": "To hell with you, I told you that's not my name! You forgetful brat!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_28": "Tch. Always so lively... That's just a foul-mouthed <te href=800054>Lynx Spirit</te> I caught. Pay it no mind.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_29": "...What's Muyu's true intention?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_3": "Cat of the Nether Lamp.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_30": "In a coded letter to Zhuojun Atelier, he claimed he'd get his hands on \"Sentinel technology.\" The mechanistic mojo Hsin used to build the Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_31": "But think about it. If all he wanted was to steal something in the Sanctum... isn't all this chaos a bit unnecessary?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_32": "He's been running experiments on the mechanisms. It's like he's trying to figure out how they work before he does something.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_33": "Either way, we need to find him quickly.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_34": "This is the last Shuttle, but I see no lightway to the Skyend Barrier.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_35": "Let's check near that Swordlight.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_36": "You run into Jingran again aboard a Cloud Shuttle and learn that Muyu, wounded by Jingran, fled under the cover of Autopuppets to the final level, the \"Tian Realm.\" Jingran lays out his own motives, and the two of you strike a truce, agreeing to team up against Muyu. It seems Muyu is after mastery of Sentinel technology for some deeper, hidden purpose.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_4": "Our inside man. We meet again.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_5": "Just a Jianghu alias to earn my keep. Let me introduce myself proper—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_6": "Sounds a bit dull. I'd much rather you call me—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_7": "The Nethermancer who went three years undercover in Zhuojun Atelier's snake spit without a single bite—Jingran. You didn't pull any punches back at the Sanctum, by the way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_8": "Neither did you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_510_9": "Haha! Heard stories 'bout your style. Had to see for myself if the rumors were true.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_1": "Looks like you still have questions. Go on. I got nothing to hide.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_10": "Time was tight, so I left that pendant behind as a breadcrumb. Laced it with my Resonance Ability. Then I followed him.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_11": "It was a gamble. Could've blown up in my face a hundred ways. But turns out... I bet on the right horse. Spent my life in the right place, too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_12": "Wait... \"spent your life\"?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_13": "Oh, I cut a deal with the \"debt collector\" in this <ano=Life Lamp>lamp</ano>. Traded a bit of my lifespan. Just enough to juice that pendant.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_14": "Add in the passage to the Sanctum? A year or two off the clock. I figure that's a tidy price for you and the Paragon on my side.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_15": "The snake needed a hand from within Zhuojun Atelier to get supplies moving to lay the groundwork. That hand... just happened to be me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_16": "But he was paranoid. Notes at drop points, never a face. Didn't get a meet‑and‑greet 'til all hell broke loose with the Autopuppets.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_17": "He kept me at arm's length. Used me like a doorman. If you two hadn't've scared him, he never would've let me come this far.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_18": "Spirit Portal?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_19": "Same portal I opened for you back then. It cuts a passage between any two places thick enough with Reverberations.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_2": "How did you get here?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_3": "Why did you just leave that pendant behind?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_4": "How did you manage to get close to Muyu?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_5": "I'll ask later.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_6": "After our little run-in at the Sanctum, I used a <b>Spirit Portal</b> to enter this Mirage Realm. Landed in this level first.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_7": "As soon as I got there, I walked right into Muyu collecting data. Played along, got cozy. After my cover blew, I stole a Shuttle to give his toys the slip. That's how I ended up here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_8": "Lucky or not, you two showed up. With a parade of those things. Heh. Gotta say, you really know how to wear a guy out.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_511_9": "Right before the siege, Muyu and I reached a secret chamber in Fogveil Pagoda. He didn't find Hsin's trail, so he geared up for the Sanctum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_1": "...We cannot let the escaped Tacet Discords into Mengzhou. We are running out of options...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_10": "My Shifu told me about this. The ones who stayed behind... They were all great heroes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_11": "I can feel their \"Sword Intent.\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_12": "I have never forgotten them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_13": "...Stay alert. Something is coming.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_14": "The sword's frequency shows you what happened just before Yuan Fortress's self-destruction. When the Warden Commander of that era gathered everyone to head for the Fortress mainframe and carry out the self-destruct, Ruoyun insisted on joining them as well.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_2": "Anyone willing to follow me into the Fortress mainframe, step forward!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_3": "I'm with you!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_4": "The rest of you... Guanchuan is in command now. Stick to the plan. Cover the evacuation and withdraw immediately!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_5": "I'm going with you. I know a shortcut to the mainframe.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_6": "...Savantae girl, this is not your fight. Get to safety.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_7": "Commander, this is my home. I'm from Huanglong, but I'm a daughter of Xuanfang too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_8": "Just like everyone else here, I want to make sure more people can live to see the sunrise.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_512_9": "...These are memories and emotions from the past. From before Yuan Fortress self-destructed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_513_1": "Huh, it's been quiet for a while... That's not a good sign.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_515_2": "Tch. Sent a big one after us. Muyu must be getting desperate.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_515_3": "Focus on the defense of our own Shuttle first!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_515_4": "Prepare for battle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_515_5": "Heh, with you two around? I almost feel safe.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_515_6": "Status: Autonomous attack mode activated. Deploying combat units.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_516_1": "Hello, hello—can you hear me? I just connected to the Cloud Shuttle control room.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_516_2": "The Xuan Bombards on deck are all ready to fire. Use them as much as you want!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_516_3": "Jadie?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_516_4": "Hold on, who's that?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_516_5": "Let's blast those bots to pieces!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_517_1": "Ugh, not good! The Bombards overheated and shut down! Repairs will take some time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_517_2": "We cannot let a single one slip through.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_517_3": "Let's split up and cover both sides.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_517_4": "Fine by me. This side is mine.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_518_1": "Watch the flank! Another wave incoming!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_519_1": "Ah! Remote repairs complete! Xuan Bombards are back online!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_520_1": "These Autopuppets are a lot tougher than the last batch.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_520_2": "Don't let them stall us. We need to end this quickly.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_520_3": "Uh‑oh, that big bully just wrecked our best cannon!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_521_1": "Those grapples are messing with the Shuttle's flight stability... If this keeps up, we'll be in big trouble!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_522_1": "I will hold the line here. You two go deal with those Shuttles.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_522_2": "Got it. Jingran, can you keep up?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_522_3": "That far? Heh, don't sell a Nethermancer short.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_523_1": "Warning: Foreign object intrusion detected. Threat level updated.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_523_2": "Doesn't matter how many minions they throw at us. Minions are still minions.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_524_1": "Hurry, destroy the Cloud Shuttle's core! Bring it down!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_525_1": "Warning: Sub-vessel power insufficient. Crash imminent.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_525_2": "That's one down. Time to take down the next.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_526_1": "Heads up. These Shuttles have gone completely haywire.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_527_3": "Phew, our side's clear. Wonder how the Paragon's doing—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_528_1": "It is done.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_529_1": "Incredible work, team! The enemy Shuttles are pulling back, and the Autopuppets have stopped attacking!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_529_2": "Yeah, but the fog's still here. Doesn't feel like a win to me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_529_3": "My gut tells me this is a trap.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_529_4": "It probably just pulled back into the fog. Getting ready to hit us again.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_529_5": "...Brace yourselves. That Shuttle is approaching once more.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_529_6": "You seem to have driven off the enemy Shuttles for now, but the fog around you refuses to clear. Just then, Qingxiao senses the massive Cloud Shuttle drawing near.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_530_1": "Warning: Sub-vessel core region under attack. Requesting emergency reinforcements.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_530_2": "Tch. That voice is really starting to get on my nerves.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_530_3": "Destroy that orb, then we're done here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_531_1": "Directive: Full assault. Unit deployment intensity raised to maximum.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_1": "That Shuttle is the source of the fog. Until it falls, this will not end.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_2": "Then we board it and destroy the control orb.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_3": "Interesting... so we're trading \"bases\"? Autopuppets are still pouring in. If we all leave, this place is done for.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_4": "Everyone—we're here!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_5": "It's finally my turn to fight. Sheesh... Took me forever to fix these guys up.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_6": "You go take down that Cloud Shuttle! Leave this place to me and my Lancers!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_7": "Sure you can handle it? I'll stay back for a bit and help you hold the line.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_8": "Good. We'll make this quick.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_532_9": "The massive Cloud Shuttle proves to be the source of the Reeling Fog, and the fight will not truly end until it is dealt with. Reinforcement Autopuppets brought by Jadie ease the immediate pressure. You decide that Jingran and Jadie will hold the line here while you and Qingxiao go finish things aboard that Shuttle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_533_1": "Directive: Activating emergency defense mode. Eliminate all intruders at maximum capacity.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_533_2": "It's trying to slow us down with the Reeling Fog.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_533_3": "I activated my Sword Intent. It should help us resist the fog's effects for now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_535_1": "I'm back! Time to sink this behemoth!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_536_1": "The final obstacle lies ahead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_537_1": "Warning: Core integrity decreasing... Crash imminent... Crash imminent...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_540_1": "(We can't expect to board it yet. Gotta clear the deck of Autopuppets first.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_541_1": "Warning: Main vessel core under threat. Eliminate all intruders immediately.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_541_2": "Its defenses won't hold much longer.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_542_1": "This flying piece of junk's been playing hide-and-seek long enough. Let's put it down!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_1": "That big one's finally gone. Ugh, I'm so exhausted... Quite sure my parts are about to fall off one by one.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_10": "Whoa. So that's the Moon Fox's relic from Fogveil Pagoda? Figured it ended up with you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_11": "Ruoyun?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_12": "...Yes. Sword Transcendent Qingxiao... It has been... a very, very long time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_13": "What? Jadie, what just happened?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_14": "Explain yourself. And don't try to dodge.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_15": "Uhh... How was I supposed to know the Sentinel's relic would reveal my true form like that?!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_16": "Wait, this Prism of Fate, the Lexicon Axis, and the Sanctum... Are the knowledge restrictions lifting?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_17": "Now this is something. Have you two heard the legends about Xuanfang's <b>Celestials</b>?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_18": "I've heard bits of it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_19": "\"Celestials\"? What are they?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_2": "Thank you for your help back there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_20": "Good, saves time. The story goes that the Savantae crew didn't just vanish after building the Hold. They just... \"upgraded.\" Celestials, they call 'em. Been watching over the city's mechanisms ever since.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_21": "Celestials... That's the name they gave the Savanate crew that built the Hold. Soon after its completion, poof. Gone without a trace.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_22": "But if you buy the old stories, they never really left. Just became invisible caretakers keeping the Hold's gears turning to this day.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_23": "The Fortress and Gorges War broke out before Xuanfang Hold was even finished. Ruoyun, what exactly are you...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_24": "Very good. I am a Celestial. But my case... was a little different.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_25": "Long ago, I triggered the self-destruct at Yuan Fortress's mainframe—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_26": "...I'm... still alive...? Did I... make it...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_27": "...If that wasn't enough... What do I do now... Everyone has...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_28": "You have already done more than enough.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_29": "...What...? Is that... the Sentinel's... voice?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_3": "Thanks, little riddle-box.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_30": "Your will and heart have reached me. The rest is for me to handle.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_31": "Ruoyun. In a moment, you will die from your wounds. But I offer you a choice—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_32": "Cast aside your mortal body and become part of Xuanfang Hold, guarding it for what may be eternity. Or accept the peace of death here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_33": "Endless restraint, or quiet release. I wish to know what you can truly accept.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_34": "...I gave my word that I'd be one of the Celestials... I want to keep... protecting my people.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_35": "This path is not easy. Time may wither your spirit. There will be no turning back... even if you beg.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_36": "...I'll let... my future self... worry about the regrets.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_37": "Then entrust the whole of your being to <ano=Xuanfang Hold>me</ano>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_38": "—To be a Celestial is to accept a leash. You bind your life to the Hold and swear never to reveal its secrets.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_39": "But this crisis is endangering its people. I did what I had to and projected my consciousness into an Autopuppet to guide you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_4": "Hehe. After all, they are my proudest cre—ugh, partners!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_40": "And you can speak the truth now because of this? Why only now?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_41": "The restrictions have been lifted for now. Likely because we're near the core data zone, and your connection to the Sentinel has grown stronger.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_42": "Then tell me, what is this place? And how is it connected to the Hold?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_43": "You're in the Hold's control mainframe, a space called the <b>Xuanyuan Domain</b>. It stores vast amounts of the region's historical data.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_44": "Muyu uploaded outside Reverberations, twisting the execution logic. He tried to take full control of the Mirage Realm, but it ended up triggering all these anomalies.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_45": "If this continues, his Reverberations will continue their contamination until everything collapses. In the end... the Hold itself will fall.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_46": "First Instance activated...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_47": "Simulating... Xuanfang Hold... Reconstructing... Future possibilities converged...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_48": "Is this control mainframe actually a <te href=800053>Civilization Capsule</te>? Could we be inside it right now?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_49": "I... That data is restricted under the highest clearance. Even now, it hasn't lifted.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_5": "Little riddle-box? Everything I say makes perfect sense!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_50": "There's the lightway to the Skyend Barrier. This is as far as I can take you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_51": "Muyu turned guardians into killers, and souls of the departed into toys. I beg you... Please stop him.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_52": "I accept your request. Take care.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_53": "Qingxiao, do you remember... our farewell back then? You never gave me an answer.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_54": "...It was worth it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_55": "(This voice. It sounds like the one I heard in Rinascita's <b>Civilization Capsule</b>. If Imperator wasn't the only Sentinel that left a relic storing legacy data...)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_56": "After beating back a fleet of Shuttles sent by Muyu, you regroup with Jadie. The Prism of Fate reveals the truth: the consciousness inside Jadie belongs to Ruoyun, the Court of Savantae Artisan from years ago. With the Sentinel's help, the Savantae crew who built Xuanfang Hold all transformed into Celestials, living in symbiosis with the very mechanisms they created. This Mirage Realm you stand in is actually the inner space of Xuanfang Hold's control mainframe—and may be connected to Mengzhou's Civilization Capsule. Ruoyun begs you to stop Muyu's scheme: if this continues, the collapse of the control mainframe will bring Xuanfang Hold down with it...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_6": "You... Why have you been helping us all this time?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_7": "I want the city out there to be okay! If we don't fix things here, that place is gonna be in big, big trouble too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_8": "Alrighty! Now I'll scoot us along to the next level—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_550_9": "The Prism of Fate...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_1": "Before you go, are there any more questions? I'll tell you what I can.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_10": "Is Hsin the Moon Fox in the Sanctum? If you can't say, just nod or shake your head.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_11": "...Forgive me. The restrictions are woven into our thoughts. Any attempt to reveal classified information is blocked.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_12": "But I can say this... I only made it to the Xuanyuan Domain because of the Sentinel's help.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_13": "Those Swordlights were imitations of Qingxiao's Sword Intent. I created them from stray frequencies in the Domain. They can restore one's Resonance Energy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_14": "I could not carry them in my Autopuppet body, so I left them near where I made them... Did they help?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_15": "They did. I even saw some of your memories.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_16": "...Huh? You didn't see anything embarrassing, I hope?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_17": "I suppose it's because those frequencies are tied to the region's history... Or there's a chance I accidentally mixed in some of my own...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_18": "I wish you both the best. Stay safe.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_19": "(Ask about Hsin the Moon Fox's whereabouts.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_2": "(Ask about the Celestials' knowledge restrictions.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_3": "(Ask about the Swordlights.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_4": "Goodbye, Ruoyun.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_5": "Xuanfang Hold's technology comes from the Sentinel Herself. It is far more advanced than anything else in this age. It can never be allowed to leak.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_6": "The restrictions on us Celestials come from that consensus. We accepted our fate when we signed on to build the Hold. We knew what we would become when it was finished.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_7": "Now... we are just consciousness in machines. Frequencies that watch over and maintain the Hold, never to leave.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_8": "Why haven't we seen any other Celestials?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_551_9": "Right now, they... I'm sorry. That is another thing I cannot speak of.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_552_1": "Jingran, we'll fly up there on swords. What about you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_552_2": "All good. I got my own way of keepin' up.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_552_3": "The road ahead is bound to be perilous. Allow me to lead the way.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_560_1": "Careful, the Skyend Barrier in this level has spiraled into chaos.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_560_2": "Tch. Muyu really set a storm in motion. Now even he can't steer his own disaster.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_560_3": "No stopping... Let's get through this quickly.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_561_1": "I'll handle it!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_1": "There it is. The Sanctum's Shuttle. Muyu's little fortress.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_10": "Jingran, what are your odds?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_11": "Haha, ninety percent shot I get you two inside.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_12": "No, I mean, what are the odds you come back alive?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_13": "Some things, you don't know 'til you try. Besides, we're running out of time. Those openings could disappear any second.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_14": "Look, I've always known my wick was shorter than most. But how I burn it? That's my call, even if the gods themselves disagree.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_15": "So go save Xuanfang, big hero. I'm not planning on checking out just yet.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_16": "Once this is over, maybe you'll see me again at my Shifu's old lady's place in Xianling Village.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_17": "It's a promise then.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_18": "We're saving our chat for another day.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_19": "This wisp of Sword Intent may not work miracles. But with your resolve fueling it, it will not fail you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_20": "{PlayerName}, Paragon Qingxiao...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_21": "I'll leave that corpse-fiddling creep to you, then!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_22": "You break through the Skyend Barrier and arrive on a Cloud Shuttle in the Tian Realm. Muyu's Sanctum shuttle is shielded behind a barrier of corrupted mechanisms, making it impossible to approach. Seeing this, Jingran decides to ram a nearby Shuttle straight into a gap in the barrier, clearing a path for you and Qingxiao...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_3": "That barrier of warped machinery won't yield to a simple strike.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_4": "Look. Two weak spots in the perimeter. We can force a breach there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_5": "Hold on. I got a better idea—See that Shuttle over there?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_6": "I'll ram it straight through the barrier. You two fly through before the crack closes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_7": "But then you'd be...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_8": "That, over there, is worse than the Skyend's dangers. Even with a Shuttle as a shield, you'll be putting your life at risk.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_570_9": "Safe paths don't lead to lost places. If there's an opening, I'm not letting it go to waste.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_580_1": "...Guh!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_580_2": "Jingran?!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_580_3": "Hah... minor hiccup. Steering's busted on this clanker. Gotta find another way!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_580_4": "We'll head to the other opening!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_581_1": "Watch the rampaging mechanisms!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_1": "He's dead. And this time, it's no puppet. This is his true body.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_11": "Your vision has narrowed, Paragon Qingxiao. I expected someone as elevated as you to understand this path sooner.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_12": "We were never enemies, truly. This time, <ano=Xuanfang Hold>you two</ano> simply happened to stand in my way. Save or destroy. Neither has ever interested me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_13": "To break that fox's tedious restrictions and taste the fruit of true knowledge, I had to take a path... from which there is no retreat.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_14": "I don't care about your plans. I came to take your life.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_15": "And this time, you will pay for everything you've done in Xuanfang Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_16": "...I came here to dissect the Sentinel's design. To understand the blueprint of divinity. Then build myself into its equal.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_17": "And now, I've reached the pinnacle of mechanist arts...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_18": "He's above us.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_19": "You...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_2": "Muyu... is actually dead?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_20": "Then you shall make ideal test subjects.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_21": "Think I see someone up ahead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_22": "You reach the deck of the Sanctum Shuttle and, to your shock, find Muyu's corpse. Yet the disturbance here is still unresolved. While you grapple with the scene, his body suddenly \"resurrects.\" Muyu explains that he resorted to this brute-force method to break the restriction Hsin placed on the Sentinel's knowledge. Your confrontation ends with him collapsing once more, and then, a voice rings out around you...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_3": "The wound was fatal. It must have been the strike Jingran landed earlier.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_4": "If he's dead, then who's controlling those Reverberations? Who sent the Cloud Shuttles and the Autopuppets? This can't be over that easily.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_5": "The Reverberations of the dead... They still pour in without end. They still cause the anomalies...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_6": "The emotions in those Reverberations are weak little things. But they do make excellent fuel for transcendence.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_7": "So... the two closest to the Sentinel. You've managed to find your way here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_8": "Muyu, this corpse... Is this another one of your tricks?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_590_9": "This is my true flesh. The mortal vessel I cast aside. I'm being entirely honest with you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_600_1": "I have shed my mortal flaws—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_600_2": "To become the perfect Celestial.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_600_3": "And you, Qingxiao...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_600_4": "Born to transcend",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_600_5": "They matter to me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_600_6": "Yet brought low by useless emotion and your pity for insignificant mortals.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_60_1": "No external damage. Unlike last time, it has not been corrupted by Reverberations.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_60_2": "Meaning this isn't one of Muyu's tricks?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_60_3": "Yes, it seems they have simply shut down.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_610_1": "\"Celestial\"... You just copied the Savantae craftsmen and transferred your consciousness into an Autopuppet.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_611_1": "You both stand with mortals. Again and again, you protect. Have you ever thought about why they are weak?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_611_2": "Flaws must be burned away. Excess must be shed. Only then can an ant one day stand beside a god.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_612_1": "This is not over. This is not my destination...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_612_2": "Just a moment more... A moment more, and I will cast off this shell and ascend...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_614_1": "Those slaves bound to the Sentinel are unworthy of the name. I am the true Celestial, free of all chains.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_614_2": "I have taken the most fragile thing in this world and made it my road to perfection. I have arrived at a future you cannot even fathom.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_615_1": "You are nothing but a monster feeding on the dead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_616_1": "You just want the world to be a mirror of <i>yourself</i>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_616_2": "Every soul has its own light. The \"perfection\" you speak of is a hollow lie.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_616_3": "I fight for the lights of the living. Each flame is a life, distinct and irreplaceable.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_617_1": "This grotesque puppet show ends now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_61_1": "This should be the entrance to the secret chamber. Looks like... nothing's stopping us from just walking in.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_61_2": "It seems whatever ward kept it sealed is no longer in effect.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_1": "The Reverberations from the <ano=Earth>Di</ano> Realm... I'll have them all... Every last drop of rage, sorrow, and resentment—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_10": "Do not misunderstand. The Sentinel's knowledge is my only concern. The one who wanted this Capsule? Ask your old enemy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_11": "...The Fractsidus?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_12": "...The Threnodian?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_13": "Xuanfang is but one corner of the chaos in Mengzhou. Unfortunately, I have no interest in <b>Balanophora's</b> petty schemes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_14": "So she's the \"woman in red\" you mentioned before? A Fractsidus Overseer?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_16": "Unrepentant to the last.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_17": "I accept the consequences of my work. To regret it now would be to dishonor all the \"materials\" I used to get here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_18": "It's irrelevant now... You defeated me because you were strong enough. Not because my path was wrong.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_19": "Look at this <ano=barrier>sky</ano> trying to stop us... Doesn't it remind you of the Etheric Sea?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_2": "AHHH—What... did you do?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_20": "Soon, the Reverberations' corruption will bring it all down. You may escape to reality, but Xuanfang Hold is doomed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_21": "...I will not let that happen.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_22": "This wretched city was built on the Sentinel's meddling. Every life it saved was a <ano=cause>debt</ano> that must eventually be paid.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_23": "Just like your protection. It has only delayed the <ano=effect>inevitable</ano>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_24": "And now, above you, the bill has arrived. The Tacet Discords. The dead. The destruction Xuanfang was always meant to face.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_25": "So that was the plan? Trigger a collapse, destroy the barrier, and slip away in the chaos?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_26": "I told you. I do not care about what happens to the Capsule. And I care even less for this Hold...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_27": "I want the Sentinel's knowledge exposed to the light of Solaris. Whether it saves the world or sets it on fire... Frankly, you two, I don't give a damn.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_28": "Leave it to the Sentinel? Better that knowledge in human hands. In my hands.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_29": "You're driven by nothing but greed and a hollow ego.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_3": "I shared my Sword Intent with the Autopuppets you experimented on.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_30": "At least you understand my \"madness.\" I never once hid my intentions from you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_31": "Enough talk... Your delusion ends here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_32": "(Execute Muyu yourself.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_33": "(Let Qingxiao execute Muyu.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_34": "I will stay here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_35": "My Resonance Ability can purge the malice from these Reverberations. As long as someone stands against this \"falling sky,\" this place will endure.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_36": "Hahh... So...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_37": "Hsin asked me to vow that I would never forsake this city. And I promised you... that you wouldn't walk this road alone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_38": "Master.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_39": "...Yes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_4": "...You... The guqin you played... Has your cultivation addled your wits? You'd even protect the Reverberations of the dead?!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_40": "Whatever comes next, we'll face it together.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_41": "Muyu, drawing on the Reverberations of the dead from the Di Realm to sustain himself, is pierced through by the Sword Intent radiating from the Autopuppets Qingxiao empowered. As he falls, your questioning draws out his true intent: he came for the Sentinel's knowledge sealed within the Civilization Capsule. While he was willing to destroy the Capsule outright to get it, he claims it was someone else who wanted it intact. He warns you that Xuanfang Hold exists only because the Sentinel meddled in mortal affairs, and that every life it has saved comes at a cost that must eventually be paid. The disturbance now tearing through the Xuanyuan Domain, he says, is simply the destruction Xuanfang was always fated to face.\n \nYou defeat Muyu, but the \"falling sky\" unleashed by the Reverberation corruption still looms, and Xuanfang Hold's control kernel is on the verge of collapse.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_5": "Even Reverberations should not be sacrificed to conspiracy and ambition, nor stripped of their right to exist.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_7": "...What a Sword Transcendent. What a Xuan Paragon.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_620_9": "You infiltrated the Sanctum to steal the Civilization Capsule we're in, didn't you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_1": "Protect Xuanfang!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_2": "Hold the line...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_3": "Our lives for the city! Never retreat!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_4": "Xuanfang stands in peril, the sky about to fall...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_5": "Everyone, will you lend me your swords?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_6": "There's a whole group of \"people\" here!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_7": "This is not the sword of one. It is the sword of all.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_8": "Heaven falls, earth splits. But this sword will bring the dawn.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_630_9": "SKY—BREAK!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_1": "Oh, you have both worked very hard indeed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_10": "Very well. Then let us begin with the chaos Muyu sowed.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_11": "When Muyu invaded the Sanctum, I was not blind to it. But for certain reasons, I could neither intervene directly nor send word.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_12": "In desperation, I trapped him inside the Xuanyuan Domain, within the mainframe, and strengthened the barrier to keep him from escaping.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_13": "I believed he sought to extract the mainframe's core data. But to break my restrictions, he weaponized the Reverberations to collapse the mainframe itself.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_14": "One more thing. Is the Hold's control mainframe actually Mengzhou's Civilization Capsule? Muyu certainly believed it was.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_15": "Not entirely. It is merely one small part of it...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_16": "This situation exceeded even my calculations. Fortunately, you two were there. You saved Xuanfang from far greater loss.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_17": "The Rafter Kite that led me to Fogveil Pagoda... You used the excuse of a meeting to lead me straight to {PlayerName}, didn't you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_18": "Heh... so you figured it out after all.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_19": "With my clever <ano=Suisui>ally</ano> placing the Arbiter on the board as a wild card, I rather hoped you two would form a natural partnership.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_2": "...Hsin?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_20": "The visions of Xuanfang we saw in the Domain...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_21": "I know your question. Those Cloud Shuttles and mechanisms were real, recorded blueprints. As for why they were never deployed during the Fortress and Gorges War...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_22": "Qingxiao... the answer is simple. There was not enough time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_23": "...Time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_24": "Besides, technology that outstrips its age is as much a curse as a blessing to the people of Mengzhou. It was never meant for the mortal world. It has already warped too many fates.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_25": "Muyu's ruin is proof enough of where that path leads.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_26": "I'm not here to judge your past choices. But if some of Xuanfang's problems began with its Sentinel, then its Sentinel should see them through.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_27": "Arbiter... I...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_28": "Arbiter, Paragon Qingxiao. When the time is right, I will give you and Xuanfang the answers you deserve.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_29": "When that day comes, bring the Prism of Fate and come see...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_3": "Thanks to the two of you and the people of this city, the Reverberation corruption in the control mainframe was largely purged. I handled the anomalies that remained.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_30": "Hold on. Back in the Sanctum, the Prism of Fate flickered. Was that you? Did you guide us into the Xuanyuan Domain?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_31": "Only by stopping Muyu's chaos from within, together with my power, could we minimize the harm that spilled beyond.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_32": "In a mysterious garden, you and Qingxiao finally meet the long-missing Hsin the Moon Fox. Thanks to everyone's efforts, the crisis has, for now, come to a close. In answer to your questions, Hsin explains how She responded to the chaos Muyu set in motion, and you learn that Xuanfang Hold's control mainframe is actually just a small piece of the Civilization Capsule. As for why She never deployed the Cloud Shuttles or other mechanisms during the Fortress and Gorges War, Hsin says there simply was not enough time, and admits She still isn't sure whether such advanced mechanist arts are a blessing or a curse for Mengzhou, given how much they entangle and reshape people's fates. Before parting, She promises to give you and Xuanfang Hold answers when the time is right. As Hsin's form vanishes, the Rafter Kite that once guided Qingxiao flies into the distance...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_4": "With the mainframe restored, the Censure Courts and Autopuppets will function as they should. The Tacet Discords will be contained in due time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_5": "In short... Xuanfang Hold has weathered the storm.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_6": "Uh... Paragon Qingxiao! Calm yourself!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_7": "Where exactly have you been all this time?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_640_9": "Xuanfang has bled again and again, and its Sentinel was nowhere to be seen. Whatever your reasons were, you owe us an explanation.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_645_1": "And so—thousands of swords pierced the heavens, scattering the darkness.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_645_2": "The ominous force over Xuanfang was swept away. Mechanisms whirred back to life, and Tacet Discords were locked away.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_645_3": "Above the Sanctum, it seemed as though a river of stars had descended.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_645_4": "As the dust settled, the righteous returned in triumph.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_645_5": "Soldier and citizen cheered as one. Peace, at last, filled the city once more.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_645_6": "Yet before the sounds of celebration had faded, a certain garden collapsed without warning.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_645_7": "As for the secrets it buried... that shall be a tale for another time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_646_1": "It's time for me to close up the stall. Until we meet again, dear listeners.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_647_1": "(Suisui seems to want to discuss something. I'd better head to the Ministry of War and find Yangyang first.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_1": "...Thank goodness you're both safe. Yangyang, come closer and let me get a good look at you. Are you hurt?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_10": "About twenty years back, he was supposed to succeed the Flowerveil Puppet as the next Grand Helm. Instead, he announced his departure from the organization and vanished.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_11": "After that... he probably hid in Xuanfang under another identity. Biding his time. Refining his plan.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_12": "The Atelier has officially cut ties with him. They even offered to share information to help with the Guild's investigation.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_13": "But we know he was still receiving internal support through an informant. Oh, right, did you meet the Cat of the Nether Lamp?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_14": "(Tell Suisui about Jingran.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_15": "...Really? So he hasn't been seen since the Sanctum... Typical. A proper ghost of the Jianghu. I wouldn't be surprised if he just shows up again one day.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_16": "I'm sure he also made it out safely.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_17": "But did Muyu have dealings with the Fractsidus? He mentioned an Overseer's name before we ended him.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_18": "We've only got one lead, from the Grand Helm herself. She said Muyu traded technology with the Fractsidus years ago, but the relationship didn't last.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_19": "Hard to say if that's true or just the Atelier trying to cover its tracks.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_2": "Suisui, I really am fine... {PlayerName} and Paragon Qingxiao are the ones who went into the Sanctum. They faced all the real danger.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_20": "These past few days... besides investigating the Atelier, I also made a trip to Mengzhou City Hall.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_21": "You went there again...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_22": "Hmph. In Jinzhou, at least they served me tea while I waited. This time... they shut the door in my face. Said Mengzhou's Magistrate wasn't receiving visitors.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_23": "Xuanfang's been hit by one disaster after another, yet City Hall remains eerily quiet. It's suspicious.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_24": "At least it has made good on its promise: a group of personnel and supplies will arrive from Mengzhou City soon. Another shipment of aid from Jinzhou has also arrived.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_25": "Things are indeed looking up. You two needn't worry about City Hall, I'll think of something.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_26": "Thank you, Suisui.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_27": "Your tone betrays you, darling. I can tell there's a lot on your mind. But you'll try to unwind, won't you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_28": "Yeah... Things are peaceful in Xuanfang for now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_29": "I hope that won't change for a long, long time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_3": "Yangyang didn't miss a single beat out there.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_30": "Very soon, the Waking Moon Festival will be celebrated across Mengzhou. Xuanfang will be no exception. You should both take the chance to relax.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_31": "Well then, see you soon. Don't forget about our... \"next time,\" alright, {PlayerName}?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_32": "Some time later, Suisui shares with you and Yangyang the intel she has gathered on Muyu in Mengzhou. She also notes that Mengzhou City Hall continues to hold the Land of Xuanfang at an odd, suspicious distance, and says she will keep monitoring its movements from Mengzhou. She hopes you will allow yourself to unwind and relax at the upcoming Waking Moon Festival...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_4": "She's become one of Xuanfang's bulwarks now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_5": "{PlayerName}, please don't praise me like that in front of my sister...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_6": "Alright, alright. Enough flattery, you two. Let's talk business. I'm speaking as Chairwoman of the Zhaoming Commerce Guild now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_8": "After returning to Mengzhou, I used the Guild's connections to dig into Muyu's past and contacted the main branch of Zhuojun Atelier.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_650_9": "Muyu was a prodigy in Automata Mechanics. He designed Yuan Fortress two centuries ago, was a senior figure in Zhuojun Atelier, and had deep collaborations with Huaxu Academy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_651_1": "{PlayerName}, what did my sister mean by \"next time\"...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_651_2": "...One day, we're all gonna visit Jinzhou together.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_651_3": "I'd like that.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_1": "Friend sent a nudge",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_10": "It's okay. Now that you've added me, we can chat whenever. You'll get the hang of it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_11": "Thank you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_12": "My training hall is at the summit of the Eastern Xuan Peaks. Are you available?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_13": "I'll head over now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_15": "Of course, I'm free. I'll be there in a flash.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_16": "Good. I shall be waiting.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_2": "Friend sent a nudge",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_3": "{PlayerName}, I write to you thus: The skies are clear",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_4": "{PlayerName}, I write to you thus: \nThe skies are clear today, the breeze is gentle, and the weather is most pleasant. Since our hurried parting the other day, I have been occupied handling the Tacet Discords. If you have the time, would you care to visit the training hall? There is something important I wish to discuss.\nQingxiao, respectfully",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_5": "Qingxiao? Isn't this a little too formal?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_6": "You don't have to write WavesLine messages like letters. You can just talk normally.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_7": "Understood. I only recently learned how to use WavesLine on the Terminal, so I'm still familiarizing myself with the proper etiquette.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_655_9": "It's okay.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_657_1": "No wonder the Fillet Fairmaiden's running around all day. She's hosting Paragon Qingxiao!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_658_1": "Hey, I heard Paragon Qingxiao recently took a disciple. You think it's the one beside her?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_658_2": "Could it be? But {Male=he;Female=she}'s the great hero from Jinzhou!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_1": "You're here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_10": "...Still at the very first step. Finding my first disciple.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_11": "The first disciple is the foundation, the face the school shows to the world. I must choose with the utmost care.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_12": "Well, you did teach me to fly with a sword not long ago. Doesn't that mean...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_17": "This is...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_18": "A sword talisman. I carved it myself over the last few days. My lifebound Sword Intent lives inside it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_2": "...So this is your training hall?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_22": "To be my disciple, you must sever worldly ties, cast aside the six desires, and leave karma behind.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_23": "And if, in the end, I cannot?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_24": "Then by that time, you will have found a Way of your own.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_26": "So, now comes the second step, I guess?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_27": "I treat you to a meal.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_28": "I believe it's called an Initiation Feast. When my master accepted me, she broke years of fasting just to share a meal.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_29": "Back in the Xuanyuan Domain, I called you \"disciple,\" yes. And you called me \"master.\" But that journey has already ended.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_3": "When I first settled here, it was nothing but an abandoned shack. Over the years, the local folk have helped me repair it of their own accord.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_30": "I have not truly guided you. Your swordcraft already stands on its own. I've no right to claim you as disciple.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_31": "So... it must be your choice.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_32": "Qingxiao. If you'll have me, then our journey doesn't need to be over.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_33": "...Very well.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_34": "According to how my own master accepted me, taking on a disciple requires two steps. This shall be the first.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_35": "Think of it as a keepsake of our knowing each other... or as a bond between master and disciple. I hope you will take it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_36": "(Accept it solemnly)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_37": "Bring along your adorable little friend as well.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_38": "\"Adorable\"... You mean Abby?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_39": "At her mountain training hall, Qingxiao tells you she wants to found her own school, but what she lacks is a first disciple to serve as its foundation. Your journey to the Sanctum may be over, but your time together is not. Qingxiao holds a brief ceremony to formally take you on as her first disciple, presenting you with a sword talisman containing her feelings, then invites you out to share a meal.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_4": "I owe them a great debt. Cultivation may not need worldly comforts, but if I am to found a school, I should at least have a proper training hall.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_5": "...Found a school?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_6": "I want to open a school here in Xuanfang. Teach others the way of the sword.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_7": "So you're really coming down from the mountain after all.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_8": "The Sword Transcendent is taking disciples now?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_660_9": "Where are you at with this?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_1": "Mengzhou Fish in Vinegar—coming right up! Caught from the Luo River just this morning. You won't find fresher!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_10": "Many years ago, a fellow Cultivator passed through Xuanfang with his disciple during their travels across Huanglong. He came up the mountain to visit me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_11": "Only then did I learn that to solve Temporal Disruption for future generations, he had to set a plan in motion with a \"<ano=you>golden-eyed one</ano>\" at Mt. Firmament. It cost him dearly. His lifespan was nearly spent.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_12": "And yet, he was at total peace. He had a disciple to inherit his legacy, and his teachings were already taking root across the world.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_13": "Master Xuanmiao... and Changli?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_14": "Even if one can no longer walk their Way, or devote their life to \"peace under heaven,\" there will always be... someone to take their place.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_15": "That is the lesson you taught me, not so long ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_16": "So, as your first and most devoted disciple, it looks like I'll be helping with the teaching too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_17": "...You already have.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_18": "To teach the sword is to offer someone a chance to find their own way with it. Even if they never master it, their body and spirit will still become stronger.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_19": "Speaking of which, what are you naming the school?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_2": "Mmm, yum-yum-yum-yum-yum!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_20": "What should I say if someone asks where I've studied?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_21": "Well...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_22": "Did you hear? That Transcendent lady is incredible! They say she's the master of the greatest martial arts school in the whole wide world!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_23": "What's it called again?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_24": "Uh, Xuan... Xuanyuan School! Yeah, it's the best in the world!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_25": "In that case... Xuanyuan School it shall be.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_26": "In this life, we part more than we gather. Nine times out of ten, the world is not as we wish.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_27": "But may we, humble as we are, pass the torch, and never cease to rise.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_28": "Hm? Did Paragon Qingxiao leave this behind?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_29": "...<i>Swordcraft of the Golden-Eyed One</i>?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_3": "Blegh! So sour! What's wrong with this fish?!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_30": "After enjoying a plate of Mengzhou Fish in Vinegar, you and Qingxiao stroll through the streets of Xuanfang Hold. She recalls the time Master Xuanmiao once visited with young Changli. Xuanmiao's lifespan was already badly depleted by then, his days numbered, but he had already found someone to carry on after him. Traveling alongside you, Qingxiao has come to understand that same idea of passing the torch forward, and it is why she seeks to found her own school. She hopes that by teaching swordcraft, she can offer others a chance to walk the path of the blade. True to old rumors and the hopes of local children, she names the new school the Xuanyuan School. When you part, you notice an old, weathered sword manual lying quietly on the restaurant table, apparently left behind by Qingxiao. Inside are illustrations of sword techniques you recognize as your own, from long ago.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_4": "This was the signature dish of \"Yuan's Flavors\" in the late Fortress. I received an invitation to eat there once. One bite, and the taste has never left me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_5": "Disciple, would you like to try some?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_6": "Before I always saw the people... as those who quietly waited to be protected.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_7": "But the truth is, they've always had the heart to protect themselves.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_8": "To save for a day, or to save for a lifetime... Neither compares to teaching them the means to save themselves.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_665_9": "So... that's the real reason you're founding a school?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_700_1": "Pay attention. Stop gawking. You'll get tired of the view soon enough.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_700_2": "Sorry, it's just the mechanisms are beyond anything I've ever seen...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_702_1": "You've been on this Cloud Shuttle for days now. How are you still acting like a rookie on their first day?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_702_2": "Master, I was just thinking. If these mechanisms can already run themselves... then won't the repair crews be out of a job one day?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_702_3": "A fleet this massive... and all it takes to keep it running is a handful of people from the Ministry of Development and Zhuojun Atelier.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_702_4": "All we really do is inspect them every day. If something breaks, swap in a spare part. That's it...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_702_5": "So we keep studying mechanist arts... and before we know it, the machines will have taken our place.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_702_6": "So? If you don't learn this craft, then when one of them does break down, you won't even know where to look.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_702_7": "Hmph. \"One day\" isn't today.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_705_1": "I miss the braised pork from <b>Yuan's Flavors</b>.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_705_2": "Sounds like you're just homesick.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_706_1": "Homesick? Once the Cloud Shuttles dock at Yuan Fortress to restock, I'll be able to go home anyway.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_706_2": "Then why bring up braised pork all of a sudden? Are the rations finally getting to you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_706_3": "You know, I can barely taste a thing nowadays. Whatever I eat or drink... nothing.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_706_4": "So... just thought the food at Yuan's Flavors might make a difference.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_706_5": "...Truth is, I'm the same. For some reason, I feel like... I've just stopped feeling much of anything lately.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_709_1": "Back during the Fortress and Gorges War, these Autopuppets were like heavenly soldiers from the legends.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_1": "There is no trace of Hsin nearby. She is not here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_10": "Big time what now? Anyway... hi there. Nice meeting ya, I'm Abby.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_11": "Hello. Abby... I'll remember that name.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_12": "Oh, I found where that smell is coming from. This way!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_13": "What's this...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_14": "Its frequency is a lot like that weird-smelling Autopuppet kernel from last time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_15": "Hmm, Suisui did mention an informant who met her outside Fogveil Pagoda before—",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_16": "...If there were no hiccups, the <b>Cat of the Nether Lamp</b> should have made contact with Muyu by now.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_17": "...He is one of our people inside Zhuojun Atelier. But our cooperation with him has limits. Mutual limits. We don't even know his true name.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_18": "...Identifying traits? The Tacet Mark down his eye, a <ano=copper coin>Qingfu</ano> pendant on his belt, and... an odd lamp that's always burning.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_19": "The Guild's intelligence says a special <ano=Remnant Creature>spirit</ano> is sealed within the lamp. That's where his Jianghu moniker comes from.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_2": "The Prism of Fate isn't responding either...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_20": "If the informant wore a similar pendant, this didn't wind up here by accident. He likely left it on purpose.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_21": "Hm, he likely did so because he anticipated that someone would come here soon.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_22": "And those who come to this chamber are either connected to Hsin or seeking Her.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_23": "Then this may be a clue that's meant for us.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_24": "Mm... I don't get it. Why only a pendant? A note or a letter would've been a whole lot more obvious.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_25": "Could've been... that he had no time to leave a message, just something he carried on him.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_26": "I have seen copper coins like this before. In Mengzhou's rural areas, many call them \"Yin coins.\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_27": "Yin coins?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_28": "I know little beyond that. The people of Xianling Village should be more familiar with them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_29": "Then let's go ask around Xianling Village. We don't have any other leads.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_3": "Hey, do you smell that? Something weird is nearby. Sniff, sniff... Huh?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_30": "Once we understand its significance, we can figure out what this \"Cat of the Nether Lamp\" was trying to tell us.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_31": "I will go with you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_32": "These disruptions in the ancient order are not trivial. If more Tacet Discords escape, the people around Shaftpost Yard will suffer first.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_33": "You and Qingxiao search Hsin's chamber together but find no trace of Her frequency. With Abby's help, you come across a mysterious Qingfu pendant, seemingly a clue left behind by the \"Cat of the Nether Lamp,\" the Nethermancer who once worked with Suisui. Following this lead, you head to Xianling Village to ask the locals about it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_4": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_5": "Uuugh... {PlayerName}, she's lookin' at me funny!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_6": "In all my travels across Huanglong, I've encountered many Tacet Discords and Echoes. Yet never one quite so curious.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_7": "This is my longtime partner.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_8": "This one lives in my Tacet Mark. Big time foodie.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_70_9": "Yessiree! So uh... hi there. Nice meeting ya, I'm Abby.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_710_1": "Back during the Fortress and Gorges War, these Autopuppets were like heavenly soldiers from the legends.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_710_2": "But the truth is, we know nothing about their internal structure or how they function. Is this technology we were ever meant to possess?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_710_3": "What would happen if one day they stopped helping us and instead became accomplices to some person or purpose instead?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_710_4": "Even the Cloud Shuttles themselves might... Ugh. Maybe all these sleepless nights are making me paranoid.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_750_1": "There's some bad news. You should probably brace yourself.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_750_2": "Just say it.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_750_3": "Your sister's condition worsened not long ago. She's gone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_751_1": "Your sister's condition worsened not long ago. She's gone.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_751_2": "I always knew this day would come.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_751_3": "Are you okay? It wasn't just anyone who died. It was the little sister you cared so much about!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_751_4": "...I know. But right now, all I feel is emptiness.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_751_5": "Once the maintenance work is done, I'll return to Yuan Fortress for the customary funeral.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_755_1": "Did I just... doze off?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_755_2": "...I think I dreamed of a different Fortress and Gorges War.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_756_1": "Did I just... doze off?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_756_2": "...I think I dreamed of a different Fortress and Gorges War.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_756_3": "In it, Tacet Discords swarmed toward Yuan Fortress without end, but there were no Cloud Shuttles or Autopuppets to save us.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_756_4": "All we had were Bladepuppets, city walls, and trenches. The defenses were shattered. So many people fell...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_756_5": "Guess I've gone too long without sleep. That must be why my mind conjures up such nonsense.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_760_1": "One hundred and thirteenth routine inspection...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_760_2": "Mechanisms functioning normally.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_760_3": "One hundred and fourteenth routine inspection... One hundred and fifteenth routine inspection...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_770_1": "Beloved. Cannot move. Waiting.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_771_1": "The one inside it is my wife. While we were fleeing, she protected me.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_771_2": "She can't seem to move anymore. But if I stay here beside her...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_771_3": "Maybe one day she'll stand up again, right?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_780_1": "Nowhere to go. Village. Home.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_781_1": "We \"woke up\" one by one. None of us could remember where we were supposed to go.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_781_2": "But we knew one thing: we were different from those Autopuppets that only follow orders.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_781_3": "Slowly, we gathered here... hoping to live normal lives again, like before.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_781_4": "This place is our base, our village, and our new home. We won't let it be taken from us.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_790_1": "Everyone's safety. Must protect.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_1": "The village chief did not tell you, but... it was me. I am the one who set off the seal to close off our village.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_2": "I only meant to keep those Autopuppets out. But the fog corrupted the mechanism. Now it will never shut off.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_3": "We live again... but so many were left outside. Did I do the wrong thing?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_4": "This isn't a simple matter of right or wrong.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_5": "You were wrong.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_6": "I have been thinking about it all this time. I have not found an answer. If none of this had happened, maybe we could have gone on living in these bodies. Peacefully.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_7": "Thank you. An answer, even a hard one, is better than being stuck ruminating forever. I will go apologize to the dead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_8": "The one at fault is the man who sent the Autopuppets.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_791_9": "...Thank you. I understand now. No matter what, I should apologize to the dead.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_800_1": "Phew, thank you! Lucky for us you were here.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_805_1": "Our thanks for the assistance. We'll regroup with Watcher Yangyang and the others straightaway.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_80_1": "That is... the Four Chime Shaftpost alarm.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_80_2": "She can fly on her sword...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_80_3": "The moment you reach the high ground above Xianling Village, the Four Chime Shaftpost sounds the alarm. Tacet Discords are attacking the village, and chaos has broken out. You rush in to help.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_81_2": "Did these Tacet Discords escape from Censure Cages too?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_81_3": "Yes. Perhaps... Fogveil Pagoda is not the only place compromised.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_850_1": "Keep your eyes on the Rafter Kites. If there's a swarm of Tacet Discords headed our way, they will be our first warning.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_855_1": "By order of General Jiyan, our unit has arrived to provide reinforcements.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_855_2": "We are in position and awaiting your orders.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_855_3": "Long march. You have my thanks.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_855_4": "The defensive line is set, but we're spread thin. Your timing could not be better.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_1": "Whew... Thank you for saving us, Paragon Qingxiao. And... Ah, you're the great hero who helped the Wardens defend Xuanfang Hold.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_10": "Burns incense...?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_11": "Oh, that? She lights incense before the <b>Sword Transcendent's</b> spirit tablet. Prays for good luck and health. Some of the older folks believe in such things.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_12": "...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_13": "There is something I would like to ask you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_14": "We'd like to know what this pendant means in Mengzhou.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_16": "Hsss... those are no ordinary copper coins. The <b>Nethermancers</b> in Mengzhou carry coins just like that.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_17": "Nethermancers?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_18": "Not a good place to talk. Too many ears... But word is, they're a lawless bunch. \"Thieves,\" through and through.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_19": "Hmph, if you want the full telling, go ask Granny Yanshu by the village gate.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_2": "Never thought we'd see Tacet Discords around the village again. Times like these... we could really use those Autopuppets back.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_20": "She's not a bad person, it's just... most folks in the village have their reasons for keeping a distance.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_21": "I see. I will go speak with her.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_22": "That's not really fair. Some say they are righteous wanderers, too.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_23": "With the Tacet Discords eliminated, the villagers quickly gather around you.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_24": "The villagers tell you that Autopuppets across the region have been shutting down, and Fogveil Pagoda isn't the only place with such anomalies. The coins on the pendant you found seem tied to Mengzhou's Nethermancers. The villagers suggest you ask Granny Yanshu, who lives near the village gate.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_3": "Is something wrong with the Autopuppets?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_4": "Well... ever since the last incident, there haven't been many working ones left around the village.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_5": "They'll be standing fine one moment, then just drop the next. Even the Ministry folks couldn't fix them.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_6": "(...That sounds exactly like the Autopuppets we encountered back at the Pagoda.)",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_7": "These days, we rely on the Ministry's soldiers to keep us safe. But they're run ragged. Too much to do, not enough hands.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_8": "Do not worry. The Four Chime Shaftpost has sounded. The Xuanfang Wardens will arrive shortly. I will brief them myself.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_90_9": "With you down from the mountain, Paragon, we can rest easy. My mother, she never forgets your deeds. She even burns incense for you at home.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_91_1": "So beautiful... First time seeing Paragon Qingxiao with my own eyes.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_91_2": "Grandfather and Grandmother were right. She looks exactly like the Sword Transcendent in the paintings.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_91_3": "That's not the half of it. She's the master of the finest cultivation school in all the land.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_92_1": "Huh? What does the Paragon have to do with a cultivation school?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_92_2": "Well, she is the master of the Xuanyuan School in the Eastern Xuan Peaks. The only <b>Perfected One</b> in all of Xuanfang. She has watched over this land for centuries.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_92_3": "At the <b>Martial Arts Championship</b> a few years back, she was an honored guest. Many sect leaders even greeted her as their \"Transcendent Elder.\"",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_92_4": "Why, even the great Daoist Master Jiufeng, with all his profound knowledge, sent his favorite disciples to her for guidance.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_92_6": "All I know is Paragon Qingxiao has been around since my great-great-grandmother's time.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_92_7": "But I've never heard of this Xuanyuan School... You didn't make that up, did you?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_93_1": "See that? That's what a true \"cultivator\" looks like.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_93_2": "Growing both body and spirit. Being one with nature. Breathing the same breath as Heaven and Earth...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_93_3": "Grandfather, what are you even saying?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_94_1": "When your grandfather was young, I read a few storybooks. Got it into my head to roam the great mountains, find a famous master, and become a cultivator myself.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_94_2": "Then why not ask Master Qingxiao to take you as her disciple?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_94_3": "Hah. Paragon Qingxiao does not take disciples. In all these years, nobody has proved worthy.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_94_5": "Cultivation takes a bit of talent, yes. But it takes an even steadier mind. To let nothing in this world disturb your inner peace… That, my boy, is a rare and precious skill.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_94_6": "Why's that?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_95_1": "Ah... I was hoping to set up my stall and tell tales of the Fortress and Gorges War.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_95_2": "Now there's trouble in these parts again...",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_96_1": "Bless me, Paragon Qingxiao. Let me pass the Ministry of Development's selection.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_96_2": "And Lady Hsin, bless me too, though it has been a long while since anyone laid eyes on You... Please, I beg you both, show your power!",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_96_3": "...I can't tell if you're superstitious or just trying to cover all your bets.",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_97_1": "The Qing who wrote \"Records of Huanglong Tacet Discords\"... That's actually Paragon Qingxiao?",
--  "Main_Mengzhou_3_6_97_2": "I would die for her autograph...",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_10_1": "Should I place a few more swords here?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_12_1": "The white plum blossoms look more vibrant now. Is it because of your presence...?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_13_1": "In this mortal world, a full moon is a rare blessing.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_1": "What brings you back, my disciple?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_10": "How do you feel now?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_11": "No discomfort at all.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_12": "Ouch, my head hurts... I don't think I can make it.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_13": "That is good to hear. If you do feel any discomfort, you must speak up—just as you once asked of me.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_14": "That's... you must not jinx yourself like that, my disciple.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_15": "Mm... Do you still remember my \"inner landscape?\"",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_16": "You mean your inner world?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_17": "The one with the lake and the white plum tree...?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_18": "Exactly. The strand of my Sword Intent that I gave you allows you to visit my inner landscape at will.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_19": "It has finally regained its former tranquility, making it a good place to rest.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_2": "I just wanted to drop by and visit you.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_20": "Qingxiao, are you... inviting me into your inner landscape?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_21": "...",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_22": "...Cultivating within the inner landscape brings great peace to the minds of both parties, even if only for a brief moment.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_23": "What do you think of the idea?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_24": "Sure. After you, then.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_25": "Maybe next time. I still have a few things to take care of.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_26": "Come. You need only follow my guidance, and feel the flow of Forte within your body—",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_27": "I see. Feel free to seek me out whenever you are free.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_3": "To visit my dear Master, of course.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_4": "...Very well. There is no need to worry about me. The flowers are in full bloom right now. You should stay a while and enjoy the view.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_5": "This melody you're playing... It sounds like you're in a good mood.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_6": "Perhaps. As I looked out over the Land of Xuanfang this morning, I happened to see clouds and mist ascending in the distance. A truly auspicious sign.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_7": "It seems our journey to the Sanctum has finally resolved much of the karma left behind since the Fortress and Gorges War.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_8": "Things have finally settled down for now.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_1_9": "My disciple, you accepted Hsin's power before, and your body still needs time to adapt to it. You have been running ragged across Xuanfang lately without a moment's rest.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_2_1": "Do you have a few moments to spare, my disciple?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_2_2": "Let's go to your inner landscape.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_2_3": "I still have a few things to take care of.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_2_4": "Come. You need only follow my guidance, and feel the flow of Forte within your body—",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_2_5": "Worry not. I will be waiting for you.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_1": "Is there anything you need, my disciple?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_10": "Not long ago, I submitted a formal request to the Ministry of War to establish the Xuanyuan School. For the member registry, I recorded both of our names.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_11": "I didn't know that requires proper procedures?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_12": "Of course. The funding can be covered by the stipend I accumulated over the years, but the location... Relying solely on the mountaintop training hall is bound to be inconvenient.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_13": "Xuanfang has not fully returned to peace just yet. We cannot afford to deplete too much manpower or resources right now.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_14": "It's fine. We can take things one step at a time.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_15": "Mm. There are still other matters to attend to. For the time being... our school consists only of the two of us.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_16": "So, when do you plan to share your tips on cultivation, Master?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_17": "...Right. Remember: keep early hours, eat regular meals, prioritize rest, cleanse your mind and body often, and avoid needless worry.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_18": "That easy?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_19": "I was imagining spells or something more profound…",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_2": "I want to chat with you.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_20": "That is more than enough for you to begin with. It may sound simple, but consistency is the true challenge.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_21": "As for the deeper insights, those rely far more on your own personal enlightenment. I will guide you through them in the days to come.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_22": "How do you feel now, Qingxiao? And your Inner Demon... is she taken care of?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_23": "Worry not for me. Back in the Xuanyuan Domain, the Heart Swords offered up by the soldiers and civillians replenished my Forte. After some rest, I have almost recovered.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_24": "As for my Inner Demon, she has become an indispensable part of me now. Only that...",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_25": "Only that?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_26": "...She occasionally materializes by latching onto the frequency of my overflowing Sword Intent, just to play pranks... If you ever happen to run into <ano=me>her</ano>, pay her no mind.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_27": "Here. Give me your hand.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_3": "I want to visit your inner landscape.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_4": "Nothing.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_5": "Very well. I would like to speak with you as well.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_6": "Talk about recent events.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_7": "Talk about cultivation insights.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_8": "Talk about Qingxiao's health conditions.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_3_9": "That's enough for today.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_1": "My disciple, you have seen every corner of my inner landscape by now.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_2": "You may do whatever you wish here, whether it is to rest or to cultivate. Simply follow where your heart leads.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_3": "Could you play a tune for me?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_4": "Let's take a walk together.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_5": "I think we can call it a day. Can you lead me back out?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_6": "Sure. I'll just look around myself.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_7": "I see. Then allow me to play a melody for you.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_8": "Mm. A walk it is, then.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_4_9": "Very well. Follow my guidance—",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_5_1": "Do you need a rest?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_5_2": "Sure. Let's return to the white plum tree.",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_5_3": "I think we can call it a day. Can you lead me back out?",
--  "QingXiao_Shengtai_5_4": "We can keep walking a bit longer."
-+  "MXXSST_10_1": "So? Has the Nexus Fox Shadow truly returned to normal?",
-+  "MXXSST_10_2": "It has! Based on the data we pulled, Suhsin's influence has been completely neutralized!",
-+  "MXXSST_11_1": "{PlayerName}! You really kept your word! So you and Lady Hsin already dealt with Suhsin?",
-+  "MXXSST_11_2": "It's a long story. Tell me, has the Fox Shadow's behavior changed?",
-+  "MXXSST_11_3": "Yes! It's back to its original state!",
-+  "MXXSST_11_4": "That's not quite right. It isn't truly back to its \"original state.\" Before, the Fox Shadow would either aid us on its own, or after we'd asked Lady Hsin for help.",
-+  "MXXSST_11_5": "But now that Lady Hsin is no longer within the Simulacrum Nexus, we can only reach it through the Shadow Binder. That's a world of difference.",
-+  "MXXSST_11_6": "True... And the Shadow Binder only mends the parts of the Fox Shadow that Suhsin corrupted. It's going to need some serious modifications from here on.",
-+  "MXXSST_11_7": "But at its core, the Fox Shadow is a creation of Fractal Proliferation. And Suhsin's power likely shares the same origin as Lady Hsin's. So perhaps all we need to do is adjust—",
-+  "MXXSST_11_8": "(I'd been worried the Fox Shadow might turn on them once Hsin was gone. Looks like I can finally put that fear to rest.)",
-+  "MXXSST_13_1": "Those \"phantoms\"... There have been more of them lately...",
-+  "MXXSST_13_2": "By \"phantoms,\" do you mean the Mengzhou citizens scattered across the Simulacrum Nexus?",
-+  "MXXSST_13_3": "That's right. They're projections from Lady Hsin's memory data. I was completely baffled the first time I met them.",
-+  "MXXSST_13_4": "Back when we were studying the Civilization Capsule, it never crossed our minds that beings so vivid, so real, could exist within a civilization \"blueprint.\"",
-+  "MXXSST_13_5": "But after Lady Hsin explained it, I understood. She believes the people of Mengzhou are part of its civilization too. That's why She did it.",
-+  "MXXSST_13_6": "What about you? Do you think a Civilization Capsule should include \"phantoms\" like them?",
-+  "MXXSST_13_7": "Haha, I can't speak for the other Sentinels. But if it's Lady Hsin's Civilization Capsule, then this is exactly how it should be.",
-+  "MXXSST_14_1": "All these \"phantoms\"... Can Lady Hsin really sustain every one of them?",
-+  "MXXSST_15_1": "All these \"phantoms\"... Can Lady Hsin really sustain every one of them?",
-+  "MXXSST_15_2": "What was that about Hsin?",
-+  "MXXSST_15_3": "{PlayerName}, surely you've noticed these \"phantoms\" come from different timelines, spanning centuries apart, yes?",
-+  "MXXSST_15_4": "I have. They're Hsin's memory projections, so it makes sense.",
-+  "MXXSST_15_5": "Exactly. But that means it costs Lady Hsin extra computational power to reunite people who could never otherwise have met, just to give them a chance to make up for their regrets.",
-+  "MXXSST_15_6": "That sounds just like Hsin. She can't bear to see people suffer. Is there some problem with that?",
-+  "MXXSST_15_7": "I'm just worried that the more \"phantoms\" there are, the heavier the burden on Her to keep them all here...",
-+  "MXXSST_15_8": "Don't worry. She knows Her own limits. If anything, take it as a good sign. We're only seeing this because Her condition is better than ever.",
-+  "MXXSST_15_9": "Ah, that's true. Hearing you say that puts my mind at ease. Guess I was worrying over nothing.",
-+  "MXXSST_16_1": "Look at this! My hands are trembling. The level of detail in Lady Hsin's simulation is really that precise.",
-+  "MXXSST_16_2": "Is this keyed to my frequency specifically, or is there some uniform logic behind it—",
-+  "MXXSST_17_1": "Stop right there. Your hands are shaking because you're exhausted. Quit analyzing and go take a break already.",
-+  "MXXSST_17_10": "Listen... my brain's too fried to work right now. How about you take me somewhere nice for some of those Moon Fox Rice Cakes?",
-+  "MXXSST_17_2": "Ugh, every time it comes to this, I always wonder why Lady Hsin even bothered to simulate a feeling like this. Rest, sleep, hunger… it's all just noise. It only gets in the way.",
-+  "MXXSST_17_3": "Look where we are. Inside the Civilization Capsule. Endless knowledge, the very  Sentinel technology we once only dreamed of now right in front of us. I don't have time to waste on—",
-+  "MXXSST_17_4": "I actually rather like it. Beyond just the knowledge, I get to enjoy the changing seasons and the beauty of this place.",
-+  "MXXSST_17_5": "And when I'm feeling worn out, I can find a good view and treat myself to some Moon Fox Rice Cakes. Doing that reminds me why we came here in the first place.",
-+  "MXXSST_17_6": "Why we came here? Wasn't it to study Sentinel technology and push civilization forward? I don't need reminding. I've never forgotten.",
-+  "MXXSST_17_7": "Yes, but I think the whole point of advancing civilization is to free people from suffering so they can experience things, enjoy them, and have the freedom to choose. If we lose sight of that along the way, what's the point?",
-+  "MXXSST_17_8": "Sigh... Maybe you've got a point. But as long as we've got someone like you around, that's enough for me. I'll just keep my head down and work!",
-+  "MXXSST_17_9": "Wow. You really are impossible.",
-+  "MXXSST_18_1": "So this grand cause, a century in the making, is finally drawing to a close?",
-+  "MXXSST_19_1": "{PlayerName}, thank you for your help. With Suhsin gone, the remolding has picked up pace. It won't be long now.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_10": "Hsin will gather every Celestial's frequency into a Prism of Fate and sustain your existence with Her own computational power. And once the people of Solaris grow strong enough to reach a level of power comparable to a Sentinel's, She'll grant you new bodies.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_11": "You mean... I might still have the chance to witness such a future with my own eyes...?",
-+  "MXXSST_19_12": "If that is so, then there could be nothing more wonderful in all the world. Thank you for telling me this, {PlayerName}.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_2": "I accepted my fate the day I swore my oath. But I never expected that the one I'd find hardest to let go of... would be Lady Hsin.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_3": "That only sounds natural to me.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_4": "Haha, I suppose it would. You know Lady Hsin better than most. I imagine you understand exactly what I'm feeling right now.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_5": "The Sentinels we once knew cared for Solaris, without a doubt. But their compassion always felt distant. Noble, yet somehow beyond reach.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_6": "Lady Hsin, though... She'd come right up to us, praise our work, and gush about Her favorite stalls at the Waking Moon Festival. And when someone was lost to the anomalies... She'd cover her face and weep for them.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_7": "My resolve has never once faltered. Still, I count it as the fortune of three lifetimes—that the Sentinel I gave my oath to was Hsin the Moon Fox.",
-+  "MXXSST_19_8": "If that's the case, you should have a little more faith. Do you think Hsin would let the people who stood by Her for a century to remold the Civilization Capsule just fade away?",
-+  "MXXSST_19_9": "But our oath...",
-+  "MXXSST_1_1": "What do you think? Happy? Moved? Or... awestruck, maybe?",
-+  "MXXSST_1_2": "None of that. It was more like... How do I even put it...",
-+  "MXXSST_21_1": "I was right there when the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs held that meeting.",
-+  "MXXSST_21_2": "Lately, Lady Hsin has been acting much more as She did back then...",
-+  "MXXSST_21_3": "Which means... She's likely taken on just as heavy a burden as She did back then.",
-+  "MXXSST_21_4": "Yes. All we can do is watch Her moods closely, and stay alert for any unexpected shifts in each Heart Realm.",
-+  "MXXSST_21_5": "We need to keep a close eye on the Heart of Bloom. It only regained its stability not long ago...",
-+  "MXXSST_21_6": "Agreed. Let's do all we can to share Her burden.",
-+  "MXXSST_23_1": "Are you alright? How do you feel? Any discomfort?",
-+  "MXXSST_23_10": "Thank you. I'll always remember... you were my very first patient.",
-+  "MXXSST_23_2": "Mhm... I'm fine. Honestly, Doctor, I feel like you're more nervous than I am.",
-+  "MXXSST_23_3": "That's because you're the first patient I've treated entirely on my own. I need to prove I can deliver the proper care if I want to stand on my own.",
-+  "MXXSST_23_4": "But... your wound might leave a scar. And you've already got a big old scar on your thigh. I'm so sorry...",
-+  "MXXSST_23_5": "Huh? Oh, that... It's nothing. Actually, let me tell you how I got it!",
-+  "MXXSST_23_6": "I was a handful as a kid. Wandered off alone into the mountains, took a bad fall, and couldn't move a muscle. Just lay there crying, not knowing what to do.",
-+  "MXXSST_23_7": "But then, out of nowhere, a little fox with glowing fur came up to me and started licking my wound. It didn't heal, exactly, but the pain faded entirely. So I just held it close until the grown-ups finally found me.",
-+  "MXXSST_23_8": "A fox? Could it have been...?",
-+  "MXXSST_23_9": "Maybe. Anyway, that old scar has its story, and so does this new one. This one's proof of a healer coming into her own. So please, don't dwell on it.",
-+  "MXXSST_25_1": "The Grand Helm treated you well! Why would you betray us?!",
-+  "MXXSST_25_10": "What? Wait... Sister!",
-+  "MXXSST_25_2": "Heh, even now, you're still completely in the dark...",
-+  "MXXSST_25_3": "What do you mean by that?! Spill it!",
-+  "MXXSST_25_4": "The Atelier isn't what we dreamed it would be anymore! Tell me, how many of us are even working on water performances?",
-+  "MXXSST_25_5": "Too many now want to twist Automata Mechanics to darker ends. Especially... after that meeting.",
-+  "MXXSST_25_6": "Meeting? What meeting?",
-+  "MXXSST_25_7": "Sigh... It doesn't matter anymore.",
-+  "MXXSST_25_8": "Understand this. We came here because we couldn't let go of the water performances that captivated us as children. But what will become of the Zhuojun Atelier now? I can't even picture it...",
-+  "MXXSST_25_9": "One thing's for certain, though. It won't be anything I'd want to be part of. You should leave soon, too.",
-+  "MXXSST_26_1": "Every time I speak with you inside that Autopuppet body, it feels… strange.",
-+  "MXXSST_26_2": "Strange how? It's still me, just with a different look.",
-+  "MXXSST_27_1": "So right now, your mind, your emotions... They're basically like the AI running this Autopuppet, right?",
-+  "MXXSST_27_2": "You could say that, I suppose. But I still don't see where you're going with this.",
-+  "MXXSST_27_3": "Don't you see? Sentinels are, at their core, machines granted emotions. And if it were merely a matter of simulating comparable feelings and thoughts, our own technology could manage that much.",
-+  "MXXSST_27_4": "But the Sentinels were created to guide civilizations! Well? See where I'm heading?",
-+  "MXXSST_27_5": "Huh? Hold on, let me think... Oh, so whoever sent them here must have decided exactly what kind of emotions and thought processes each Sentinel would need to do their job.",
-+  "MXXSST_27_6": "Exactly! And it gets even more interesting when you realize each Sentinel has a different personality. Fascinating, right?",
-+  "MXXSST_27_7": "(I'd like to know the answer too... but maybe they just poured the best of what they'd experienced and felt into the Sentinels.)",
-+  "MXXSST_28_1": "If I were controlling a multi-armed Autopuppet, I wonder what that would even feel like...",
-+  "MXXSST_28_2": "A novel sensation, I'm sure. Maybe I'll ask someone who's piloted a Lionarch later.",
-+  "MXXSST_29_1": "{PlayerName}! Do you have a moment? There's something I need to ask you!",
-+  "MXXSST_2_1": "What do you think? Happy? Moved? Or... awestruck, maybe?",
-+  "MXXSST_2_2": "None of that. It was more like... How do I even put it...",
-+  "MXXSST_2_3": "Come on, it can't be that hard. You met Lady Hsin at the Waking Moon Festival. What else could you be but happy?",
-+  "MXXSST_2_4": "Of course I was happy. But there's more to it than just that.",
-+  "MXXSST_2_5": "It's just... that night, She moved through the crowd just like anyone else. But everyone's eyes were somehow drawn straight to Her.",
-+  "MXXSST_2_6": "They flocked to Her, but not me. I froze. Stood there like a stump, watching Her through all that noise and hustle.",
-+  "MXXSST_2_7": "She gave this little smile, and those gold-red eyes swept over the crowd. It was over in a heartbeat, but it felt like She looked at each one of us for an eternity...",
-+  "MXXSST_2_8": "I still can't put that feeling into words. All I know is that She seemed to see straight through me, and I knew I had to see Her again.",
-+  "MXXSST_2_9": "Next year... and every year after, you'll find me at the Waking Moon Festival.",
-+  "MXXSST_30_1": "Sorry to trouble you. You're from outside the Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou, aren't you? Have you ever heard of the Myriad Snare?",
-+  "MXXSST_30_10": "Then Bizhong is... How could... Ugh, no. I'm okay. I think he'd actually be grateful you did that. A rogue Myriad Snare would've been a danger to the homeland he loved so much.",
-+  "MXXSST_30_11": "Let me thank you on his behalf. Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
-+  "MXXSST_30_2": "Sure, but it was all but in ruins when I saw it. All that remained there was a single, powerful Autopuppet. Why do you ask?",
-+  "MXXSST_30_3": "Only an Autopuppet left? Then does that mean... Bizhong has been there all alone, all these hundred years?",
-+  "MXXSST_30_4": "Ah, let me explain. Bizhong is a member of the Court of Savantae. The lead designer of Skyworks, in fact. You've been there, so I'm sure you can tell how gifted he is.",
-+  "MXXSST_30_5": "He was meant to come here with us. But he chose to stay behind at the Myriad Snare to protect his homeland, the Western Fang Peaks.",
-+  "MXXSST_30_6": "Tell her about the current situation in the Myriad Snare.",
-+  "MXXSST_30_7": "Huaixi... Perhaps he guarded the Myriad Snare for so long that his will was worn away entirely. And the Myriad Snare itself was affected by it...",
-+  "MXXSST_30_8": "A-and then? What became of it?",
-+  "MXXSST_30_9": "To end the chaos spreading through the Skyworks, I had to defeat him.",
-+  "MXXSST_31_1": "To damage an Artisan Autopuppet this badly... Were it a human body, they'd be dead.",
-+  "MXXSST_31_2": "How could I have done something so terrible...",
-+  "MXXSST_32_1": "There are still plenty of spare Artisan Autopuppets, aren't there? Don't be so hard on yourself.",
-+  "MXXSST_32_2": "No, that's not what worries me... While clearing anomalies in the Heart of Frost, I spotted a Kernel Puppet at the foot of a cliff, stuck in the same stasis as everything else.",
-+  "MXXSST_32_3": "I wanted to help it, but reaching the bottom meant a long detour. So I figured I'd just jump off the cliff.  Even if the Artisan Autopuppet broke, I wouldn't get hurt...",
-+  "MXXSST_32_4": "In that moment, I treated not just the Autopuppet, but myself, as nothing more than a tool. I did it because I've spent too long living as a Celestial.",
-+  "MXXSST_32_5": "But then again, why did Lady Hsin preserve our senses, our living forms, and all our emotions? When I think of that, I can't help but feel I've failed to live up to what She wanted for us.",
-+  "MXXSST_32_6": "Exactly. Hsin wants you to live as fully, even as you remold the Civilization Capsule. If you all keep throwing yourselves into such reckless acts, it would trouble Her deeply.",
-+  "MXXSST_32_7": "Heh... Hearing you say that, I can almost picture the look on Lady Hsin's face right now.",
-+  "MXXSST_33_1": "Flying lanterns as far as the eye can see across the Heart of Flames today. This must be the most unforgettable Waking Moon Festival in Lady Hsin's memory.",
-+  "MXXSST_33_2": "If only I could attend it myself...",
-+  "MXXSST_34_1": "First off, I don't believe using Xuanfang technology to build the Cloud Shuttles was a mistake in itself.",
-+  "MXXSST_34_2": "The Cloud Shuttles aren't the point. The point is that progress is meant to be made one step at a time.",
-+  "MXXSST_35_1": "You're just reasoning backward from the fact that the Cloud Shuttles went out of control, aren't you? I'd argue that's on the user. He didn't grasp Xuanfang's technology well enough. That's what caused the failure.",
-+  "MXXSST_35_2": "Had he understood it thoroughly, plenty of those mistakes and accidents could've been avoided.",
-+  "MXXSST_35_3": "But consider this: human understanding is always limited by the times. When faced with technology that's too far ahead, even someone who grasps it can easily cause unforeseeable consequences when they put it to use.",
-+  "MXXSST_35_4": "So you're saying that even with understanding... you could still misuse it because of cognitive blind spots?",
-+  "MXXSST_35_5": "Precisely.",
-+  "MXXSST_35_6": "Sigh... Put like that, raising human cognition to match the Sentinel-level technology is going to be a lot harder than simply understanding the technology itself.",
-+  "MXXSST_35_7": "At the end of the day, was the Cloud Shuttle incident caused by a lack of understanding, or by a gap between cognition and application?",
-+  "MXXSST_35_8": "Either way, it's a problem we have got to solve if we want to wield Sentinel technology.",
-+  "MXXSST_35_9": "And that, of course, is precisely why we're here.",
-+  "MXXSST_36_1": "Do you think Lady Hsin can actually take on the form of a young girl?",
-+  "MXXSST_36_2": "Here we go again! I told you it was just your eyes playing tricks. Still rambling about \"Lady Hsin in her maiden form\"?",
-+  "MXXSST_36_3": "If you really can't let it go, then go find Her yourself!",
-+  "MXXSST_37_1": "{PlayerName}... No, Lady Hsin's Arbiter. I've finally met you!",
-+  "MXXSST_38_1": "To this day, Solaris still struggles against the Threnodians, and the fight remains agonizingly hard. If you know anything, please tell us. Or better yet, use your authority to aid us directly!",
-+  "MXXSST_38_10": "Don't worry about it.",
-+  "MXXSST_38_11": "(Yes... it's exactly because of countless people like her that Solaris's future is full of hope.)",
-+  "MXXSST_38_2": "I...",
-+  "MXXSST_38_3": "Ever since I came into contact with Xuanfang technology, my unease has only deepened. I fear that even technology this astonishing may not be enough to defeat the Threnodians...",
-+  "MXXSST_38_4": "I'm sorry. I can't answer those questions right now. But I can tell you this: Solaris has defeated the Threnodians before. Countless lives and civilizations have been preserved to this day.",
-+  "MXXSST_38_5": "And those victories weren't won overnight through some otherworldly technology alone. We won because of people like you. People willing to bear the cost and give everything they had.",
-+  "MXXSST_38_6": "Take the situation right now. Were it Hsin alone, it would've been impossibly difficult to remold the Civilization Capsule, and Mengzhou would be left with scars that could never heal.",
-+  "MXXSST_38_7": "I understand. But when I joined the Court of Savantae, I wanted to find a way to be rid of the Threnodians once and for all. And yet the further I go, the more overwhelming it all feels.",
-+  "MXXSST_38_8": "Do you... regret becoming a Celestial?",
-+  "MXXSST_38_9": "Not for a moment. However great the troubles, I won't stop moving forward. My questions just now were out of line... Seeing you so suddenly simply caught me off guard, and I let my worry get the better of me.",
-+  "MXXSST_39_1": "{PlayerName}! Look! The Fox Shadow is completely different from before! So I take it you and Lady Hsin have already dealt with Suhsin?",
-+  "MXXSST_39_2": "It's a long story. Tell me, has the Fox Shadow's behavior changed?",
-+  "MXXSST_39_3": "Yes! It's back to its original state!",
-+  "MXXSST_39_4": "That's not quite right. It isn't truly back to its \"original state.\" Before, the Fox Shadow would either aid us on its own, or after we'd asked Lady Hsin for help.",
-+  "MXXSST_39_5": "But now that Lady Hsin is no longer within the Simulacrum Nexus, we can only reach it through the Shadow Binder. That's a world of difference.",
-+  "MXXSST_39_6": "True... And the Shadow Binder only mends the parts of the Fox Shadow that Suhsin corrupted. It's going to need some serious modifications from here on.",
-+  "MXXSST_39_7": "But at its core, the Fox Shadow is a creation of Fractal Proliferation. And Suhsin's power likely shares the same origin as Lady Hsin's. So perhaps all we need to do is adjust—",
-+  "MXXSST_39_8": "(I'd been worried the Fox Shadow might turn on them once Hsin was gone. Looks like I can finally put that fear to rest.)",
-+  "MXXSST_3_1": "Still no sign of Her this year. Could it be... Lady Hsin won't ever come again?",
-+  "MXXSST_3_2": "No... Next year, the year after, however long it takes, as long as I get to see Her one more time...",
-+  "MXXSST_40_1": "Are you really {PlayerName}? I can hardly believe my eyes...",
-+  "MXXSST_41_1": "Are you really {PlayerName}? I can hardly believe my eyes...",
-+  "MXXSST_41_10": "But my own work lies in a different field, so I'm afraid I can't tell you much more than that.",
-+  "MXXSST_41_11": "That's all right. It's good to know that their research wasn't lost to all that upheaval.",
-+  "MXXSST_41_2": "What, do I look funny or something?",
-+  "MXXSST_41_3": "Oh, not at all... It's just that seeing the one who \"fell from the Etheric Sea\" with my own eyes feels a little surreal.",
-+  "MXXSST_41_4": "How did you—Ah. Junxi told you, didn't he?",
-+  "MXXSST_41_5": "Yes. As members of the Court of Savantae, we are of course familiar with Professor Junxi's projects. And what he witnessed in those final moments...",
-+  "MXXSST_41_6": "Even knowing exactly who you are, having you standing right here before me still caught me off guard.",
-+  "MXXSST_41_7": "What became of that research afterward...?",
-+  "MXXSST_41_8": "Rest assured. The Etheric Sea's research value speaks for itself. Besides, Professor Junxi and the researchers under him are truly admirable in both character and insight.",
-+  "MXXSST_41_9": "The breakthroughs made back at the SkyArk Space Station won't be forgotten.",
-+  "MXXSST_42_1": "Did you hear? A Xuan Watcher from a century ago appeared on the battlefield projected by the Heart of Frost.",
-+  "MXXSST_42_2": "I'm assigned to the other Heart Realms, so I hadn't heard a thing about it. What's so special about her?",
-+  "MXXSST_42_3": "Perfect, then you're just the listener I need. Give me a moment, and I'll tell you her whole story.",
-+  "MXXSST_4_1": "Granny! I gave the Gilded Ball to Lady Hsin! And She smiled back at me!",
-+  "MXXSST_4_2": "Does that mean She liked the gift?",
-+  "MXXSST_5_1": "Of course she did. Lady Hsin would never miss the heart behind it.",
-+  "MXXSST_5_10": "The uncles and aunties in the village look after me like their own. And I met Lady Hsin! Remember the Gilded Ball you gave me? I got to give it to Her, just like you asked!",
-+  "MXXSST_5_11": "So don't worry about me. I'll grow up into a nice young lady, and I'll never forget the things you taught me.",
-+  "MXXSST_5_12": "That's my good girl. Now, tell me more about the Festival. What did you think when you first saw Her?",
-+  "MXXSST_5_13": "Hehe... Well, I thought She was a bit strange at first. When it happened, I was—",
-+  "MXXSST_5_2": "So, Yue, did you have a good time at the Waking Moon Festival?",
-+  "MXXSST_5_3": "I had the best time! Granny, you won't believe what happened! At first, Lady Hsin wasn't really Lady Hsin. Oh no, how do I explain this...",
-+  "MXXSST_5_4": "Take your time, dear. I'm listening.",
-+  "MXXSST_5_5": "Mm! Lady Hsin came with me to buy sugar paintings. Then we solved word riddles, took a boat ride, and watched the Loong dance! The performance was amazing!",
-+  "MXXSST_5_6": "And at the end, we set off fireworks. They were huge! Lady Hsin flew up into the sky, and bursts spread out behind Her, all bright and sparkly... It was so, so beautiful.",
-+  "MXXSST_5_7": "I really had the best time. I... I just wish you could've been there too.",
-+  "MXXSST_5_8": "Yue... all these years, you've been through so much.",
-+  "MXXSST_5_9": "Hm? Granny, don't say that! I've had a wonderful life!",
-+  "MXXSST_6_1": "Wow! This Moon Lantern is so pretty! Big sister, can I take a look?",
-+  "MXXSST_6_2": "Of course. Here, come a little closer.",
-+  "MXXSST_7_1": "Hm... Oh! I saw what you wrote on it. Sounds like you've had a wonderful year!",
-+  "MXXSST_7_10": "Well... have you ever heard the old legend?",
-+  "MXXSST_7_11": "\"The Divine Fox descended from the moon. Where She walked, lanterns flickered to life. Crowds stirred. Festivity spread.\"",
-+  "MXXSST_7_12": "I know it! Granny told me. The rest goes like—\"And She would weave through it all, take the hand of the lonely, and join the revelry.\"",
-+  "MXXSST_7_13": "Exactly. Oh, if your granny knew that you met Lady Hsin, and you delivered that Gilded Ball on her behalf... She'd be so proud.",
-+  "MXXSST_7_2": "I did. Lady Hsin will surely be glad to read it too. I just hope I get to see Her this year.",
-+  "MXXSST_7_3": "Hehe. I met Lady Hsin last year, you know!",
-+  "MXXSST_7_4": "Oh? We must've gone to the Festival at the same time. I met Lady Hsin, too.",
-+  "MXXSST_7_5": "You must've been thrilled to have gotten to see Her, hm?",
-+  "MXXSST_7_6": "Mm-hmm! But actually, I didn't even want to go at first. Granny had just passed, and it was her favorite holiday. I didn't want to go without her...",
-+  "MXXSST_7_7": "But Granny always said I had to hand the Gilded Ball to Lady Hsin myself. So I went.",
-+  "MXXSST_7_8": "And then...?",
-+  "MXXSST_7_9": "And then I really did meet Her! I gave Her the Gilded Ball, and She was so pleased. She even walked with me to see every bit of the Festival!",
-+  "MXXSST_8_1": "Even the <b>Shadow Binder</b> is starting to lose its hold over... that great shadow.",
-+  "MXXSST_8_2": "If even the artifacts Lady Hsin made are failing, then Her condition must be...",
-+  "MXXSST_9_1": "Even the <b>Shadow Binder</b> is starting to lose its hold over... that great shadow.",
-+  "MXXSST_9_2": "If even the artifacts Lady Hsin made are failing, then Her condition must be...",
-+  "MXXSST_9_3": "Excuse me. Can I ask what you mean by \"Her condition\"?",
-+  "MXXSST_9_4": "{PlayerName}! Please, you may speak freely with us. Hmm... let me think how best to say it.",
-+  "MXXSST_9_5": "Let me. I'll be careful not to tip it off.",
-+  "MXXSST_9_6": "Here's how it is. Long ago, Lady Hsin used Her power of Fractal Proliferation to create the Nexus Fox Shadow. She entrusted it to watch over the entire Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou, and lend us aid whenever we called.",
-+  "MXXSST_9_7": "So, if the authority sustaining the Fox Shadow is starting to falter, then Lady Hsin... I'm sorry. That's all we can say.",
-+  "MXXSST_9_8": "Got it. Don't worry, Hsin and I will solve it together.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_100_1": "The Waking Moon Festival... It's finally here...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_100_2": "I haven't been this happy in so long. When those Formrenders were around, I felt hollow, like my heart had been plucked out.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_100_3": "Those monsters are gone now! Things are going to get better from now on!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_100_4": "Lady Hsin... She'll come, right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_100_5": "She loves a bustling festival too much to stay away.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_100_6": "See that \"Moon Lantern\" at the very top? Only She has the power to light it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_101_1": "Come on! I found us the perfect spot to see the lanterns!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_101_2": "Mommy, look! A little fox!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_101_3": "A fox? Where did you see it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_101_4": "Don't rush, sweetheart, you'll bump into someone!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_101_5": "The lanterns are so beautiful...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_101_6": "What wish are you going to write on yours?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_101_7": "Just health, safety, and smooth days ahead for my family.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_102_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Run, Hsin... Run faster. Everyone... is waiting for this!</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_102_2": "May all beings rejoice... the Moon and lanterns ever bright...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_102_3": "Does this sight bring you any comfort, old friend?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_102_4": "Forgive me. Your frequency was fading too quickly, and all I could gather from the people's longings was this single thread. If It were here... It would have done better.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_102_5": "Look, the Waking Moon lanterns are lit once more. Let us linger in this view a little longer.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_102_6": "From now on, everything will be well.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_102_7": "In the fox's body, you leap for the moon in the sky and restore its light. The lanterns blaze bright as day, and the Waking Moon Festival becomes at last what it was always meant to be.\n\nOff in a quiet corner, Hsin's phantom stands gazing down at the lights, a Rafter Kite perched on her fingertip. Her face is soft, as if catching up with an old friend.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_103_1": "Look! That door over there! Isn't that where we came from?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_1": "Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_10": "You've been missing for some time. Where were you? What happened to you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_11": "What you saw before was merely a fractured strand of myself. My true form still sleeps deep within the Simulacrum Nexus.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_12": "I thought I could spare the strength to find you. But anomalies kept appearing. I've had to pour everything into repairs. I'm spread... terribly thin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_13": "Even now, I can only speak to you in this unstable form.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_14": "From what I gathered, Muyu's corrupted Reverberations have all been purged. Xuanfang Hold should be safe now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_15": "What is truly binding you, Hsin?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_16": "Ha. Nothing escapes you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_17": "Is it the Fox Shadow?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_18": "It has your face. Your frequency. But every Celestial I met spoke of it with dread. I think they were under some kind of restriction.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_19": "The Heart Realm anomalies, the canceled Waking Moon Festival... Is the Fox Shadow behind it all?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_2": "Hsin the Moon Fox?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_20": "It took Suoming too. Do you know where she is now?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_21": "Mm... that is a lot of questions at once...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_22": "That \"Nexus Fox Shadow,\" let's call it \"Suhsin.\" It began to break free of my control after I decided to remold the Civilization Capsule. Since then, it has been spreading through the Nexus.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_23": "Suhsin seeks to devour all \"Sentinel Hsin the Moon Fox\" data to stabilize its own existence. It's been fighting me for control over Xuanfang Hold. In our struggle, I took my eyes off the Hold. A part of the Sanctum collapsed because of it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_24": "As for that girl with the umbrella, she deliberately released the Moon Fox frequency in her token to lure Suhsin into taking her. Reaching Suhsin was her goal all along.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_25": "But the Heart Realm she's in now... is currently beyond my reach.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_26": "Hm... but there is one simple way to make Suhsin obey your every command.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_27": "What is it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_28": "Use the power within the Prism of Fate to overwrite my personality data and reset all clearances. Since Suhsin shares my source code, it will revert to its initial state.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_29": "And what would happen to you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_3": "Just \"Hsin\" will do.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_30": "Well, I'd lose my sense of self and exist solely as the core to keep Xuanfang Hold running, wouldn't I?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_31": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_32": "I won't allow that to happen.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_33": "Aw, not that frown, Arbiter. I was only joking.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_34": "Why was Suhsin able to drive you into such a corner? What could override a Sentinel's authority?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_35": "Suhsin's clearance... comes from the Civilization Capsule's base code. Its core logic dictates that once Xuanfang Hold fulfills its mission, it must be destroyed. To keep the Hold, I had no choice but to overwrite it with new logic.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_36": "So that's the reason you remolded the Capsule?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_37": "...Yes.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_38": "Shh. Tread lightly. We wouldn't want a giant hand to appear and snatch us both away!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_39": "Then let me ask you this: are the things shown in the Heart Realms your memories?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_4": "Thanks to you, the Heart of Flames has recovered. I've reclaimed enough authority to meet you like this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_40": "...They are.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_41": "You made Xuanfang's very first Rafter Kite, didn't you? Then who is the \"It\" you mentioned to that Rafter Kite?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_42": "That is—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_43": "Ah... my time in human form is up.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_44": "Tell me, what do you need me to do now?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_45": "Arbiter, please continue through the Heart Realms. Venture deep into the Simulacrum Nexus to fix the anomalies. I will be waiting at the end of the next Realm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_46": "What I am forbidden to say aloud is hidden within those fragments of the past. Once you have witnessed everything, you will understand why I brought you here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_47": "...Forgive me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_48": "The <b>Providence Lock</b> didn't react. Guess Hsin was telling the truth.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_49": "What's that over there...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_5": "Before this, I had no way to speak with you directly. I could only guide you here. It must be a long journey for you, Arbiter. Would you... like to rest? Have some pastries?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_50": "You step back through the door into your own body, and Hsin the Moon Fox is waiting for you in the flesh. She tells you to call Her \"Hsin\" and thanks you for clearing the anomaly in the Heart of Flames—the only reason this meeting is possible at all.\n \nYou press Her with your many questions. She admits that Her true self has been trapped deep inside the Simulacrum Nexus all along, bound by the entity behind the Nexus Fox Shadow, the one She calls \"Suhsin.\" Suhsin emerged from the Civilization Capsule's base code, and its core logic dictates that Xuanfang Hold be destroyed once its mission is complete. Hsin overwrote that logic with Her own in order to keep Xuanfang Hold standing. Suhsin has been fighting back ever since, tearing loose and seeding anomalies across the Nexus while Hsin struggles to maintain control of the Hold.\n\nAs for Suoming, she let Suhsin take her on purpose, for reasons of her own. The Heart Realm she now occupies lies under Suhsin's control, beyond Hsin's reach.\n\nHsin asks you to press deeper into the Simulacrum Nexus and repair the remaining Heart Realms. Everything the restrictions keep Her from saying is buried in the memories those Heart Realms hold.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_6": "(Shake your head.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_7": "(Take the rice cakes.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_8": "...Let's skip the pleasantries.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_104_9": "Hsin, I have so much to ask you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_105_1": "An invitation letter. No trace of the sender can be found on the envelope.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_106_1": "(This is...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_106_2": "The future of Mengzhou and Jinzhou rests on this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_106_3": "Walk Its path. Feel Its feelings. Guard your words and actions.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_106_4": "Fulfill Its wish. Secure the Civilization Capsule.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_106_5": "Lady Hsin, the delegates from the Court of Savantae and Zhuojun Atelier have arrived.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_106_6": "(She speaks as if addressing someone standing right before her.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_106_7": "(Am I experiencing this memory through Hsin's own eyes?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_107_1": "Over here, my Lady.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_108_1": "Amidst the deadlock, hidden desires stir in every heart.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_10901_1": "This deadlock is not unbreakable. What we need is the resolve to act.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_10": "You just won't live to see it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_2": "We are heavily outnumbered. Facing endless hordes of Tacet Discords, even the fiercest resolve dulls eventually.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_3": "It only dulls when fear takes root. If someone dares to lead, the deadlock has already begun to break.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_4": "Fine words. But who has the spine? And who could actually lead us?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_5": "The crux of the matter rests neither on you or me. It hinges on the Sentinel's will.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_6": "We can pray for guidance, but to wait in idleness?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_7": "Sentinel Jué has long shielded Mt. Firmament, just as Mengzhou relies on Lady Hsin the Moon Fox. If Jinzhou is to be our first step toward reclaiming our lands, we cannot simply leave the entire burden to the Sentinels.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_8": "If no one is willing to be the torch, darkness will never lift. Please, sir. Stand with me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_109_9": "A woman like you knows how to build a legacy...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_10_1": "(First the Autopuppets going rogue, then the grim omen from the Providence Lock, and now the Intendant coming in person.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_10_2": "(No matter what happens to Xuanfang Hold... I will keep them safe, whatever it takes.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_110_1": "The loyal and righteous have gathered here out of reverence for you, my Lady. There is no need to worry about our plans being disrupted.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_110_2": "Unity is forged from within. It was not I who brought them here, but their own hearts.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_111_1": "Fearless",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_111_2": "Flicker in the Dark",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_111_3": "Fallen",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_111_4": "Loyal",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_111_5": "Fate's Pawn",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_111_6": "Outmatched",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_11201_1": "You stubborn mule! You're just jumping straight into the fire!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_10": "I'll protect myself. And I'll protect everyone around me too.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_11": "We'll bring victory home, Brother. When that day comes, Mother will be waiting with the porch light on.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_12": "You—Haah...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_2": "Brother, the border is in dire straits. How could I have stayed in the village, idling and warming my hands? I had to come.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_3": "You have a wife and child. Our mother to care for. A school to teach... those are your duties!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_4": "I took care of everything before I left. I told Gui to make sure Mother takes her medicine.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_5": "And Liang, he's so bright. He's already learned how to massage his grandmother's joints so they won't stiffen so much.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_6": "I do feel bad about leaving the children at the school. But there are plenty of good teachers there. They won't miss me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_7": "They won't miss you here either!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_8": "See that chimney smoke, Brother? That's our village, right behind us. You were the one who taught me to fight for it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_112_9": "I taught you to fight so you could live, not so you could throw your life away! Staying out of danger is how you survive!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_113_1": "So this is what they mean... When brothers stand together, their bond can cleave through steel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_113_2": "They fought to safeguard the homeland behind them. Do not let their blood be spilled in vain.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_114_1": "Older Brother",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_114_2": "Staked Everything",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_114_3": "Never Came Home",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_114_4": "Younger Brother",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_114_5": "A Teacher",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_114_6": "Lived the Lesson",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_11501_1": "Alright, save your breath. I don't give a damn what you're hiding, just hand over my cut.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_115_2": "I'm only taking the crumbs here. Bet you pocketed a fortune for yourself, eh?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_115_3": "Watch your mouth. You get paid for the work you do. That's how it goes. Trying to back out on me now?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_115_4": "Heh, of course not. Just thought you might want to spread the wealth a little.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_115_5": "After all, between the two of us, you're the one who can't afford to get caught.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_115_6": "Tsk... Fine. Meet me in the kitchen at midnight. After that, I wash my hands of you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_115_7": "Sure. Suits me just fine.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_115_8": "(That's right. Play the fool, take the loot. Then I'm leaving here for good.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_116_1": "The two moles were caught red-handed. They've already been imprisoned.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_116_2": "These trifles should not delay your schedule. Please move along, my Lady.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_117_1": "The Rat",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_117_2": "Accomplice",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_117_3": "No One's Ally",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_117_4": "Penny-Wise",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_117_5": "Shameless",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_117_6": "Worthless",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_118_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>All souls reach out to seize hope, yet tremble at the thought of grasping nothing.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_118_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>They seek a response, a spark of courage to move forward. I believe their prayers must not fall on deaf ears.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_119_1": "The meeting hall is right ahead, my Lady.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_11_1": "You must be Tangning. Intendant Suoming is expecting you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_120_1": "Channel the Nexus, foresee fate. Face the abyss, steady every heart.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_1": "I have summoned you today to address the Tacet Discord threat plaguing our borders.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_10": "Delegates, present your qualifications in turn. The Sentinel will render Her judgment based on the facts.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_11": "We have long studied Sentinel technology. Our knowledge guarantees we can decipher this blueprint in the shortest time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_12": "As for the price, we stopped counting the cost of life and death ever since we built the Chronosorter. What does it matter if there's no way back?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_13": "Know the Way at dawn, die without regret at dusk.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_14": "Xuanfang's terrain is volatile. It will require real-time adjustments to mechanism formations. Our knowledge of the local environment gives us the upper hand.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_15": "As Lady Hsin noted, this city requires highly sophisticated mechanisms. Yuan Fortress, the very ground beneath the chosen site, was built by our hands. Navigating those intricacies is where we excel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_16": "We will master this technology, of that we are certain. And we are ready to give our lives for Mengzhou.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_17": "If it's mechanisms you need, we have reserves in spades.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_18": "We are local. We know the people. We are the best suited to move them safely.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_19": "This construction cannot afford to fail. I need those who are unwavering in their acceptance of this technology.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_2": "(Is that... Hsin?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_20": "Zhuojun Atelier is making this unnecessarily complicated.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_21": "The decision is made. Xuanfang Hold will be built by the Court of Savantae. Effective immediately.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_22": "Please, one final word! The Court of Savantae lacks practical experience in large-scale mechanism engineering—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_23": "The Ministry will coordinate with City Hall. I want logistics sorted and materials dispatched within three days. As for you...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_24": "Submit your personnel roster to the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs by tomorrow. Any delay will be treated as a forfeit.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_25": "Understood.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_26": "...Dismissed.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_27": "You have doubts.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_28": "I do, my Lady. You made your choice long ago, so why call this meeting at all?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_29": "First, to let the military and civilians of Mengzhou see that their City Hall has a plan, thereby assuring them. Second, to confirm, one last time, which of the two is fit for the task, and which is a threat wearing the mask of an ally.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_3": "I will build a city, a mechanism of ever-changing forms, designed to counter Tacet Discord outbreaks.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_30": "...Zhuojun Atelier operates with hidden agendas. Their intentions are unclear, their loyalties uncertain. A liability, without question.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_31": "No. The Court of Savantae is the more dangerous.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_32": "They are willing to destroy themselves for true knowledge. Naturally, they will preserve such technology at any cost. To them, death is merely an acceptable compromise.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_33": "But a fragile civilization cannot bear knowledge that is too far ahead of its time. If this continues, sooner or later, it will yet again be...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_34": "Know the Way at dawn, die without regret at dusk... Very well. If that is their \"final wish,\" I will grant it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_35": "...But they are not the only ones sacrificing for the Hold. You are, too, My Lady.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_36": "I chose to be of this world, so how can I stand apart from it? Come. It is time to retrieve the Civilization Capsule.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_37": "As you wish.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_38": "You witness the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs in council. To spare Mengzhou, and Jinzhou, still yet to be founded, from the worst of the Tacet Discord hordes, Hsin the Moon Fox decides to raise Xuanfang Hold using Sentinel technology far beyond the current era. Delegates from the Court of Savantae and Zhuojun Atelier are summoned to select the architects. Both parties are stunned by the blueprint they are shown—technology generations ahead of anything they have ever seen. Even after being told that those who build the Hold will never return to the regular world, both sides still pledge themselves to the cause.\n \nThe Court of Savantae argues that their familiarity with Sentinel technology and willingness to sacrifice makes them the better choice. Zhuojun Atelier counters with their knowledge of the local terrain and practical experience with mechanisms. In the end, Hsin chooses the Court of Savantae. For them, the pursuit of knowledge has outpaced even the fear of death.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_4": "To bring it into being, I need the backing of our finest Artisans. But before you commit, you must know the price—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_5": "Those who build this city shall never return.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_6": "This... this technology outlined in the blueprint is unprecedented. Could it be...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_7": "Correct. It originates from <ano=the Sentinel>me</ano>.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_8": "The Court of Savantae pledges its full support!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_121_9": "Zhuojun Atelier raises no objections.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_122_1": "This way, my Lady.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_123_1": "Hsin's Mercy Knows No Bounds",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_123_2": "We Will Not Fail Her",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_123_3": "The Deadlock is Broken",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_123_4": "May This Succeed",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_123_5": "Peace to Yuan Fortress and Jinmen Pass",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1241_1": "Now that we have taken this step, there is no turning back.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1241_2": "I can't catch up... What's happening?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_124_1": "Your decision will surely lift the spirits of our troops at the border.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_125_1": "I Won't Accept This",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_125_2": "Too Far, Too Fast",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_125_3": "Think Again",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_125_4": "Blind to the Signs",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_125_5": "Must It Be So?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_126_1": "Pay no mind to the occasional objections, my Lady.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_126_2": "Turbulent times demand a resolute heart.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_127_1": "Catch Her",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_127_2": "Stop Her",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_127_3": "Hurry",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_127_4": "Too Late",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_128_1": "There is truly no need for you to personally attend to these petty affairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_128_2": "Think of it as a habit of mine.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_128_3": "Besides, however restless people's hearts may grow, in the end, they are all searching for peace of mind.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_128_4": "My presence grants them that peace.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_129_1": "Step into the game.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_1": "You must be Tangning. Intendant Suoming is expecting you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_10": "Easy now. Speak with Intendant Suoming yourself. If you have concerns, voice them directly.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_2": "I am Jiqing. Thank you for your service. Ten years in the Hold is no small thing.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_3": "It's nothing. But may I ask, do you have any insight into what she might be thinking?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_4": "What she's thinking? Meaning?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_5": "I don't doubt the Intendant's competence. I'm sure she can handle whatever comes.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_6": "But... she doesn't feel for Xuanfang Hold the way I do. And those rumors about her, two hundred years back...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_7": "I'm afraid she'll sacrifice the Hold's best interests for the Ministry's ends.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_8": "Seems you're not very familiar with those rumors, or else I doubt you'd think that.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_12_9": "I know that everyone who fought beside her back then were all—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_130_1": "And what about you? You haven't slept in three days.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_130_2": "I'm fine, my Lady.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_130_3": "When all of this is over, take some time for yourself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_130_4": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Please...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_130_5": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Don't go...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_131_1": "Don't go...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_131_2": "Don't go!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_131_3": "DON'T GO!!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_132_1": "The Civilization Capsule... I was never meant to use it this way.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_132_2": "It never recovered from the damage it sustained from the Sentinel Resonator's death, not even now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_132_3": "But the border can wait no longer...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_132_4": "Years of waiting, all for this moment.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_132_5": "Sentinel Hsin... accept your death!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_132_6": "Run.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_132_7": "Do not look back.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_132_8": "Through \"Hsin's\" eyes, you glimpse the truth of what happened at the Ministry's council. The Sentinel, Hsin the Moon Fox, is assassinated. The killer is Balanophora, a Ministry Intendant who spent years undercover waiting for this moment. In the crisis, Hsin splits off a <ano=Hsin>Fractal Form</ano>. As the shadows close in, a newborn fox flees with the Civilization Capsule.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_133_1": "Run",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_133_2": "Don't Look Back",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_133_3": "Catch Her",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_133_4": "Kill Her",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_133_5": "Make It Count",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_133_6": "Treason",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_133_7": "A Leak",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_133_8": "Must Die",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_134_1": "Hahh... hahh...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_1": "Forgive me for forcing those memories upon you. I couldn't bring myself to tell you the truth before.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_10": "Every time those memories are rewritten into my mind, I always...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_11": "...I want to call out to It. To pull It back. To tell It not to go.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_12": "Yet I can never do it. After all, I was nothing more than a stray emotion It had yet to manifest.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_13": "Perhaps that is why the Heart Realm is in chaos. I was desperate to change the past, even when it was unchangeable.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_14": "I am not the Sentinel. I only walk this world in Its form.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_15": "It trusted me to repair the Capsule, yet I failed my duty.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_16": "Arbiter, is this considered a deception?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_17": "From the outside, maybe it looks that way.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_18": "But you're the one who's been protecting Xuanfang Hold...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_19": "You're the one who helped Qingxiao and me when we were trapped in the Sanctum's illusion.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_2": "What's happening in Mengzhou?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_20": "Hsin the Moon Fox gave you Its heart, and you gave yours to Xuanfang Hold.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_21": "As long as it stands, no one can deny what's in your heart. The world's judgment doesn't matter. What matters is what you think, Hsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_22": "What I think... but Arbiter, so often in this life, we are not the ones who decide who we are, or what we do.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_23": "It seems my time is almost gone.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_24": "I will... be waiting for you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_25": "You emerge from the Heart Realm and return to Hsin's chambers. She confesses the truth She has kept from you. She is not the true Sentinel, but a Fractal Form created by Hsin the Moon Fox—an inheritor of Its memories and will, charged with repairing the Civilization Capsule damaged in the Ministry coup. She kept this a secret and continued to act as the original Hsin the Moon Fox. Hearing Hsin's doubts about Herself, you tell Her that the world's judgment is not what matters here. What matters is what She believes Herself.\n \nBefore you finish speaking, Hsin, unable to maintain Her form, fades in front of you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_3": "Safe, for now. As long as I am still here and the Capsule holds, they won't dare make a move.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_4": "If you are a fractal form of Hsin the Moon Fox, then what of the real Sentinel...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_5": "It will return once the Civilization Capsule is fully repaired.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_6": "Why didn't you ask the other cities for help?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_7": "If I laid the truth bare and let these conflicts come to light, would they back down when they saw the cost? Or would they rather break everything than yield?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_8": "I... dared not take that gamble.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_135_9": "Perhaps I lack the resolve of a true Sentinel, and that is what led to this crisis.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_136_1": "I missed my chance to ask where Suoming is... And there's more to that Intendant's assassination of the Sentinel than what I saw. I'll have to dig into that later.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_136_2": "The Providence Lock hasn't reacted, but She's still clearly hiding something from me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_1": "Is all going well?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_10": "Got your messages. I'm okay.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_11": "That is a relief.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_12": "With your skill, I have no doubt you will manage. Still, if you need help, call. I will come.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_13": "Connection unstable",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_14": "Have you found any trace of Hsin?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_15": "I've seen Hsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_16": "I've seen Hsin. She's in real trouble. I'm doing what I can.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_17": "It's a long story. I'll tell you everything once I'm out.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_18": "The connection is unstable. It could cut off any second. Don't worry about me, Master.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_19": "...Okay. I understand.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_2": "Friend sent a nudge",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_20": "And you need not worry about Xuanfang Hold. The Wardens are at their posts, and so am I. Focus all your attention on helping Hsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_21": "Be careful. In all things.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_3": "Friend sent a nudge",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_4": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_5": "The Sanctum must be blocking all attempted word from the outside. That was impatient of me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_6": "There has been no further collapse. The Ministry of War has reached an understanding with our envoys, and all is well inside Xuanfang Hold.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_7": "...If this reaches you, do send word that you are safe.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_8": "Connection unstable",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1371_9": "I'm okay.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_1": "{PlayerName}!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_10": "Once I've handled things in here, I'll be back.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_11": "Mm...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_12": "I see.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_13": "I'm with Warden Commander Qiuhong, helping with the evacuation. People are frightened. I'm trying to keep them calm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_14": "Then... good luck.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_15": "I'll do my part as a Xuan Watcher. I'll be waiting for you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_2": "Liangyu told me you went into the Sanctum with that Ministry of Sentinel Affairs Intendant... Are you all right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_3": "Connection unstable",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_4": "I know you'll be fine. It's you, after all. But no one knows what's inside, and... I can't help worrying.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_5": "If my messages get through, send something back. A line or two is enough.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_6": "Connection unstable",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_7": "Yangyang, I got your messages.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_8": "Yangyang, your messages came through.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1372_9": "Things inside the Sanctum are complicated. There's a lot going on below the surface. But don't worry, I'm doing fine.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_137_1": "Messages from Yangyang and Qingxiao? Have the comms been restored?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_1": "We noticed the changes in the distant mountains. It seems you repaired the Heart of Flames, Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_10": "So She did help us. Now it's our turn to help Her.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_11": "Wait!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_12": "The key to the Heart of Frost... It's... it's right...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_13": "You meet Leyue again. With more of Hsin's authority reclaimed, the Celestials can speak far more freely than before. She thanks you for repairing the Heart of Flames and asks about the Court of Savantae's fate in the outside world. Your answer draws a contented smile. Then, risking Suhsin's notice, she tells you where to find the key to the next Heart Realm—the Heart of Frost.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_2": "It has been so, so long since anything changed here...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_3": "I know why She and all of you came here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_4": "We made peace with it the moment we accepted the contract for the city's construction.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_5": "Thank you... for your years of tireless work.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_6": "Well, with Lady Hsin's authority reclaimed, I think I can finally ask what I've held onto all these years.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_7": "The Court of Savantae... Did we leave anything behind?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_8": "There are ruins. Many scholars are still studying them to this day.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_138_9": "Ah... I see...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_139_1": "It's trying to stop me from getting closer. The key must be up ahead.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_139_2": "Looks like I can only go this way.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_13_1": "(If the Intendant truly means to leave the Hold to its fate, then I'll have to...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_140_1": "The Prism of Fate is resonating with the key...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_140_2": "Has it granted me a new clearance level?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_141_1": "This place... looks dead. Like everything's just stopped.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_142_1": "Whoa, why did that huge annoying shadow suddenly stop moving?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_142_2": "Has Hsin reclaimed more of Her authority? Or... did Suoming do something?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_143_1": "These Autopuppets are missing kernels!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_144_1": "This is the only Autopuppet with a kernel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_144_2": "Looks like that's our target!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_145_1": "...Just as I thought.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_145_2": "I'll clear out these anomalies first!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_146_1": "Hmm. How 'bout using the key's power for this?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_147_1": "This should be the last one.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_147_2": "The key is complete. We can leave now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_148_1": "There's the exit!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_149_1": "Hsin... Is She in the Heart of Frost right now?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_149_2": "I should keep moving.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_1": "Intendant Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_10": "And the promise is only deferred. A hundred years is nothing. Without you in Mengzhou, the Ministry will have much to do.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_11": "Then it all falls to you, Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_12": "You needn't say that. This was all part of your design, wasn't it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_13": "Not design. Only faith. Faith in you... and in Her.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_14": "Today's the day, then...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_15": "The Manifold Sanctum and Hsin the Moon Fox are one and the same. I must see the truth for myself before it falls.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_16": "Only the three of us will go, lest we rouse the \"snake.\" We should not draw attention.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_17": "But—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_18": "Tangning. I know this place holds your heart. Your concern is only natural.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_19": "Hsin the Moon Fox accounted for this from the start. The Sanctum was built to break clean from the Hold.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_2": "Yes. Speak.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_20": "Should the worst happen and it falls, the surrounding districts will remain standing.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_21": "And should the Hold itself be imperiled, don't look for me. Put the people first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_22": "I, Tangning, will see that it is done.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_23": "One more thing. Ten years you've held this post. With Hsin here, I should've been the one overseeing Xuanfang myself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_24": "But Mengzhou's crises didn't let me go. You and your predecessors have held firm in your duty.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_25": "For Hsin, for Mengzhou, you've done more than your share. You have my gratitude.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_26": "Yes! Intendant Suoming, may all be well in <ano=heart>Hsin's</ano> keeping.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_27": "May all be well in Hsin's keeping.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_28": "Ah, that reminds me. Xuanfang's Waking Moon Festival is almost here. The last few were a delight. Will you join us this time, Intendant?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_29": "The Waking Moon Festival... If things go well, we'll see.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_3": "Not long ago, my Providence Lock opened on its own. Following its guidance, I went in secret to the Manifold Sanctum and measured the Sentinel's frequency.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_30": "Tangning, the Ministry's quiet observer inside Xuanfang Hold, delivers his findings to Suoming. Following the <b>Providence Lock</b> the Sentinel once gave him, he went to the Sanctum and measured Hsin the Moon Fox's frequency, only to find it fading fast. The <b>Manifold Sanctum</b> at the Hold's heart could collapse at any moment.\n \nHearing this, Suoming remembers a promise she made someone long ago. She decides to go to the Sanctum and see the truth for herself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_4": "There's no mistaking it. Her frequency is fading fast. I fear the Sanctum could fall at any moment.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_5": "I see. Your years of reporting to the Ministry on all that has occurred here are duly noted.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_6": "All of it, exactly as you foresaw a century ago.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_7": "I understand your final charge. I will deliver it into \"Hsin's\" hands.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_8": "Forgive me. In the end, the promise went unkept.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_14_9": "No matter. From the day we met, I have known you gave everything you had.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_150_1": "(Sending me all the way out here... Whimsical as She may be, this is a bit much.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_150_2": "(If the dangers here were already beyond Her control, why didn't She inform <ano=the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs>me</ano>?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_151_1": "(Leaving me only one exit...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_152_1": "The anomalies here are worse than when I first entered the Simulacrum Nexus.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_152_2": "Can't reach the Arbiter. Too much interference. I'll find my own way out first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_152_3": "Is this... a Realm Key?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_152_4": "Hmph, a perfect replica. I will find the exit before your power runs out, Fourth Seal.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_153_1": "...I see. That's where the anomalies are bleeding through.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_154_1": "Finished. Easy work.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_155_1": "Mm, anomalies purged. But this doesn't feel like the kind of \"mischief\" She would design for me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_156_1": "A dead end. Perhaps these anomalies can be of some use.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_157_1": "The frequency of the anomalies here is surging. Let's see if this works.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_158_1": "Alright, I can use them to pave a road forward as well.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_159_1": "Such cruelty. These anomalies are far beyond what the Autopuppets can handle.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_159_2": "I must find the Moon Fox as quickly as possible.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_1": "{PlayerName}. My greetings have been remiss lately.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_10": "New training hall?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_11": "New training hall?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_12": "Yes, only just raised, with room enough for the disciples to practice the sword.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_13": "That's my Master. Heading there now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_14": "A whole new training hall already? That's my Master.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_15": "Count me in for a visit, then. I'm available right now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_17": "Wonderful.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_18": "Friend shared a location",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_19": "I'll be waiting here for you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_3": "My new dwelling in the Xuanyuan Grotto-Heaven is newly raised. Sparrows sing from the eaves and the clouds drift in, a setting made for brewing tea and playing the qin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_4": "Should a free day find you, I would welcome you most gladly.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_5": "Qingxiao?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_6": "Why so formal over comms again...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_7": "An invitation calls for proper manners. That said, I've grown more adept with these messages.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_15_9": "...In plainer words: if you're free, I'd like you to come sit a while at the Xuanyuan School's new training hall.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_160_1": "Disgraceful.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_1": "You raise a fair point, Fourth Seal. If She wanted to see me, why not just bring me to Her side from the start?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_10": "Wow, is that the Sentinel? Sister Suoming, can you take me to see Her?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_11": "Only if you stop being so rowdy.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_12": "Of course, Sister Suoming!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_13": "Suoming walks alone, murmuring to the frequencies sealed within her Locks. She takes out the one belonging to the Ninth Seal, and a rare smile crosses her face.\n\nA moment later, the Ninth Seal stands beside her in the flesh, cheerfully catching up on old times. The sight dims Suoming's expression, but she says nothing of it, only lets the Ninth Seal's wish to \"see the Sentinel\" pass unchallenged.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_2": "A whim I could tolerate, but I suspect this is not Her doing at all.... Regardless, you may rest now. Thank you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_3": "Walk with me through this, Ninth—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_4": "Sister Suoming!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_5": "Ninth...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_6": "Haha, long time no see! Did you miss me?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_7": "It's been, what, two hundred years? Since we took down that Evil Miasma that came from the Sentinel's assassination.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_8": "The sacrifice was heavy, but at least everyone's frequencies are safe in those locks of yours, right? We'll be together forever!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_161_9": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_162_1": "Sister Suoming, did Huating become a better place after we killed off the \"Evil Miasma\"?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_162_2": "I never got to see it at peace. Is it beautiful?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_162_3": "Of course. It's our homeland.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_163_1": "Look, Sister Suoming! Doesn't that look like the mechanism teapot the Lord Second Seal made?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_163_2": "I remember when you stuffed Water Moon Buns into it and he chased you all over the courtyard!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_163_3": "But he'd always let it slide as long as you lent him the Vermillion Locks to play around with.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_163_4": "That wasn't for play. Because of him, the Locks were refined into what they are today.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_163_5": "So that... after you all died, I could seal your frequencies inside them.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_164_1": "Sister Suoming, these Autopuppets... Did the Sentinel abandon them here?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_164_2": "They were attacked. Stay alert.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_164_3": "Maybe the Lord Second Seal could fix them?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_164_4": "This is the Sentinel's technology. Even he would find it hard to repair.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_164_5": "Wait. Something's coming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_165_1": "Haunting evils... Ninth, you—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_165_2": "That's right. Get to cover, Ninth...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_1": "Hmph. This place is not to be trifled with.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_10": "Indeed. They call themselves Formrenders and Soulfrayers. They are Autopuppets, but far more brutal than the rest of us.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_11": "Even the Kernel Puppets guarding us stood no chance. I suppose the technology used to forge them originates from...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_12": "I'm fully aware. It's too dangerous here. Let me escort you back to Mengxuan Vale first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_13": "There is no need to trouble yourself, Intendant. The path we came from is safe enough.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_14": "Besides...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_15": "You have more pressing matters to attend to, don't you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_2": "Stealing lines from me, Ninth?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_3": "Hehe, it's written all over your face!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_4": "The way these fiends are constructed is alarmingly similar to the Moon Fox's own handiwork.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_5": "Oh! Lord Second Seal! Long time no see! Back still aching? I can help, you know!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_6": "Enough of that. Focus on the work at hand.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_7": "Roger that!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_8": "Your timely aid is much appreciated, Intendant Suoming. I have heard much of you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_166_9": "Mm. Were you ambushed by those fiends?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_167_1": "In the light of understanding, life and death lose their weight...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_168_1": "In the light of understanding, life and death lose their weight...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_168_2": "Were their modular parts broken?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_168_3": "Classic Formrender work. They can never be fixed.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_168_4": "Do you resent them? Your enemies... or the Sentinel who didn't aid in time?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_168_5": "Suoming...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_168_6": "We mourn for the deceased, but we still have a higher mission to achieve.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_168_7": "And you are just like us, Intendant Suoming. That we do know.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_168_8": "...Let's go, Ninth.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_169_1": "I heard those Celestial Autopuppets call you Intendant.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_169_2": "Hmph. Beating around the bush doesn't suit you. Well? Do you dislike the title?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_169_3": "It's not about liking it or not. It's just that no one will ever call you Seal Master again. That makes me a little sad.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_169_4": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_16_1": "How'd she put up a whole new training hall so fast?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_16_2": "It's Qingxiao, after all. She's probably got some secret art for it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_16_3": "We'll know once we get there. If it's her hall...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_16_4": "Oh! I can kind of picture it. Bet it's one of those misty, immortal-looking places, huh?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_1": "Ooh! Ahh! The Simulacrum Nexus truly holds wonders at every turn. Should we try to find a way around?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_10": "The Sixth Sister would never blame you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_11": "Carried you forward... No. I just couldn't let you all go.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_12": "Hehe. And that's why I came back, Sister Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_13": "Whoever made you was truly crafty. If you were a little more false, or a little more true...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_14": "I wouldn't be struggling like this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_15": "I'm sorry...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_16": "Let's go, Ninth.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_2": "Hsin the Moon Fox is just ahead. We must find a way across.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_3": "Hmm... Ah! Is the Sixth Sister's Forte not perfect for this?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_4": "Why don't you open her lock! She adored me, I remember her lighting up every time she saw me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_5": "The Sixth Seal is gone. I have put her lock to other use.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_6": "It's being used to seal something more important, isn't it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_7": "That isn't a bad thing. You needn't dwell on the past anyway, Sister Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_8": "You saved our lives. We trusted you because of the righteous path you walk. And we were proud to be called \"<te href=852013>the Seal Master's Ten Seals</te>.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_170_9": "The nine of us should've been left behind in that rain. But you carried us forward for two hundred more years.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_171_1": "Sister Suoming, the Sentinel is just ahead.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_171_2": "Yes, I saw.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_1": "I've been waiting for you, little Suoming. Did you enjoy the journey?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_10": "But if it helps you lay your ghosts to rest, and serves the greater good, what is there to lose?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_11": "Besides, your conversations with those locked frequencies are nothing but soliloquies. How could the dead ever reply?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_12": "The sight of you is so pitiful. I could not stand to see you continue like this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_13": "Ninth... the day I met you was the day our plan to eradicate the \"Evil Miasma\" became whole.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_14": "I asked you to turn invisible and draw close to it. To deliver the fatal blow.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_15": "I knew it would cost you your life. And yet I... I still...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_16": "Forgive me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_17": "You must let it go, Sister Suoming. You are an Intendant now. The Sentinel needs you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_18": "I knew it. You aren't truly the Ninth. \"Let go. Forget\"...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_19": "I've heard those words a thousand times. I've said them to myself a thousand more.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_2": "You sent me on that detour just for this?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_20": "But this obsession... this is exactly what I want.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_21": "An Intendant sworn to serve the Sentinel, yet again committing treason.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_22": "Master of the Ten Seals, with what face do you still claim your title as Intendant of Sentinel Affairs?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_23": "Our cause began in Huating. We refused to bow to a \"greater good\" that treated lives as expendable.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_24": "The \"Evil Miasma\" was a blight, but it pales before the sins of Huating's rulers who fed their own people to it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_25": "Hsin the Moon Fox would never do such a thing. You are not Her, and you are no Sentinel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_26": "Begone, fiend.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_27": "By what right do you presume to define a Sentinel...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_28": "Nothing... but a fleeting illusion.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_29": "Suoming and the Ninth Seal reach the end of the road. \"Hsin the Moon Fox\" steps forward, coaxing Suoming with honeyed words to surrender the Vermillion Locks and let go of her obsession with the Ten Seals. Suoming answers with the guilt she has carried for two hundred years—it was her decision, in the campaign to destroy the \"Evil Miasma\" back home, that cost the Ninth Seal her life. The Ninth Seal herself urges Suoming to let the past go and hand over the Locks.\n\nAt those words, Suoming reveals she has long known this is not the true Ninth Seal, and that this \"Hsin the Moon Fox\" is Suhsin in disguise. She stops holding back and strikes without hesitation. As Suhsin's form dissolves, the Ninth Seal who walked beside her all this way drops to the ground, a doll with nothing behind its eyes.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_3": "Since I brought you into the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs, you have devoted two centuries to repairing the Civilization Capsule and risen to Intendant.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_4": "Now you deliver me a very important token. How could I not reward you, in my own way?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_5": "With this, the anomalies of the Nexus will finally be laid to rest.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_6": "Sister Suoming...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_7": "Ten Vermillion Locks, each sealing a frequency. Nine for the fallen Seals, and one for the \"Evil Miasma\" itself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_8": "A century of trials, great and small, and not once have you opened a single lock.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_172_9": "It is a pity you had to discard the Sixth Seal to make room for a more important frequency.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_173_1": "(Suhsin's form seemed unstable for a moment just now. It looks like something is disrupting it.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_173_2": "(Could this be Suoming's doing?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_174_1": "...I'm not in the form of a fox this time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_174_2": "Does this mean Hsin is reclaiming more of Her authority?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I still remember the first time I saw a Xuanling Bird. It recognized my true identity almost instantly.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>It told me that in all of Xuanfang, there was no one left who could understand its <ano=Streams>words</ano>. Only I could commune with its frequency.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Back then, I had not yet mastered the proper cadence of a Sentinel. I hid from the public eye as much as I could.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_4": "<color=XinyuehuSub>And the Xuanling brought me, day after day, the beauty of all four seasons.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_5": "That was Hsin's voice... Is She here?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_6": "You call out, but receive no answer. Instead, the Xuanling Bird nearby hops around with nimble steps, looking curious.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_7": "This is only an echo of a memory, just like before.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_8": "If this is the memory of her first encounter with a Xuanling Bird, then Hsin must have just arrived in Xuanfang...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_175_9": "This is Her at the very start of Xuanfang Hold's construction.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_176_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>\"Repair the Civilization Capsule. Build Xuanfang Hold.\" That was the first mandate that surfaced in my mind when I gained consciousness.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_176_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>But I had been severed from my true self too hastily... I lacked the strength to conjure a city from nothing.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_176_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I had no choice but to build the first prototype of the Lexicon Axis and reclaim my power as Sentinel little by little.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_176_4": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I made myself the \"origin\" of this city. True to my pact with the Court of Savantae, I provided them with the knowledge and technology needed to raise these walls.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_176_5": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I dispersed my power throughout the city to manage the workings of every modular part.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_176_6": "<color=XinyuehuSub>The world sings praises of how Hsin the Moon Fox descended upon Xuanfang with a celestial city in tow... yet no one knew how nervous I was back then.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_176_7": "<color=XinyuehuSub>...Or how lost I felt.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_177_1": "So... you were the very first \"Celestial\" to lay the foundations of Xuanfang Hold.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_177_2": "Is this Heart Realm... showing me how you built it all?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_178_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>And then... I saw \"them.\"</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_178_2": "This memory seems... damaged. I should try fixing it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_1": "You are brave, and that courage deserves a far greater stage.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_10": "Hsin... as long as we have faith in one another, our words will always hold power. No matter who we are.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_2": "Within the ranks of the Xuanfang Wardens, you will find many who share your path. And there, you will fulfill your life's wish.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_3": "Really? You think I have it in me?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_4": "<color=XinyuehuSub>He was a brave soul. Even when cornered by Tacet Discords, he did not flinch in front of the children.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_5": "<color=XinyuehuSub>After I saved him, I felt compelled to say something... something that sounded like a true Sentinel's words.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_6": "<color=XinyuehuSub>He believed me. They believed me. Even their descendants believed me...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_7": "<color=XinyuehuSub>He did indeed become a legendary Xuanfang Warden. So did his children after him.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_8": "<color=XinyuehuSub>But I... I could never truly calculate their futures, nor guarantee their hopes would come to pass.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_179_9": "No one needs anyone else to guarantee their future.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_1": "Take this! Xuanyuan First Form, Hidden Heart!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_10": "It's... the Xuanyuan School, Xianling Village Branch!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_11": "Look! I carved that plaque myself. \"World's Greatest Cultivation School.\" Amazing, right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_12": "It truly is a training hall, and we truly do train in the sword.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_13": "...Did my little joke fall rather flat?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_14": "Ah, so you were joking...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_15": "A martial school is not built in haste. There are many days to consider what comes next. This place suits well—no worldly dust, only kitchen smoke. No hindrance to cultivation.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_16": "And with the festival near, there are countless tasks needing hands. Staying here, I can at least be of some use.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_17": "Master Qingxiao can cut out a whole pile of Moon Lantern frames in one swing! Beats my whole day's work!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_18": "Getting ready for the Waking Moon Festival?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_19": "Yes. When the <te href=852014>festival</te> draws near, Xuanfang livens up. If you are free, do take a stroll through it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_2": "Master Qingxiao never taught us that move... Cheater!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_20": "Will you be going?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_21": "Is it true Hsin shows up at the festival?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_22": "...Mm. In the old days, if I did not attend, Hsin would send a Rafter Kite to fetch me, hounding me till I went.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_23": "It was true over a decade ago. But in recent years... Hsin appears more rarely.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_24": "I wish we could meet Lady Hsin! Grandma and Grandpa always say the Sentinel will come to play with us at the festival, but we've never seen Her, not once.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_25": "Don't you know? That's just grown-up talk to make us behave. Like the one about Autopuppets stealing kids who won't go to bed...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_26": "Hsin is... simply a little busy. You will have the chance to see Her some other day.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_27": "Your mother's here. Off you go.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_28": "Everything all right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_29": "It's just... I'm still not quite used to minding such lively little ones.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_3": "The immortal lady told us, \"We train in the heart, not in the form.\" I came up with this myself!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_30": "Does it remind you of when you first met Ruoyun?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_31": "No... Hsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_32": "...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_33": "But let's return to the matter at hand.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_34": "I asked you here, in part, to talk about Hsin. These past few days... the presence I have sensed from Her has grown weaker than before.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_35": "Hsin keeps no set path, so a flickering presence is nothing new... She vanishes for a time, then reappears as if nothing happened, chattering of trifles.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_36": "In the past, Hsin never spoke of what She was doing, so I asked no further.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_37": "Yet with Xuanfang's portents growing more frequent, even the Rafter Kites no longer bring word of Her. Until moments ago, I sensed a wisp of Her presence near the Sanctum, but it was gone in a breath, too fleeting to catch.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_38": "...Hence my wish for you to accompany me to Xuanfang Hold to search for Her trail. And when the moment calls, I may need to rely on your power as Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_39": "I understand.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_4": "{PlayerName}, you've come.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_40": "Then let's head to the Hold first. There's something I've been wanting to look into as well.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_41": "Talk on the way?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_42": "Thank you. After all this is settled...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_43": "You'll invite me to dinner?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_44": "You'll take me to the Waking Moon Festival?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_45": "...So be it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_46": "Qingxiao's \"new training hall\" turns out to be nothing more than an ordinary village courtyard, where she stands smiling as children tear around the yard. She catches your surprised look and admits it was only a joke, and she's simply watching the little ones while their parents prepare for the Waking Moon Festival.\n \nTalk of the festival leads Qingxiao to her real reason for inviting you. Hsin's presence is growing fainter by the day, and she wants you with her when she investigates the area where she last sensed it, near the Sanctum. Recalling the rumors from the tea stall, you agree to go with her to Xuanfang Hold.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_5": "Greetings, Senior {Male=Brother;Female=Sister}!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_6": "Taking in disciples already, Master Sword Transcendent?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_7": "Just watching over the little ones for Jiuniang. Letting them run about.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_8": "I showed them a handful of forms, lest their wild horseplay leave them bruised. If they come to master my swordcraft in time, then the art lives on.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_17_9": "So this really is the Xuanyuan School's new training hall?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_180_1": "How did Tacet Discord frequencies get here...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_180_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>The Civilization Capsule... Before I could remove it from the Ministry's keeping, the Fractsidus had already corrupted it.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_180_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Thus, during the early days of the city's construction, I spent my time fighting to purge the festering filth.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_181_1": "The memories in this Heart Realm are far more chaotic than the ones before...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_181_2": "Did the Civilization Capsule's blueprint and Xuanfang's data get merged together?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_182_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>A City of Mechanisms wrought from Sentinel technology had computational demands far surpassing that of Yuan Fortress.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_182_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>For this, I had to separate my processing core to serve as the cornerstone of Xuanfang Hold's operations.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_182_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>And to restore the lost central authority damaged within the Civilization Capsule itself.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1831_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>The prototype of the Lexicon Axis was also the starting point of the Manifold Sanctum.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1831_2": "These anomalies... I need to take care of them first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1831_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>...With that, the construction of Xuanfang Hold could finally begin.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_183_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>It was here that I first unfurled the blueprint of Xuanfang Hold.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_183_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>...To think those clumsy first attempts of mine would one day be called \"miracles\" in the eyes of humanity.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_1": "This little birdie... growing bolder by the day, sneaking into a restricted zone like this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_10": "Ah... but I'm only the Moon Fox's feeling given form, here to carry out Its mission. Why would I need a name of my own?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_11": "To keep us from getting mixed up? Since when do you care about that... Alright, alright. I'll think of one.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_12": "Little Fox? That's too plain... and it lacks authority. Even if it's your nickname for me, absolutely not.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_13": "<ano=Moon>Yue</ano>? But the moon has already... No. That's an ill omen.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_14": "Hsin...? Right, call me Hsin...!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_15": "You may call me that from this day forward, old friend.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_16": "You see Hsin and a Xuanling Bird in Xuanfang's earliest days. She was uncertain of who She was then, believing Herself to be no true Sentinel, only a Fractal Form running errands in Its place. The Xuanling Bird tries to lift Her spirits, telling Her to pick a name of Her own.\n \n\"Hsin...? Right, call me Hsin...!\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_2": "Do you have any idea how much strength I had to expend to move that mountain peak, the one misaligned by your terrible advice? You owe me juicy stories from the city to make up for it. At least two... No, three!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_3": "I really can't hide anything from you, can I? But don't worry... I'm not fading.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_4": "It's just that as the city blueprint expands, my focus grows thinner.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_5": "You're far too clever not to guess what this power is for. It's to help the Moon Fox repair the Civilization Capsule.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_6": "No, not me... I mean the real Sentinel. The one everyone loves.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_7": "You're saying no one has ever doubted that I am Hsin the Moon Fox?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_8": "Of course not. I've worked tirelessly to carry myself like a true Sentinel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_184_9": "Hm? You want me to choose a name for myself?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_185_1": "Her movements... are much heavier now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_186_1": "The engineering in this blueprint... Haha... Without the Sentinel, I could have spent a lifetime studying and never grasped a fraction of its brilliance!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_1": "Lady Sentinel! You have arrived!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_10": "Our construction efficiency will surge by another thirty percent!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_11": "Please, come take a look!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_2": "This blueprint... Every Artisan of the Court has studied it. It is nothing short of a masterpiece! To bear witness to such knowledge in this lifetime is an honor beyond measure!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_3": "We will not let you down!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_4": "<color=XinyuehuSub>They... had the brilliant gift of distilling wild, abstract hypotheses into logic and formula, the very language of human reason.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_5": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I could see their longings. I could see how desperately they fought to leave behind a legacy.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_6": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Watching them, I began to realize... Though this city was born from knowledge not of this age, it was still their hands that were building it.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_7": "<color=XinyuehuSub>And so, the \"systems\" they built gradually took the place of my own \"perception.\"</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_8": "<color=XinyuehuSub>My power was once rootless. But now, it had found soil. And it was beginning to grow.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_187_9": "Lady Sentinel, look here! We've optimized the modular parts and established a grid network.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_188_1": "Lady Sentinel, please allow me to assist you with the remaining repairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_189_1": "So what you're repairing and calculating here... is the operating logic of every mechanism in Xuanfang Hold?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_190_1": "We've deployed the construction Autopuppets now. We trust they will alleviate some of your burden...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_191_1": "Please be careful, Lady Sentinel!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_192_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>...The duty... of a Sentinel...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_1": "You have all done exceptionally well. The construction of Xuanfang Hold is far ahead of schedule.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_10": "Since we are ahead of schedule, you are dismissed from the workshop for today. Take a walk in the city.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_11": "But—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_12": "It is decided. Go see the land that your own ingenuity is bringing to life.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_13": "As you wish...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_14": "<color=XinyuehuSub>That was the first time I ever gave them an order. I wanted their lives to be more than just an obsession with the unknown.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_15": "<color=XinyuehuSub>The city shouldn't just exist only as a legacy they leave behind.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_16": "<color=XinyuehuSub>It should hold their footsteps. It should remember their joy... I wanted them to love the city they built.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_17": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Wishing for such things... does it make me more like the Sentinel? Or less?</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_18": "Hsin... you are simply being yourself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_2": "It's all thanks to your blueprint, Lady Sentinel. Without your guidance, we would have stumbled blindly into many wrong turns.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_4": "<color=XinyuehuSub>The joy on their faces was real. And the happier they were, the less I understood...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_5": "You do realize that the faster Xuanfang Hold is completed... the sooner you—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_6": "...The sooner we become Celestials, bound to this city forever?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_7": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_8": "Lady Sentinel, to gaze upon absolute truth, what regret could we possibly have, even in death?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_193_9": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I heard them say that a thousand times. I thought this time, surely, I'd be convinced. Just as the true Sentinel had been once.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_194_1": "That Artisan helped open the way forward.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_194_2": "...Hsin's frequency is fading.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_195_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>By the time the Xuanling brought me the message, Qingxiao had already purged those Tacet Discords.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_195_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>That was the first time I met her. I could see the doubts clouding her heart, but the Way she sought was never meant to be detached from the mortal world.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_196_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>When I learned she was staying in a ruined temple up on the mountain, I asked my Xuanling to visit her often on my behalf.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_196_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>...I wanted her to see the vibrant world that I saw.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_196_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>But I never expected...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_197_1": "Is that...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_198_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Where am I... When did I...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_198_2": "Did Hsin lose some of Her memories?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_198_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>...There's so much to do... I can't stop here.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_199_1": "This is... the last processing core.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_19_1": "The two of them are going at it again... Someone find a Warden, quickly...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_1": "[Xianling Village Farmhouse] Grand Opening Special: half-price on everything! Be the first to taste our Waking Moon Feast. Even the Golden-Eyed One swears by it!\nReply \"Unsub\" to unsubscribe.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_10": "[Auto-reply] We'd love to have you here!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_2": "But I haven't tried it yet.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_3": "Unsub.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_4": "But I haven't tried it yet.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_5": "Shoot, did this actually go to {PlayerName}'s Terminal...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_6": "Unsub.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_7": "Don't go, valued patron! This text reaching you must be fate. Come give us a try! You won't regret it!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_8": "?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_1_9": "?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_200_1": "...!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_200_2": "Xuanfang Hold's defense formations... Are they being hacked?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_201_1": "...!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_201_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>This area has suffered the worst of the Fractsidus's corruption.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_201_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I will... take care of it.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_202_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>...Festering filth.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_202_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>All will be purged.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_203_1": "*Caring chirp*",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_203_2": "Lady Hsin... if I truly have the courage to fight for Xuanfang...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_203_3": "Then I will not betray your trust. My family stands behind me. I will not retreat!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_203_4": "Thank you, Lady Sentinel... for bending the rules for us.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_203_5": "The Waking Moon Festival in Xuanfang Hold is even more beautiful than I ever imagined.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_203_6": "Very well. If this is your wish, I will guard Xuanfang at all costs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_203_7": "But... this land without you will forever be incomplete.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_203_8": "There are so many people waiting for you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_204_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>So many people... are waiting for me...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Since then, my remaining power could only sustain a brief manifestation once a year.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_10": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Would become the weight on the other side of the scales...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_11": "Over the course of Xuanfang Hold's construction, Hsin overdraws Her computational power and grows weaker and weaker, until She can only manifest briefly at the Waking Moon Festival to share in the people's joy.\n\nSlowly, she comes to love Xuanfang Hold and the people within it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I became the fabled Sentinel who appeared only during the grand festivals.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>When the morning bell rang, I was there.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_4": "<color=XinyuehuSub>When the evening drum fell, I had to leave.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_5": "<color=XinyuehuSub>But I wanted to be with them every day.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_6": "<color=XinyuehuSub>To watch the dawn creep over their rooftops.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_7": "<color=XinyuehuSub>To watch the chimney smoke melt into the twilight.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_8": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I wanted to breathe alongside this city, witnessing the flow of time with its people—</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_205_9": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I thought our days would only grow brighter as Xuanfang neared completion... I had never imagined that those busy, precious days...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2061_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Using the Civilization Capsule to hasten Xuanfang Hold's completion...</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2062_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>...There will be no turning back.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_1": "...Since the shift change two nights ago, Ovathrax launched a surprise raid at Desorock Highland, pushing straight toward the Clouded Cliffs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_10": "\"No retreat.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_100": "Hush now, Little Fox. Even with the Sentinel here, the Xuanling are still the guardian spirits of this land.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_101": "Fate willing, we will meet again, Little Fox.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_102": "What remains is yours to carry, Sentinel—\"Hsin.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_103": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_104": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_105": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_106": "Lady Hsin, can you hear me now?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_107": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_108": "The Wardens gave their lives for the Hold. The Xuanling Birds used their flesh to destroy the Fortress. We are at the brink, but this, right now, is also our opening.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_109": "The Tacet Discords are all gathered here. Now is the moment to finish them in one sweep.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_11": "We are holding here to establish a second line of defense. Ensure the civilians and critical mechanisms can evacuate.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_110": "Do you remember what you told us? If we merge with the Axis and surrender our own will, we can accelerate the Hold's completion.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_111": "You are... offering to become Celestials?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_112": "It is as we promised—those who build the Hold do not return.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_113": "Lady Hsin, this is the \"price\" we are willing to pay.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_114": "We know your concerns. One shouldn't be greedy, that is true. But... hehe, people like us are the greediest of all.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_115": "\"Know the Way at dawn, die without regret at dusk.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_116": "But if I offer this body to my homeland at dawn, only to know the Way once more at dusk—what could be better?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_117": "This battle determines Xuanfang's fate. Lady Hsin, from now on, we are one with this Hold—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_118": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_119": "...Mm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_12": "Lady Hsin, as long as you're here, we still stand a chance. There will be a future for Xuanfang. Please—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_120": "At this point, if I still hesitate, I might as well cast aside this human form.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_121": "In the end, I was never truly a Sentinel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_122": "Perhaps it is this \"heart\" that kept me from ever becoming \"Hsin the Moon Fox.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_123": "A vision simulated by the Heart Realm unfolds before you, and you watch the Fortress and Gorges War through Hsin's eyes.\n \nXuanfang Hold is nearly complete when Ovathrax's Tacet Discord hordes descend on Yuan Fortress. Warden Yuxian brings word that the front is in crisis. The Hsin of that day chose to save Xuanfang Hold and hold the line alongside soldiers and civilians alike.\n \nInside the memory, you walk in Hsin's shoes, making decisions and directing the Autopuppets to evacuate the people. In the Sanctum, She pushes Her power to its limit to accelerate the Hold's construction. Outside, the Wardens refuse to yield, and the Xuanling Birds dive into the city, giving their lives to slow the Tacet Discord advance. At the crisis point, the Court of Savantae's Artisans offer themselves to the Lexicon Axis early, becoming Celestials to bolster Hsin's strength. Grieving but resolute, Hsin gambles everything to force the Civilization Capsule to bring Xuanfang Hold to completion.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_13": "You want me to leave and fight another day, don't you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_14": "I understand your intent, but... my answer is the same as yours. The same two words.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_15": "No retreat.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_16": "Every moment I stay is one more life I can save.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_17": "My lady...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_18": "Enough. That is final. What is the status of the civilians?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_19": "Most have been evacuated, but some remain trapped near Yuan Fortress.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_2": "It's broken our front lines and is nearing Yuan Fortress. Based on the Outriders' reports, it will reach the gates in thirty minutes.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_20": "The perimeter is swarming with monsters summoned by Ovathrax. With our current forces... a full breakout is impossible.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_21": "But there are weak points. We can still carve a path through.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_22": "Prioritize the civilians. Notify all units...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_23": "In the name of Hsin the Moon Fox... In the name of the Sentinel of this land, follow my command. I will ensure everyone lives to see tomorrow.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_24": "...Understood! I will inform all units!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_25": "Wait. Before you go, tell me your name.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_26": "I am <ano=Feather-Brought>Yuxian</ano>. My mother told me a Xuanling Bird flew by when I was born, so she gave me this name. An interesting coincidence.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_27": "Yuxian... Good. I will remember it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_28": "In this outbreak, the odds are slim. The least I can do is carry your names with me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_29": "Remember: no matter what, I stand with you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_3": "The Threnodian clearly knew about Xuanfang Hold's construction... and planned this raid strategically. The Tacet Discords' assault is fierce. They've reached the mountain gates. We've already...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_30": "...Understood. Lady Hsin, it is time for me to return to the battlefield.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_31": "When you first arrived, that boy was barely seven. Now, he looks like a true \"pillar\" of the force.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_32": "And you, Little Fox? The enemy is at the gates, Jinzhou's affairs remain unresolved, and the true Sentinel is nowhere to be found.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_33": "The Threnodian knew our moves from the start. Waiting is death. Fighting is death. Even you, in your innocence, must see this is a stalemate.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_34": "Even if death awaits us either way, I cannot sit by.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_35": "Even if Ovathrax did not come today, it would eventually. We built Xuanfang to fight it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_36": "All I can do is respond to the turn of battle and deploy Autopuppets as needed. At the very least, the civilians must be evacuated.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_37": "The battlefield shifts in a breath. Even with your Prism of Fate to see it all, relaying orders to every flank at once is impossible.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_38": "That's exactly why you are here, isn't it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_39": "...Little Fox, have you thought this through?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_4": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_40": "Yes.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_41": "Then I will watch the battlefield for you and help you relay your commands.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_42": "Some of the civilians are still trapped... We must prioritize their safety.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_43": "I will buy them time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_44": "These monsters have no mind of their own. They blindly pursue \"people\"...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_45": "No... Are they drawn to \"battle\"?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_46": "If that is the case...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_47": "Heh. So that is it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_48": "Well done, Little Fox. The monsters are withdrawing.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_49": "Xuanling, tell everyone to stay hidden and move away from the Tacet Discords.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_5": "Lady Hsin, you...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_50": "Good. Now the trapped citizens can escape.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_51": "How is our communication with Mingting? Any news?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_52": "The distress signal went out. But even at top speed, they are still five days away.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_53": "Five days... Too late.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_54": "The situation at the Gorges of Spirits is no better. We have to rely on these Autopuppets...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_55": "They keep coming...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_56": "Xuanling, tell everyone the civilians should be safe now. As for the rest... If it comes to it, save yourself first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_57": "But...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_58": "I know. Xuanfang is the bridge between Mengzhou and the Jinzhou of the future. It cannot fall.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_59": "Yuan Fortress is the choke point. Once it falls, all of Xuanfang becomes as fragile as paper against the swarms.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_6": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_60": "I will find a way. If necessary... you know, I am also \"Hsin the Moon Fox.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_61": "Still not enough... I have to find another way...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_62": "...Hm?!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_63": "What... There are still people who haven't left?!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_64": "They refused to go.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_65": "The Warden Commander asked me to deliver this message.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_66": "...What did he say?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_67": "He said Yuxian passed on your orders. They each found stones and carved their names into them.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_68": "He has also organized the Artisans and Wardens to move to other sectors.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_69": "He said... as long as you are here, and as long as the Lexicon Axis you established stands, even on scorched earth, Xuanfang still has a future.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_7": "Lady Hsin? Are you with me?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_70": "...Scorched earth?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_71": "No. Xuanling, tell him not to do anything stupid!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_72": "It is... too late.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_73": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_74": "You said you would stand with the people of Xuanfang, didn't you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_75": "They, in turn, stand with the Sentinel who guards this land.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_76": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_77": "Little Fox, they all believe in you... We have no time for despair.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_78": "Most of the civilians were evacuated. Now we should help the Artisans still out there on the battlefield.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_79": "Before the explosion, Ruoyun relocated them all. I've marked their locations for you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_8": "...Is there anyone left who can retreat?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_80": "Mm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_81": "Pull yourself together, Little Fox. Who are you pulling that long face for?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_82": "I...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_83": "There were seven thousand souls here. You saved most of them amidst a relentless attack. What more do you want?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_84": "Wake up! You keep insisting you're also \"Hsin the Moon Fox,\" remember?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_85": "What about the rest of the people? Let them die? They're all waiting for the Sentinel's commands.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_86": "I... I am sorry... I...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_87": "Tell me, what do you want, Little Fox?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_88": "I want them all to escape and live.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_89": "Xuanling, how much can you see?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_9": "A message came from the Central Plains. Only two words—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_90": "Not much. The Threnodian's influence is too strong. Most of my companions can barely fly.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_91": "It's alright. Evacuate the front lines. Try to find survivors along the way and guide them to me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_92": "We only need to hold until the last of them gather. Then I will create a new path for everyone to leave together.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_93": "Rest assured. The Artisans who failed to evacuate in time have already been guided to the vicinity of the Lexicon Axis.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_94": "Good. You and your companions can also follow them back now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_95": "Us...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_96": "Little Fox, this may be the last you hear from me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_97": "The Autopuppets cannot draw enough attention. Slow as Ovathrax is, it has already turned its eye toward Xuanfang.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_98": "There are soldiers still in the field. I will buy them time to reach the Axis.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_206_99": "...Xuanling.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_1": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_10": "They didn't throw themselves into the fire just to be remembered forever.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_11": "Hsin, you already did everything you could. They surely knew that. The circumstances...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_12": "The circumstances left no other choice, I know.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_13": "Speaking of which, I have been swept along by such circumstances many times.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_14": "Take past lantern festivals, for instance. In the form of a little fox, I could see their pain, but all I could offer were small gestures of comfort.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_15": "Sometimes I wondered... was my presence alone enough?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_16": "As long as I appeared before them, they felt safe. Happy. They believed they could endure the hard days.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_17": "But my reach was so limited, just as it is now. How is this any different from facing the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs back then?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_18": "I took a Capsule and ran. I ran and ran, searching for somewhere safe.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_19": "And they... they were all waiting for me to appear. Waiting for me to stand before them.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_2": "What I just saw... That was everything you went through, wasn't it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_20": "Round and round, and in the end, I am still that little fox.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_21": "But now, it should be different. After all, I have you with me now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_22": "Thanks to you, I have seized more and more authority from Suhsin—from the \"Sentinel's true will.\" The more I take, the more power I command.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_23": "The \"Sentinel's true will\"?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_24": "Yes, the Sentinel's underlying logic. Its true will.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_25": "The Sentinel believed that my remolding of the Civilization Capsule, my choice to preserve Xuanfang Hold, was a violation of the rules. A \"loss of control.\" So it has been trying to reclaim the Hold to force it back onto its ordained path of ruin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_26": "But thanks to you, I have gained the upper hand. The \"anomalies\" you fixed along the way have been strengthening my new authority.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_27": "—To break free from the Sentinel's will and forge new rules with my own hands.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_28": "With authority like that, I can finally do what the true \"Hsin the Moon Fox\" once could.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_29": "That girl carries my scent. It will make finding her easier.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_3": "...You gave everything you had.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_30": "Come, Arbiter. I know you still harbor many questions.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_31": "But right now, finding her and restoring Xuanfang Hold is what matters more, isn't it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_32": "When all this is over, tell me what you're still holding back, okay?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_33": "Yes... I will when \"all this\" is over.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_34": "You open your eyes to find Hsin before you, Her spirits low. You raise what you just witnessed, but She deflects, brushing it off with a self-deprecating joke, calling herself a little fox swept along by events, changing the subject.\n \nShe tells you Suhsin embodies the \"Sentinel's true will.\" In Suhsin's view, remolding the Civilization Capsule and preserving Xuanfang Hold broke the established order. Its goal has been to reclaim control and steer Xuanfang Hold back to its destined collapse. Every \"anomaly\" you repaired has strengthened Hsin's rewritten rules over Suhsin, allowing her now to wield the Moon Fox's power directly.\n\nShe opens the way into the Heartscape Labyrinth and asks you to join her to find Suoming and restore Xuanfang Hold. You can tell She's still hiding something. You make Her promise to tell you the rest once this is over.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_4": "You've been in Xuanfang for a while now, Arbiter. Have you visited the Ministry of War?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_5": "There is a stone tablet there. Every single one of their names is engraved upon it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_6": "I merely waved my hand. I merely offered a few words of judgment. They all acted on their own accord.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_7": "They walked away from the path I instructed and shielded a Hold that was never meant to exist. They gave their lives without a second thought.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_8": "In the end, all that remains of them is a name carved into cold stone. Faint. Hollow. One after another.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_207_9": "If no one speaks of them, they will be forgotten as if they never were.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_208_1": "A Heartscape Labyrinth? You once led me and Suoming out of this bamboo forest when you were in your fox form.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_208_2": "Yes. Thanks to you, Arbiter, I can finally walk by your side in this form.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_209_1": "Did Suhsin set up these mechanisms to stop us?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_209_2": "Yes. My current authority still falls slightly short of its own. We'll have to take a detour.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_1": "I'm not leaving. After everything we've been through, you want me to listen to some stranger?!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_10": "Something does feel off...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_11": "If you say so, {PlayerName}, I want to believe it. But the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_12": "See? Even {PlayerName} thinks the same thing!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_13": "Paragon Qingxiao, my apologies for disturbing your cultivation. But there's been an emergency... It requires your attention.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_14": "It's no trouble. What's happened?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_15": "Someone tried to break into the Sanctum. We've detained her, but she claims to hold the Sentinel's token. Except... it's not in any of our records. No way to verify it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_16": "Token...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_17": "Did she say where she came from?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_18": "She said... she's an Intendant in Mengzhou's Ministry of Sentinel Affairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_19": "...I see. {PlayerName} and I are bound for the Sanctum as we speak. We won't be long.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_2": "This is about keeping us safe... Won't you stop being so stubborn...!?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_20": "You come upon a family in the middle of an argument. Wanhong, an old man, refuses to leave the Land of Xuanfang, the only home he has ever known. His daughter Qingchen, however, is convinced the Hold is heading for another disaster and insists on moving the family out.\n \nAs father and daughter stand at an impasse, Qingxiao receives word from Liangyu: a woman claiming to be an Intendant of the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs tried to force her way into the Sanctum and was stopped by the Wardens.\n\nYou decide to head to the Sanctum and find out what's happening.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_3": "Ah, Paragon Qingxiao, {PlayerName}! Thank goodness you're here. Help me talk some sense into my father, please...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_4": "What's all this about?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_5": "Well, a while back, someone from the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs said the Hold had \"served its purpose\" and would collapse any day now. Told us to move out while we could.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_6": "Ridiculous. Our family has lived in this land for generations. You don't just pack up and leave...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_7": "To be fair, I'm not convinced either. It came out of nowhere...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_8": "But that person carried an Intendant's command token. Clearly no small figure... And I'd rather not wait to find out. We can't survive another disaster like the Autopuppet rebellion...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_20_9": "Nothing's settled yet. No need to panic.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_210_1": "Hsin, where did this thick fog come from?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_210_2": "This is a real bamboo forest in Mengzhou. Stay close to me, Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_211_1": "Hmm? The Heartscape Labyrinth looks different than before.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_211_2": "Hehe... more beautiful than it was, isn't it? Arbiter, at the end of this bridge lies the Threshold that leads to Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_1": "You should be relieved to hear I have reclaimed most of my authority from Suhsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_10": "Once we are out, I will make it up to you. How does that sound?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_11": "...Mm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_12": "You and Hsin press deeper into the Heartscape Labyrinth. Hsin promises to answer anything you wish to know. In that moment, the Providence Lock reacts. Suoming's words ring in your head: the Lock will only warn you if Hsin the Moon Fox tries to do anything against you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_2": "This Labyrinth is now entirely mine to command.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_3": "Everything you wish to know, I will lay before you, piece by piece, through this Labyrinth. Honestly and fully.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_4": "(Tch... Seems like that thingamabob that red-haired girl gave you is acting up.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_5": "(Didn't she say it would react if Hsin the Moon Fox wanted to do something against you?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_6": "Arbiter?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_7": "(The <te href=852011>Providence Lock</te>...?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_8": "I'm fine. Just a bit dizzy from the emotional whiplash. Let's keep moving.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_212_9": "Mm... this Labyrinth reaches into one's very soul. You have lingered in my Heartscapes for too long; some discomfort is natural.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_1": "The mountains and waters in the Land of Xuanfang have always looked so peaceful...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_10": "Every thought I hold within—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_2": "What you see before you is the future the Sentinel's will desires—this land, eternal and unchanged.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_3": "Arbiter, sometimes I wonder... Is what I'm doing truly what the people of Mengzhou want?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_4": "Restoring the Civilization Capsule, establishing Xuanfang Hold... Right or wrong, I can't judge for the people here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_5": "But I've heard what they have to say about \"Lady Hsin.\" Their faith in you is genuine.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_6": "Is that so... So they have been waiting for the Sentinel to appear again...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_7": "Hsin, the reflection in the water...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_8": "Patience...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_213_9": "Then, Arbiter, through this Heartscape, I will lay everything bare—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_1": "What I seek",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_10": "Then take the Civilization Capsule to the Sentinel in Mengzhou",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_11": "Xuanfang Hold... would have peace forevermore.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_12": "Hsin...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_13": "You don't have to lie anymore",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_2": "is for Xuanfang to know peace and to endure",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_3": "Not only these mountains and rivers",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_4": "but the warmth of ordinary life",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_5": "And I... I would live beside them",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_6": "Hmm...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_7": "And then... I would see the Waking Moon Festival's lanterns light the sky",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_8": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_214_9": "Celebrate with everyone one last time",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_1": "What's that... Suoming gave it to you, didn't she?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_10": "Arbiter... I...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_11": "You did well, Hsin. You held everything together while I was away. That wasn't easy.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_12": "Arbiter, don't try to—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_13": "Don't say comforting things like that... I... I...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_14": "Hsin...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_15": "The Sentinel is dead!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_16": "You saw it yourself... The founding of Xuanfang... came at the cost of further damaging the Civilization Capsule...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_17": "I was born from the hope of restoring it! I knew my duty. I knew how much the Moon Fox had entrusted me with.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_18": "But I... but I... I betrayed that hope. I betrayed the very duty I was born to carry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_19": "After that, I could feel Its frequency waning with each passing day. I tried so many things. I tried everything...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_2": "You recognize it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_20": "But just as I couldn't stop It from walking into that trap, I couldn't catch up to the fading of Its frequency.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_21": "Until... I could no longer sense It. And the Civilization Capsule stopped draining my power, and instead began to feed me...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_22": "I knew... It was gone. And I had caused Its death.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_23": "Arbiter... {PlayerName}... I...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_24": "I believe... what people need is Hsin the Moon Fox, not a diminished Fractal Form...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_25": "What were you planning to do behind my back?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_26": "If I reclaimed Suhsin's power, I could awaken the Sentinel's will from the <ano=base code>deepest part</ano> of the Civilization Capsule... Its true will.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_27": "If I gave myself up, the true Sentinel could return! Its memories might be incomplete, but... even so, It would be the true Sentinel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_28": "You're already a piece of the Moon Fox. If you disappear, how can you be certain that what returns is truly the Sentinel?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_29": "...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_3": "Had I known you were carrying it, I wouldn't have had to put on such a show. All those stories I spun for you...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_30": "Hsin, I've had this on me since I first entered the Labyrinth. It only reacts if you intend to do something against me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_31": "You lied to me many times along the way, but this Lock only warned me just now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_32": "Because even you believed... that if I learned the truth later, it would affect me as Arbiter more than anything else. Am I right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_33": "Arbiter... I...!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_34": "I thought if I couldn't bring the Sentinel back...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_35": "You aren't afraid of death, yet you fear this?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_36": "Hsin, all you wanted was to use \"Arbiter\" as an excuse to justify your escape, didn't you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_37": "You had the courage to stay in a Xuanfang ravaged by Tacet Discords, but no courage to face yourself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_38": "If the true Sentinel had made the decision, it would've been better. Wiser. More foolproof for Xuanfang, Mengzhou, even Solaris.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_39": "If It were here, even in circumstances like this, It would never have let Muyu's chaos take root.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_4": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_40": "You're trapped in self-doubt. You never give your own effort its due.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_41": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_42": "The death of Sentinel Hsin the Moon Fox is my responsibility as Arbiter. I will uncover the truth.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_43": "And the wrongdoings of the Sentinel's Fractal Form will be judged once the dust settles.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_44": "But for these past hundred years, it's been you leading the people of Mengzhou forward.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_45": "Hsin, will you betray the hopes they place in you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_46": "You call Hsin out on what She has been trying to hide from you all along: She intends to sacrifice Herself to finish remolding the Civilization Capsule. You comfort Hsin, who can no longer keep up Her pretense of ease, and tell Her that since you have come this far, you will not let Her bear this burden alone. That is when Hsin's walls finally break and She tells you the truth: Her decision to use the Civilization Capsule to save Xuanfang Hold directly caused the original Hsin the Moon Fox's death. Her true purpose in reclaiming Suhsin's power is to overwrite Her own existence with the Sentinel's consciousness buried in the Capsule's code, and bring the original Moon Fox Sentinel back.\n\nYou refuse to let Her do that.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_5": "Everything you said is true. You really wanted to be with the people of Xuanfang. To see the sea of lights at the festival again. To see Hsin the Moon Fox once more.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_6": "But... you simply can't.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_7": "Hsin, tell me, was the cost of remolding the Civilization Capsule your own life?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_8": "I...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_215_9": "Whatever you're planning, don't sacrifice yourself. I'm here. There's no need for you to bear this alone.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_216_1": "(Sentinel Hsin the Moon Fox is dead...?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_216_2": "({PlayerName}...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_216_3": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_217_1": "This... is the way out.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_217_2": "Hsin, we'll discuss this more after we find Suoming and handle Suhsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_217_3": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_1": "Arbiter, now that you've arrived, it seems \"Hsin's\" power has been largely reclaimed.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_10": "...Okay!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_11": "You find Suoming in the Heartscape Labyrinth, locked in combat with a Suhsin Fractal Form. She takes one look at Hsin's face and knows you've learned the truth. She pulls out the Vermillion Lock and hands it to Hsin. Inside, she says, is a message left for Her by the true Hsin the Moon Fox. With your encouragement, Hsin decides to open it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_2": "Hm? Seems you already know the secrets She and It keep.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_3": "Well...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_4": "From my position, I speak from the perspective of Mengzhou's Ministry of Sentinel Affairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_5": "Everyone here understands... how to handle Her is ultimately your authority as Arbiter. I have no right to intervene, nor the ability to stop you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_6": "But still, let's hear what It has to say first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_7": "A Vermillion Lock... So what I sensed was not just the lingering frequency on the token...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_8": "The Sentinel bound it with a seal only you can undo. Open it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_218_9": "Open it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_21_1": "Well? Still have reservations about Intendant Suoming?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_21_2": "Not anymore. But one thing still bothers me...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_220_1": "Suoming, can you find Hsin?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_220_2": "Yes, let's handle this clone first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_221_1": "\"Hsin's\" frequency is here, too. You can't reject it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_221_2": "Let's go, Arbiter. It will lead us to Suhsin the Inevitable.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_221_3": "Lady Hsin, look at my Moon Lantern!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_221_4": "Lady Hsin, look at my Moon Lantern!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_221_5": "I can never become the Sentinel I was supposed to be... My only choice... is to bring It back...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_222_1": "Arbiter, Hsin has strayed at every turn. By my calculations, I surpass Her in every measurable metric.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_223_1": "To capture the Waking Moon's chaos and seal it in the Capsule. How can such inversion befit a Sentinel?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_224_1": "To gather the world's grief and seal it in the Capsule. How can such contradiction befit a Sentinel?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_225_1": "Suhsin the Inevitable... We've found it, but what of Hsin the Moon Fox?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_225_2": "You've already given Hsin what She needed most. Right now, we need to focus on weakening Suhsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_226_1": "You need only press forward, Arbiter. I'll use the frequency of the Hsin the Moon Fox within the lock to open up a path.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_227_1": "It's forcing us into the deeper regions. Stay on it!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_228_1": "(These chains... I can use the Heart of Flames key to break them!)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_229_1": "Arbiter, watch out!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_1": "Well? Still have reservations about Intendant Suoming?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_10": "You must be... the Xuan Paragon of Xuanfang Hold, and this {Male=gentleman;Female=lady}... Never mind.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_11": "Why the evasion?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_12": "Forgive us. To us in the Ministry, {Male=he;Female=she} holds a special standing. Not something to speak of before outsiders.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_13": "Your Ministry governs Sentinel matters, so this is about...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_14": "Ah, I get it. Qingxiao already knows I'm the Arbiter. No need to dance around it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_15": "We meant no disrespect, Arbiter. The situation demanded immediate action. We couldn't report in time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_16": "Besides, the Intendant ordered us to stay silent. She said... you would surely arrive at the Sanctum at this time, and that all your questions would be answered there.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_17": "As for the panic this has caused, we'll help the Wardens contain it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_18": "...I see. I understand your position. I won't make things more difficult.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_19": "But when this is all over, I want the full story.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_2": "Not anymore. But... one thing still bothers me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_20": "You have my word, Arbiter. The Intendant... she came to safeguard Xuanfang.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_3": "What happened before she joined the Ministry. The way she took the frequencies of her fallen comrades...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_4": "Hm. The omens of the Sanctum's fall aren't settled yet. Let's get through this first. I'll explain later.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_5": "What worries me more right now is the people. Our presence here has already—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_6": "Shh. Leave it for now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_7": "The Sanctum's fall? What are you two talking about?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_8": "Are you the ones spreading rumors and causing all this panic?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_22_9": "That uniform... they're from Mengzhou's Ministry of Sentinel Affairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_230_1": "The Heart of Frost?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_230_2": "We're catching up!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_231_1": "(Too many! I'll use this Realm's key to freeze them!)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_232_1": "I've got your back.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2331_1": "Hsin...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_233_1": "Now!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_10": "The fault is my own! If only I had not—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_11": "No. That very choice proves you are the Sentinel who can find a new path forward.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_12": "If it had been you, <ano=Xuanqing>she</ano> might still be here today...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_13": "But—if I hadn't... If you were still here...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_14": "Hsin. The day you were born, I envisioned your future.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_15": "I envisioned how you would laugh, cry, and find your place in this world...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_16": "But I've stumbled every step of the way. I do not deserve your... faith.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_17": "You saved thousands in the Fortress and the Gorges War. You guarded the Civilization Capsule for centuries to make its restoration possible. You brought hope where there was none.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_18": "You have long been revered as the divinity you are—the very heart of Mengzhou.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_19": "Go. Walk forward, one step at a time. Walk farther and better than I ever could.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_22": "Sorry to keep you waiting, Arbiter. Sentinel Hsin the Moon Fox has come, and She's finally made up Her mind.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_3": "Sentinel? If you are here, will Suhsin—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_4": "The Arbiter and Suoming will not give it the chance.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_5": "Sentinel... I am so—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_6": "Hsin, I am sorry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_7": "I knew you were born of feeling. Your capacity for joy and sorrow far exceeds my own.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_8": "Remolding the Civilization Capsule would trap you between cruelties, and the grief would eat you alive.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_234_9": "I am truly sorry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_235_1": "Rule violation. Contradictory logic. Inefficient. Redundant. Return your authority.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_235_2": "My, my, is that the best you can do? I thought you took pleasure in mimicking me?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_235_3": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_235_4": "You are unworthy of being Sentinel!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_236_1": "Manifold forms, take shape. The Heart of Flames burns eternal.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_236_2": "Arbiter! Stay within the field, I'll—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_236_3": "Hsin, don't waste your strength reshaping the ground. Focus on Suhsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_237_1": "Manifold forms, solidify. The Heart of Frost fades without a trace.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_238_1": "Stop!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_23_1": "You know this is the Sentinel's Sanctum. How dare you trespass?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_23_2": "Watcher Liangyu... The way you carry yourself reminds me of an old friend.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_23_3": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_1": "Suhsin, look. The Simulacrum Nexus. Our Civilization Capsule is so vast, so varied.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_10": "I will stop Xuanfang Hold's collapse and gather those Celestials whose wills are spent, those on the verge of fading, into my Prism of Fate.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_11": "There they will remain, until the day I find them a place to belong.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_12": "This exposes forbidden secrets. It is unbefitting a Sentinel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_13": "But... anyone who possesses a heart would do the same.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_14": "Hsin, you truly are capable of becoming a Sentinel like no other.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_2": "The Heart of Stillness is wide and welcoming. The Heart of Flames is fierce and thriving. The Heart of Frost is still and steady. The Heart of Bloom is peaceful and pleasant.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_3": "In other words: compromise, impulse, indifference, and mediocrity.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_4": "True. It is greed, pleasure, and the endless hustle. And yet, it is also life, endless and enduring.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_5": "This is humanity. This is emotion. This is the heart. This is—civilization.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_6": "How could you strip them of that? And leave only reason, logic, and cold principles?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_7": "You defy your own origin. You overturn what is ordained. Even with your divine cunning, the path ahead remains a chaos no stratagem can pierce... much like the error of my own existence.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_8": "A chaos no stratagem can pierce? How frightening. Then let us walk that path together.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_240_9": "The remolding of the Civilization Capsule is nearly complete. The remains the Fractsidus stole will no longer be enough to shake Mengzhou.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_1": "Hurry! The Lantern Carriage is about to leave!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_10": "So, Arbiter... that plan of yours, to tell everyone the truth about Hsin? Let's wait. Just a little longer.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_11": "Hsin...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_12": "It told me to find my place in this world... And I think, what I want most right now, is this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_13": "To give them a sense of safety. A sense of peace. Not because I am expected to... but because I want to.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_14": "The dark currents of Mengzhou have yet to be purged at the root. Whether \"Hsin\" appears is secondary. What matters is whether the Sentinel still endures.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_15": "If that is what you've decided, then do as you wish.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_16": "Then I gratefully accept your approval, Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_17": "And truly, in this moment I feel no regret. No loneliness. Because I know... as long as Hsin is here...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_18": "This Waking Moon Festival, and all the lanterns yet to come... they will shine on, countless and bright.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_19": "Night falls, and the Waking Moon Festival begins as planned. Taking in the bustling liveliness She has not seen in years, Hsin tells you She means to continue guiding Mengzhou as its Sentinel, and that She is in no hurry to reveal Her identity as \"Hsin\" just yet. She smiles and says that in this moment, She feels neither regret nor loneliness. As long as \"Hsin\" is here, this festival and all the lanterns to come will be countless and bright.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_2": "Wait for me!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_3": "The Waking Moon Festival... It feels like another lifetime.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_4": "Hsin, why are you still here? The whole city is waiting for you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_5": "They have waited so long to see me. If I simply strolled through the streets, wouldn't I disappoint them?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_6": "As always, I must wait until the festival reaches its peak, until every heart is full of aching anticipation—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_7": "Arbiter, do you think all the Sentinels feel this restless and giddy? I can barely stand to wait a moment longer.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_8": "You all show it differently, but you all feel in similar ways.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_241_9": "Quite so. And what I feel only deepens with every passing moment.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_1": "Oh? Is there something else on your mind, Arbiter?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_10": "At the very least, the Fractsidus can no longer use the remains they stole away to interfere with the Capsule.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_11": "Our counterattack begins right here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_12": "I want to ask something else.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_13": "Mm. Do look forward to it, Arbiter. The Waking Moon brings its own delights.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_2": "What will become of the Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_3": "Has the Civilization Capsule been fully remolded?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_4": "I'll see you at the Waking Moon Festival.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_5": "The turmoil within the Simulacrum Nexus hasn't fully quieted yet. Until then, I cannot reclaim it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_6": "I have left a portion of my frequency and power with the Nexus Fox Shadow. It will join the remaining Celestials in finishing the work.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_7": "Once the dust has settled, I will take over from there.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_8": "I want to ask something else.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_242_9": "Mm, you could say the grand design is finally taking shape. A portion of its power is still stabilizing the Nexus's framework, much like the Xuanyuan Domain once separated to sustain Xuanfang Hold.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_243_1": "During the Manifold Sanctum restoration, see that no corners are cut.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_243_2": "Rest assured, Intendant Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_1": "During the Manifold Sanctum's restoration, see that no corners are cut.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_10": "Besides, Hsin the Moon Fox will appear before the people tonight. First time in years. I cannot afford to relax.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_11": "Looks like it'd take Hsin hiding your umbrella and locking you away in some quiet garden to get you to rest.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_12": "Arbiter... That sounds exactly like what She would do.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_2": "Rest assured, Intendant Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_3": "Suoming, do you ever take a break?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_4": "Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_5": "Ah! So this is—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_6": "W-wow, Qiting, could I ask the Arbiter for an... autograph?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_7": "Have some decorum.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_8": "I'm sorry, Intendant Suoming!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_244_9": "These two still have much to learn, but they show promise. I assigned them to oversee the Sanctum's repairs. The entrance to the Simulacrum Nexus is still inside, after all.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_245_1": "Arbiter, you head to the festival first. I still have matters to settle with the Ministry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_245_2": "Sure, if you get some rest. At least tonight.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_245_3": "I already have. Sampling Tangning's Moon Fox Rice Cakes was a start.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_245_4": "I imagine the ones at the festival... will taste even better.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_1": "For a hundred years, I rebuilt countless landscapes and cultures within the Capsule.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_10": "Arbiter, the night has come. Let us walk into the Waking Moon together.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_2": "None of it compares to the warmth of this. Real light, living and breathing.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_3": "Yes, the cold projections of the past have transformed into the warm scene before us now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_4": "The road ahead is long. For the next thousand dawns and dusks, I will be the one to watch over Mengzhou.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_5": "Here, it is customary to write the year's joys on the lantern.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_6": "Then what will you write?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_7": "Hehe, the one who gathers all the wishes doesn't release her own.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_8": "What will you write, Arbiter?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_246_9": "I...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_1": "Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_10": "Seal Master, Boss, Sister Suoming... They had many names for me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_11": "(Call her Seal Master)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_12": "(Call her Boss)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_13": "(Call her Sister Suoming)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_14": "Your Seal Master is extraordinary. She carried Mengzhou through centuries when the Sentinel wasn't there to govern its affairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_15": "Your Boss is extraordinary. She carried Mengzhou through centuries when the Sentinel wasn't there to govern its affairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_16": "Your Sister Suoming is extraordinary. She carried Mengzhou through centuries when the Sentinel wasn't there to govern its affairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_17": "And she did it flawlessly. Now, with her counsel, Hsin will become a Sentinel like no other.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_18": "Not just in the past, but in the future too, she'll keep giving you every reason to never regret following her.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_19": "The last time I cried was when they were taken from me. Now...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_2": "Am I interrupting?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_20": "To have someone else speak to them... It feels good, like they're still here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_21": "Thank you, Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_22": "You find Suoming speaking with the frequencies held inside her Locks. She does not hide it, admitting that Suhsin's conjuring of her most beloved subordinate had left her missing them dearly. You ask to speak to her departed friends, telling them how she led Mengzhou in the Sentinel's absence for centuries. Suoming is deeply moved.\n\n\"To have someone else speak to them... It feels good, like they're still here.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_3": "No. My conversation with them has concluded.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_4": "\"Them\"? You mean in the lock...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_5": "Yes... Every now and then, I commune with... their frequencies.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_6": "Though, to be precise, it's merely speaking to myself. I refrain from doing it in the presence of others.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_7": "But Suhsin recreated one of the subordinates I was most fond of... It reminded me of how much I miss them.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_8": "I see. Would you allow me to say a few words to them?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_247_9": "What did they usually call you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_1": "Suoming, I still know very little about the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs... There's something I've been wondering.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_10": "So it was during that fight your companions were...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_11": "Yes... They were willing to die for Huating. Still, I hated the Sentinel for never reaching out to help us.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_12": "Back then, Hsin the Moon Fox was heavily weakened and in no state to watch over all of Mengzhou.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_13": "Exactly. So when I finally met Her, how could I hold onto that hatred?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_14": "I simply inherited the title of Intendant and purged the remnants of \"Balanophora\" from our ranks.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_15": "Together with other Ministry members, we bore Providence Locks created from Fractal Proliferation. They're fragments of the Sentinel's power that allowed us to quell crises across Mengzhou.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_16": "This Providence Lock really came through for me this time as well. Speaking of which, Mengzhou should be stabilizing by now, right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_17": "Yes, Arbiter... You needn't worry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_18": "Although there is one matter that remains unresolved. You should be made aware.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_19": "Go ahead.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_2": "Ask freely.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_20": "Mingting has long coordinated the Ministries of Sentinel Affairs across every city, seeking greater possibilities for the Huanglong Sentinels.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_22": "Whatever happens, we cannot let our enemies seize the initiative again.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_23": "Still, as I said, nothing is settled yet. Should there be progress down the line, your involvement will be indispensable.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_24": "I understand. If it concerns the Sentinels, I'll do everything I can.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_25": "I would share more, but I haven't had the luxury of involving myself in that particular affair.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_26": "That's alright. It's always a comfort to know a little more about the Sentinels... or rather, my partners in all of this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_27": "Thank you for sharing, Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_28": "You ask Suoming what became of the people of Mengzhou during the century after Sentinel Hsin the Moon Fox was struck down, while \"Hsin\" was away remolding the Civilization Capsule. Not long after the assassination, a Waveworn Phenomenon called the \"Evil Miasma\" spread across Mengzhou. Suoming's homeland, Huating, was ravaged as well, and countless lives were lost. The Sentinel, bound by Its own injuries, could offer no help. Suoming took up the title of Intendant and led the Ministry's members against the disaster, each of them carrying a \"Providence Lock\" the Sentinel had made imbued with Its power. Over the years, the situation in Mengzhou began to stabilize.\n \nSuoming tells you that Mingting is working with the Ministries of every city to seek greater possibilities for the Huanglong Sentinels, and that when the time is ripe, you will be needed to act as Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_3": "The condition a Sentinel is in can profoundly affect a civilization. I've... seen that firsthand before.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_4": "After Hsin the Moon Fox was attacked, and Hsin was in Xuanfang Hold for a century remolding the Civilization Capsule, what became of the people of Mengzhou?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_5": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_6": "Suoming?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_7": "Not long after the assassination, a Waveworn Phenomenon we called the \"Evil Miasma\" began spreading across Mengzhou.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_8": "It descended with black rain and rolling clouds. It eroded faces and devoured souls.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_248_9": "My homeland, Huating, was ravaged by it. Countless lives were lost.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_1": "Arbiter, look. The celebrations are at their liveliest now. Let's go.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_10": "I wish the Sentinel could see this. Ever since that day, It never came to the Waking Moon Festival again.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_11": "Hehe, you are more sentimental than I thought. I don't even need my powers of emotional sensing to read you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_12": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_13": "I feel sad too.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_14": "You... all of you Sentinels always carry these heavy burdens alone. By the time I arrive, you've already backed yourselves into a corner.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_15": "Once again, I came too late.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_16": "Arbiter, inside the Vermillion Lock Suoming gave me resides the Sentinel's last strand of frequency.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_17": "Its last frequency? What did It say?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_18": "The Sentinel... It apologized to me. It said It had put me through so much hardship, and given me no other choice.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_19": "And then, It told me It approved of my choices. It watched me walk my own path, step by step, and said I walked it better than It could...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_2": "Mm...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_20": "Arbiter, it was you who opened my eyes. I could not betray the hopes Mengzhou placed in \"Hsin.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_21": "And then, with the Sentinel's... with the approval from the one I admired most, I was able to transform.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_22": "And Xuanfang Hold and Mengzhou were able to rise again, bathed in such warm, splendorous light.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_23": "Long ago, It chose to build Xuanfang Hold to protect every living soul in this land. Then It created you, to remold the Civilization Capsule in a way never done before.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_24": "Even knowing you might have to choose between the people and the Sentinel... It never wavered.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_25": "Mm, that is why... It told me It was sorry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_26": "Yes. It loved Mengzhou that deeply. Every thought, every intention was bound to this land.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_27": "Like you said, Hsin the Moon Fox always cherished the joys of the mortal world. It could never bear to see sorrow.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_28": "If all we do is grieve, we'd be betraying Its very heart.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_29": "Exactly. So cheer up. The Sentinel never taught me how to console a sorrowful Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_3": "(I guess Hsin the Moon Fox hasn't witnessed this festival with Its own eyes... not since It was betrayed.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_30": "Thank you, Hsin. Knowing what the Sentinel said in the end... It really mattered to me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_31": "No need to thank me. Let us simply take in the lantern lights together.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_32": "Heavy is the weight you have carried, Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_33": "You walked the Waking Moon Festival with Hsin, and amid the brilliant lantern light you were moved to grief by the loss of Hsin the Moon Fox. Sensing your sorrow, Hsin drew you into the crowd to share in the festival's revelry. Afterward, you spoke to Hsin the Moon Fox of your regret, and Hsin passed on the Moon Fox's last words: It had always cherished the joys of the mortal world, and could never bear to see sorrow.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_4": "(If I'd gotten here sooner, maybe It would still be here—)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_5": "Is something wrong?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_6": "Nothing. Let's go.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_249_7": "Arbiter, if the Sentinel saw someone with a sad face at the festival, It would take their hand and walk with them through the celebration until their smile returned.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_1": "Paragon Qingxiao... and {PlayerName}. You've come!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_10": "The Ministry detected that Hsin's frequency has become critically unstable, reaching its breaking point. As Her state and the Hold's are one, I acted to keep the people safe.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_11": "You're only just noticing this now?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_12": "Spare the probing questions. The Ministry's decisions and orders are not mine to disclose, Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_13": "Hsin's <te href=750059>Prism of Fate</te>... I never imagined She would give this to you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_14": "...What's that supposed to mean?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_15": "It means... She had a change of heart. She chose to trust you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_16": "Paragon Qingxiao. You know Hsin the Moon Fox well. You understand what this token signifies.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_17": "That's... a <b>Vermillion Lock</b>...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_18": "It is a covenant. A deal between Hsin the Moon Fox and me. The time has come for Her to honor it. But as things stand, She may not even be able to save Herself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_19": "We don't have much time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_2": "Arbiter, we meet at last. I am Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_20": "Paragon, what does all this mean...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_21": "It is Hsin's frequency within that lock. She speaks the truth.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_22": "So that presence you sensed earlier...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_23": "Came from this, yes.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_24": "Is that proof enough for you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_25": "Hsin promised that when the time was right, she would give us and Xuanfang the answers we deserve.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_26": "It seems... that \"time\" is now. Watcher Liangyu, kindly let her through.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_27": "...Understood. I trust the Paragon's judgment.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_28": "Intendant, my apologies for the earlier offense... The Ministry of War's rules say you still need an escort to enter the Sanctum...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_29": "I'll go in with her.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_3": "And this... would be the Xuan Paragon. Qingxiao, I take it. A pleasure.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_30": "I have no objection.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_31": "The Prism of Fate grants its bearer the authority to enter the Sanctum. Your presence there may be the variable that shifts everything.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_32": "And Qingxiao?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_33": "...I'll stay in the Hold. See to my duties as Xuan Paragon.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_34": "Hsin charged me to act in Her stead should the tide ever become irreversible. Now I see She meant more than just the chaos Muyu caused.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_35": "A Sentinel's waning frequency may spark trouble in the Hold. Someone must remain here to handle it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_36": "The Sanctum's matters... and Hsin, I leave to you. I have faith in you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_37": "...I understand.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_38": "I'll handle whatever's waiting for us in the Sanctum.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_39": "Go, then.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_4": "What's the situation?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_40": "Be careful. In all things.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_41": "You find Intendant Suoming at the Sanctum entrance with the Wardens barring her way. She addresses you as Arbiter and knows you carry Hsin's <b>Prism of Fate</b>. When questioned, she states her purpose plainly: the Ministry has measured Hsin the Moon Fox's frequency and found it critically unstable. She may no longer be able to save even Herself. Suoming holds a covenant with Hsin, and the time has come for Her to honor it. The rumor of the Hold's collapse was Suoming's doing as well, a warning to give civilians time to evacuate should the worst occur.\n \nQingxiao senses Hsin's frequency within Suoming's token, the <b>Vermillion Lock</b>, and confirms she is telling the truth. After some discussion, you agree to enter the Sanctum with Suoming to search for Hsin, while Qingxiao remains in the Hold to manage any fallout.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_5": "She claims she came by decree to meet the Sentinel. And yes, we've confirmed that she really is an Intendant from the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_6": "But by custom, the Sentinel has to approve visitors first before an escort guides them in. And with Her absence of late, there's no way to know Her will.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_7": "Besides... if the Intendant truly came by decree, why sneak in through a side gate?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_8": "The people on the way over here spoke of \"Xuanfang Hold's collapse.\" Did that rumor come from you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_24_9": "Yes.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_1": "Hsin the Moon Fox? It's not time to depart yet, is it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_10": "At both turns, I knew the task at hand outweighed my own attachments.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_11": "But Suoming, you are not one with a strong Resonance Ability, yet you've lived through centuries.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_12": "It was your obsession with the Ten Seals that carried you this far? If one day, you release them all—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_13": "I would welcome that day, Hsin the Moon Fox.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_14": "Suoming...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_15": "Enough about me. Have you chosen who will accompany us to Mengzhou?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_16": "The Zhaoming Commerce Guild will provide us with cover along the way. Besides that, three more skilled individuals are joining us.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_17": "A fugitive framed by the Fractsidus, formerly known as the \"Blind Watcher.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_18": "A Jinzhou Patroller who has deep ties to Zhuojun Atelier.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_19": "And the third... an informant who, having finally seen his vengeance satisfied, offered his blade to our cause.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_2": "Not yet. Why don't you call me Hsin? Such formality.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_20": "You have met them already?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_21": "That Chairwoman has her own methods for bringing together those who share a common purpose.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_22": "Hmph, it seems my grand plans for a \"welcome party\" for little Suoming were quite unnecessary. Seems I needn't worry about you getting along.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_23": "We all have scores to settle in Mengzhou. Naturally, the conversation hardly runs dry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_24": "Indeed... We all have scores to settle.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_25": "Hsin and Suoming make secret preparations to leave for Mengzhou. Hsin has already chosen their companions: a fugitive framed by the Fractsidus, once known as the \"Blind Watcher\"; a Jinzhou Patroller with deep ties to Zhuojun Atelier; and an informant who, with his vengeance served, offered his services to their cause.\n \nThe tangled web of fate has finally drawn tight. Now, the time has come to unveil it all.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_26": "Joyful laughter echoes through the lantern-lit streets, while clear moonlight shines upon the bustling Hold as ever.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_27": "A few days later, somewhere in the Land of Xuanfang...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_3": "As I addressed the Sentinel before, so I will do so today.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_4": "Hehe, a strange display of care, but I'll accept it. Thank you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_5": "I came to thank you for your recent efforts, but... more than that, I came to apologize.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_6": "You unlocked two Vermillion Locks, didn't you? One to hold the Sentinel's frequency, the other when Suhsin dragged me away.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_7": "Who exactly... is inside them?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_8": "The Sixth and Eighth Seals. One sharp-tongued, one taciturn.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_250_9": "They are Reverberations that should have faded a century ago, sustained only by my obsession. You owe no apology.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_251_1": "Arbiter, leave this to me. The manifold power of Fractal Proliferation exists for moments like this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_252_1": "Careful! Suhsin commands more power than just that.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_253_1": "Hsin! There's no time. Get out of the way!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_254_1": "Hsin... If you insist on defying the ordained path, I shall reveal... the full weight of my power.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_1": "I need to say it once more. Thank you, Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_10": "...Suoming?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_11": "Worry not. That girl is one of ours. She has kept this secret well. If not, \"those people\" would never have allowed her to represent the Ministry here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_12": "And what of Mengzhou itself?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_13": "The Moon Fox's power has always been geared toward defense. Mengzhou retains many of Its protections. The Threnodian's invasion is not an immediate threat.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_14": "Perhaps, because you repelled Ovathrax in Jinzhou, Mengzhou has remained peaceful.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_15": "As for the Ministry, that young lady manages it. I'll speak with her soon about other tasks.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_16": "The Ministry of Sentinel Affairs... Yes, I'll keep an eye on their movements too.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_17": "Oh, and... I asked the Celestials about those satellites and Court of Savantae lettering. But it was so long ago, even they could not say for certain.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_18": "...Perhaps the past Moon Fox knew. But my memory has gaps from the time I arrived in Xuanfang... I will keep searching for you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_19": "What I do remember is blurred, but I can send what I have to the Black Shores for analysis. Perhaps they will discover something I overlooked...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_2": "If you had not come, I cannot imagine how things would have ended.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_20": "Good, someone from the Black Shores will contact you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_21": "Rest now. Let your thoughts settle. Tonight, at least, let yourself share this \"Waking Moon Festival\" with all of Xuanfang.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_3": "You were about to say, \"No need. This is what an Arbiter should do,\" weren't you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_4": "Glad you know it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_5": "You guessed it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_6": "Xuanfang Hold's affairs are settled for now. But Mengzhou... how is it faring?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_7": "Mm... Remember that \"lock\" that young lady from the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs gave you?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_8": "The Sentinel's assassination could not be hidden forever. But those above insisted on keeping it secret. If not for good, then for as long as they could.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_255_9": "Those below could only feign ignorance.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_256_1": "Come one, come all, don't miss out...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_256_2": "Moon Fox Rice Cakes, fresh out of the steamer!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_257_1": "That one over there... Don't they look like—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_257_2": "Shh. Big name out of Mengzhou City, has to be. Best keep our distance.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_258_1": "Think Lady Hsin will show up this year?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_258_2": "Nobody's heard a word about the Sentinel in years. I wouldn't count on it...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_259_1": "How come nobody came out to play today?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_259_2": "They're moving away, I heard... So it's only the two of us now...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_260_1": "Hi there, kitty...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_261_1": "There's been no warning. We aren't ready for any of this...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_261_2": "I'm sorry. It was sudden for us too. This is for your own safety...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_262_1": "Crates line the roadside, filled with Waking Moon Festival decorations and provisions. Somebody was counting them not long ago.\n \nThe people of Xuanfang have been waiting for this Festival for a long time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_263_1": "Have evacuation routes ready, and make sure not to cause alarm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_263_2": "Understood. And the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_263_3": "I'll handle them. The people's safety comes first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_264_1": "Why's the path to the Sanctum blocked? I thought they said the Celestial Ring Formation needed maintenance somewhere?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_264_2": "Somebody important showed up, is what I hear... No idea beyond that.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_265_1": "The Inner Threshold is inside Mengxuan Vale. This way, please.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_265_2": "After you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_265_3": "Hold on.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_266_1": "Here's my plan. We let a Formrender break the restriction on the Lantern Pavilion for us, lead it off somewhere, and slip in while it's distracted.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_266_2": "Are you out of your mind?!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_267_1": "And then, ten thousand Autopuppets descended from the sky like a blessing. Every heart lifted, and the clouds finally broke, and the moon shone through...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_267_2": "Whoa... And then? What happened to the city?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_267_3": "Child, we're standing in it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_268_1": "We only wanted a Waking Moon Festival. What's so wrong with that?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_268_2": "Maybe it's the Sentinel. She isn't the same anymore...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_268_3": "Nonsense! I'll tell you what it is. Those monsters crawled up from who knows where, and they can't stand to see anyone happy. That's why they wreck everything!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_269_1": "The Waking Moon Festival is almost here... I'll wait for him here. He'd like that, wouldn't he?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_269_2": "Grandma... it's been decades. Grandpa isn't coming back...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_1": "That little fox that showed us the way...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_2": "You recognize it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_3": "Is it connected to Hsin?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_4": "Its frequency resembles Hsin the Moon Fox's own, but it's still different from the Sentinel I've known.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_5": "...Arbiter. You lent me a hand in that fall. Thank you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_6": "You still haven't explained what this \"deal,\" this \"covenant\" with Hsin even is. I'm not letting you off the hook just yet.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_7": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_8": "But if Hsin really is in danger and the Sanctum could fall because of it, then finding Her comes first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_26_9": "Let's go. We need to get out of this mist.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_270_1": "To my wife, Mingxi,\n\nI hope this letter finds you well. Your note and the dried fruit reached me safely, and I am in good health. There is no need to worry about me. Not a single piece was crushed on the way, and I confess I could not bring myself to share any with my colleagues; I ate them all myself. Each one was wonderfully sweet, and I was quite content. I only hope that next time you might spare a few more words for me.\n\nMatters at the Ministry have kept me busy of late, so this reply comes later than it should. Forgive me. I have picked out a hairpin for you, one of the styles now fashionable in the city, in a pattern I know you like. As for the reassignment, it is still under discussion, and my posting has not been decided. I mention it only so that it will not sit on your mind later.\n\nBy the time this reaches you, autumn will likely have set in. Remember to dress warmly in the mornings and evenings. Do not give all your attention to the children. Perhaps you might treat yourself to a few new garments? Counting the days, I may be able to take leave around the time of the Waking Moon Festival. If the leave is granted, I will be home before dusk, and we will go to see the lanterns together.\n\nThere is more in my heart than this page can hold. Take good care of yourself.\n\nYours,\nGuilan",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_271_1": "The lanterns are lit, the feast is laid out... So this is the Waking Moon Festival Mommy always talked about...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_272_1": "Where do you want to go first?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_272_2": "I want to see the fox chasing the moon!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_272_3": "That... is that even a real thing?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_273_1": "A carefully made Moon Lantern. The first lantern She ever received in the Land of Xuanfang, and Her first wish.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_273_2": "A little warmth from mortal hands, and a lost \"heart\" found its light.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_276_1": "The Tacet Discord Outbreak at the Gorges of Spirits grows fiercer every day, and the Threnodian is showing signs of waking... At this rate, even Mengzhou won't come out unscathed.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_276_2": "Word is, Lady Hsin answered Sentinel Jué's call for aid. You can expect a new city any day now...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_276_3": "Are you serious? That's no small matter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_276_4": "You'll see.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_278_1": "...Someone repaired the anomaly in the Heart of Flames?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_278_2": "Thank the Sentinel...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_279_1": "With the Heart of Flames back, I've finally got hold of this corrupted data. Time to take it apart properly...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_279_2": "...Wait. This power came from the same source as Lady Hsin?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_27_1": "You needn't worry about the consequences of the Sanctum's collapse, Arbiter. The Ministry has prepared for it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_27_2": "(I'll take her at her word for now...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_280_1": "Qingxiao lingers at the edge of the crowd, keeping to herself, quietly listening to the storyteller.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_280_2": "\"Who would win, Lady Hsin or Paragon Qingxiao?\" She appears to be giving it serious thought...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_281_1": "Yangyang and Suisui linger at the fireworks stall, choosing carefully, their gazes warm and gentle. Suisui came all this way just to be with her little sister at the Festival.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_281_2": "Years ago, two much smaller girls laughed their way down a street lit just like this one. The years turn, and some things never change.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_282_1": "Jingran is surrounded on all sides by children clamoring for a story.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_282_2": "One tale after another, and still not a single one of them runs away screaming the way he expected. You notice he's moved on to an unpublished chapter of \"Mirage Seeker's Tales\"...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_283_1": "Suoming stays where she is, watching the crowd stream past, her gaze wistful and gentle.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_283_2": "For a moment, it's as if a young girl stands at her shoulder, watching the same peaceful scene.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_284_1": "Ugh, it's completely caved in... What do we do now...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_284_2": "We leave it to the Ministry of Development...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_285_1": "Huh?! It's fixed already?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_286_1": "Huh?! It's fixed already? How is that humanly possible?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_286_2": "Uh... actually, I only just got here...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_286_3": "You'd never guess. Lady Hsin came and repaired it Herself!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_286_4": "A flick of Her hand, and the modular mechanisms went spinning like a kaleidoscope, and everything was back the way it was.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_286_5": "Agh, just a bit earlier and I'd have caught it... I really wanted to see how Lady Hsin did it in person!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2871_1": "The little fox watches you silently, as if it has been waiting for you all along.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2871_2": "(Offer a Moon Fox Rice Cake.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2871_3": "(Pet it gently.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2871_4": "(Leave.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2871_5": "...!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2871_6": "The little fox finishes the rice cake and nuzzles you, content.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2871_7": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2871_8": "The little fox pushes its nose into your palm, then tugs at your sleeve.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_287_1": "The little fox watches you silently, as if it has been waiting for you all along.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_287_10": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_287_11": "Two little foxes curl up quietly together.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_287_2": "(Offer a Moon Fox Rice Cake.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_287_4": "(Curl up with it.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_287_5": "(Leave.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_287_6": "...!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_287_7": "The little fox finishes the rice cake and nuzzles you, content.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_288_1": "Oh...! It's that little fox from before!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_288_2": "Hello again!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_288_3": "Do you know where we are? It's so pretty here!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_288_4": "Hmm, or... is this just a dream?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_288_5": "Either way, I'm so glad to see you again!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_1": "Everyone told me you weren't coming back. I never believed them.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_2": "And here you are... at last.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_3": "...Mm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_4": "How could I not come back? My wife was waiting to see the lanterns with me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_5": "...All these years. I'm sorry you had to bear it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_6": "It was nothing. Nothing at all...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_7": "If you still like those dried fruits... I'll make you more.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_8": "I'd like that.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_289_9": "If this is a dream, let me never wake...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_28_1": "Here all the heart's faces show. Countless forms arise, shifting without end. Lose yourself among the false paths, and the way out shall be lost to you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_28_2": "Did you hear that?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_28_3": "Yeah. It was just a hum, but somehow I caught what it was trying to say.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_28_4": "Keep an eye out as we move forward.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_290_1": "Such a lifelike little thing, for a bird of machinery. It looks just like a Xuanling Bird...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_290_2": "\"Guard the peace of Xuanfang\"... What... what is this...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_290_3": "Could it be... Lady Hsin?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_290_4": "She remembered. She really remembered...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_290_5": "Ah... I'm only here at all because She remembers, aren't I?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_291_1": "(Hm? Yao? What's she doing out here?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_29_1": "What is this...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_29_2": "Is this what it meant by countless forms arising, shifting without end?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2_1": "Say, on this trip to the village, we're not having that same stuff again, are we?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2_2": "...Mengzhou Fish in Vinegar?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2_3": "Eugh, yeah. Besides that, Xuanfang's full of good eats. Brocade Pearl Meatballs, Stir-Fried Trio, Jade Mushroom Soup... Slurrrp! Aww, now my tummy's rumbling again...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2_4": "Abby, your appetite is always right on cue.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_2_5": "Heheh. C'mon, let's go grab a meal!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_301_1": "While resonating with the Nightlight Token, you feel a familiar strand of energy...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_30_1": "Is it trying to keep us from leaving?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_30_2": "If so, then who's controlling this place...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_31_1": "Arbiter, listen.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_31_2": "Mm. Strange noises.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_31_3": "...Something is following us.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_32_1": "We're back where we first started?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_32_2": "We won't find the way out like this. We—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_32_3": "Arbiter, look.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_32_4": "Let's follow it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_33_1": "It's not just guiding us... is it controlling this place?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_34_1": "The way it shifts very much resembles Mengzhou's Automata Mechanics.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_34_2": "If this fox can work these mechanisms, then it might be...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_35_1": "Hm? These look like things from the Waking Moon Festival.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_35_2": "How did they end up here?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_36_1": "Glorious! A whole sky of Waking Moon lanterns!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_36_2": "(That voice...?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_37_1": "So bitterly cold...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_37_2": "And it looks like the Fortress and Gorges battlefield.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_38_1": "Behind us stands Xuanfang Hold! No retreat! We fight!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_39_1": "It's shifted again.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_39_2": "\"Here all the heart's faces show...\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_1": "Come one, come all! You won't regret—Oh! {PlayerName}, is that you?! Welcome, welcome!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_2": "Our farmhouse restaurant is finally open for business! Here to sample the new menu?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_3": "Your spam ad blew up my Terminal...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_4": "I'm here for that Waking Moon Feast even the Golden-Eyed One swears by.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_5": "Wha—? Ah, well... haha, sorry about that! Today's meal is on us, so try anything you like!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_6": "Ha, you're a funny one! Ahaha...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_7": "My honest apologies! We just thought it sounded catchier that way. Your meal today's on us, so try anything you like!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_8": "What would you recommend?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_3_9": "That'd be our new Moon Fox Rice Cakes, no question. They're Lady Hsin's favorite treat!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_40_1": "That flute... it was Her favorite.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_41_1": "Hm? I'm picking up an unusual frequency up ahead.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_41_2": "Dangerous?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_41_3": "Hard to say.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_42_1": "It's stopped. So this is the source of the unusual frequency?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_42_2": "That's right. And the Prism of Fate seems to be reacting, too...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4301_1": "(That silhouette on the horizon...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4301_2": "(The mist is obscuring it, but it looks like... Hsin the Moon Fox?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4302_1": "Is that...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_1": "So this is the <b>Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou</b> today. I wouldn't have guessed...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_10": "It's like the Xuanyuan Domain... Hsin once told me that was only a small part of the <te href=800053>Civilization Capsule</te>...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_11": "What if... this place is connected to the Capsule as well?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_12": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_13": "I'm guessing by your reaction I'm right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_14": "...The evidence is thin. I won't commit to an answer yet.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_15": "You emerge from the mist into a serene landscape of Xuanfang mountains and waterways. It is not what Suoming expected, and her face betrays her surprise. She tells you this is the <b>Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou</b>—the framework that underpins Xuanfang Hold's fundamental order. You wonder if it might be connected to the <b>Civilization Capsule</b>.\n\nIn the distance, among the peaks, a massive silhouette catches your eye.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_2": "The Simulacrum Nexus of Mengzhou?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_3": "You've been here before?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_4": "As with the Xuanyuan Domain you visited before, it's one of the Manifold Dimensions Hsin commands.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_5": "You seem to know my comings and goings very well.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_6": "The Ministry keeps a record of anything concerning the Sentinel's Sanctum, Arbiter.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_7": "I merely read of it in our Grand Library.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_8": "Supposedly, this place governs the base order of every mechanism in the Hold. It calculates the Manifold Forms, and you'd expect efficiency to come first, not extravagance.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_43_9": "But such intricate, lifelike scenery... is not what I anticipated. Still, for Hsin the Moon Fox, such style is no surprise.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_1": "...Sector <ano=Yang Fire and Yang Wood>Bing-Yin</ano> has three corrupted registers. Tracing from the old framework... There. All sorted.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_10": "I'm Mingxiao, a Court of Savantae Artisan here in the Simulacrum Nexus. I handle maintenance and repairs in this area. Ah... outside, I suppose you'd call us Celestials?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_11": "What's happened here?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_12": "Well... lately, structures have been collapsing for unknown reasons. It's started to disrupt the Hold's operations. We're fixing them as fast as we can.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_13": "Unknown reasons?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_14": "Yes. Ever since Lady Hsin decided to...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_15": "My apologies... the restrictions forbid me from answering. But please, rest assured, it's safe here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_16": "Where is Hsin now?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_17": "Lady Hsin... isn't able to see guests now. You may wait at Mengxuan Vale for the time being.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_18": "...Follow me, please.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_2": "And that disturbance earlier... resolved too. Phew, that was close...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_3": "(A phantom? No... the way she's dressed...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_4": "(Could she be one of the <te href=852016>Celestials</te>, like Ruoyun?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_5": "Wha-! Wh-who are you? How did you get in here?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_6": "We've come to see Hsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_7": "You're... the <b>Arbiter</b>?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_8": "...So you're Lady Hsin's guest. Pardon my manners.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_44_9": "And you are...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_45_1": "...Hmm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_45_2": "Got something on your mind?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_45_3": "Our Grand Library records that Sentinel Hsin and the Court of Savantae agreed that once the Hold was complete, the Artisans would surrender their lives and become conscious frequencies woven into the mechanisms. Part of the Sanctum's computational power.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_45_4": "That meant losing their bodies, sense of self—everything that makes a person human.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_45_5": "And yet they... seem no different from anyone else. Not exactly what I expected.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_1": "Um... W-welcome to <b>Mengxuan Vale</b>.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_10": "She's the Sentinel. Her every move could affect Xuanfang Hold's safety.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_11": "That's... I understand your worry. It's just, Lady Hsin's power of <b>Fractal Proliferation</b> lets her exist across the entire Sanctum to guide the Hold's operations. And lately, with all the repairs, She's busier than ever...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_12": "Even we... have not seen Lady Hsin's true form in a long time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_13": "Over there on the horizon. What is it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_14": "...That is the <te href=852015>Nexus Fox Shadow</te>, one of the Sentinel's manifestations. It resides outside the Simulacrum Nexus, occasionally acting on the Sentinel's behalf to... oversee matters.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_15": "Do you know why we're here?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_16": "To see Lady Hsin, surely?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_17": "Of all the Sentinels in Huanglong, none are more \"willful\" than Hsin the Moon Fox. But She is not one to treat a covenant lightly.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_18": "Xuanfang Hold is complete. The Ministry of Sentinel Affairs should have reclaimed the Civilization Capsule long ago. Hsin delayed. Again and again. Now the final term is past.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_19": "As an Intendant in the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs, I have come to take it back. Will She yet hide from me?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_2": "This used to be a place for the Celestials to rest. But with the Simulacrum Nexus's data anomalies increasing, Lady Hsin set up repair workshops all over. This is one of them.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_20": "Hsin?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_21": "(No, that gesture... is it a \"threat\"?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_22": "So this is what you've all been refusing to name.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_23": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_24": "That response is answer enough. What you cannot say, I will learn for myself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_25": "Forgive me... nothing in the Sanctum escapes Lady Hsin. She must already know you've come.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_26": "But we can't say for certain when you'll be able to see Her. While you wait for Her response, do explore as you like.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_27": "I still have repairs to attend to. I'll take my leave.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_28": "Thanks for your explanation.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_29": "I see.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_3": "We so rarely have guests... do excuse us if we fall short. Whatever you'd like to know, Arbiter, I'll do my best to answer.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_30": "(Haa...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_31": "(What's wrong?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_32": "(Got jolted awake by some huge frequency wave! It was kinda like... that Prism of Fate, but with all these extra nasty, funky smells. Ugh...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_33": "(Is it coming from that <b>Fox Shadow</b> on the horizon?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_34": "(Uh-huh! Whatever's there has been giving me the willies since we got here. Like something's spying on me... Creepy. So I'm staying inside. If things get hairy, just holler!)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_35": "(Okay. Got it.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_36": "(It seems like the Celestials here are bound by restrictions, just like Ruoyun was.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_37": "(Now that I'm inside the Sanctum, I should take a look around.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_38": "Inside <b>Mengxuan Vale</b>, Mingxiao explains that this area once served as a resting place for the Celestials, but it's now home to repair workshops for Celestials to fix anomalies. Hsin left instructions here long ago, and they have been waiting for the Arbiter ever since. Hsin, however, has been so consumed with keeping Xuanfang Hold running that she has not appeared before them in a long time.\n \nYou learn that the great shadow on the horizon is called the <b>Nexus Fox Shadow</b>, a manifestation Hsin uses to oversee matters in her stead. But the Celestials refuse to say more about it. Suoming cuts to the point: she has come to reclaim the <b>Civilization Capsule</b> Hsin used to raise the Hold. No sooner are the words out than the shadow stirs, lifting a single finger to its lips. It is not an answer. It is a warning.\n\nSensing that Mingxiao is bound by Celestial restrictions and cannot speak freely, you decide to investigate on your own first.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_4": "You knew I'd come?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_5": "Lady Hsin's Prism of Fate isn't something just anyone can carry. Once, she told us that if a black-haired, golden-eyed person ever came bearing it, we should answer {Male=his;Female=her} questions as fully as possible.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_6": "...And you match that description exactly.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_7": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_8": "I need to know where Hsin is now, as well as Her condition.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_46_9": "At this point... I'm not here to assign blame, but I'm done waiting for the moment to be \"right.\" If Hsin the Moon Fox is caught in something, I'll find Her myself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_1": "Hm? And you are...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_10": "It's alright. We're used to it. I thought becoming a Celestial would turn me into a heartless program, but Lady Hsin told us this place runs on \"emotion\" as its support, so She's been splitting off computational power just to keep our sense of self intact.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_11": "To ease the strain on our minds, we have no sense of time passing. I don't know how long it's been. The horror of the Fortress and Gorges War still feels like yesterday...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_12": "Thank you for telling me how Xuanfang is doing.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_13": "Well, I've rested enough. Time to get back to my modular parts and my duties.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_14": "...Oh, and, Arbiter, the Lady Hsin of today is already... Ngh.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_15": "Are you all right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_16": "Never mind... Sorry. It is a rare chance to be here. Please, take your time exploring.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_17": "(That reaction... is he afraid of the Fox Shadow?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_18": "The Celestials in the Sanctum do not perceive the passage of time, a mercy that spares their minds the burden of the years. But becoming a Celestial did not strip them of their humanity. They still carry the full range of human emotion and seem no different from the living. One of them tells you this was Hsin's doing. She once told them that the Sanctum runs on \"emotion\" as its support. All this time, she has been diverting her own computational power to preserve their sense of self, and it seems she has been bearing other pressures alongside it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_2": "Oh! You must be that Arbiter Lady Hsin told us about! I never imagined someone from the outside world could make it in here...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_3": "How are things in the Hold these days? Is the Land of Xuanfang still safe?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_4": "(Briefly explain how things stand.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_5": "So much has happened...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_6": "None of you knew what was going on out there?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_7": "No. Beyond the information needed to keep the Hold running, we Celestials barely interact across sectors, let alone with the world beyond the Sanctum.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_8": "Lady Hsin calls it \"modular management,\" I think. She doesn't seem to like it much... but it is a restriction set from the Hold's founding. We've all come to accept it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_47_9": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_48_1": "Back when the Sentinel's computational power was still strong, She would often conjure Fractal Forms to come and amuse us in our workshops. \"To keep us from getting bored,\" She said.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_48_2": "And She would tell all sorts of stories and gossip from Xuanfang. She never could resist a good joke. Some had us laughing for days... Others, ahem, had us spinning for days.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_48_3": "Not what you would expect from a Sentinel, is it? But that's exactly why, through all this, we haven't lost ourselves.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_48_4": "A Celestial's frequency... does wear down over time. And yet, not one of us has ever been lost. Not one.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_49_1": "Oh, what am I supposed to do now...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_49_2": "You look troubled.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_49_3": "It's these anomalies, what else... Oh, sorry, I thought you were... Wait. You're the Arbiter, aren't you?! I'm Leyue, I'm in charge of Autopuppet repairs here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_49_4": "...Does everyone here know who I am?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_49_5": "Of course! The Sentinel told us to keep nothing from you. Let me guess, you want to know about the anomalies?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_49_6": "That's right.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_49_7": "Let me just take you to see it. It's... a bit complicated.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_1": "So you're really set on moving to Mengzhou?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_10": "(I remember their reach extends all across Huanglong... If they're showing up now, it must involve Hsin in some way.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_11": "(Oh... ran straight into {Male=him;Female=her} the second I stepped out.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_12": "(Given my position, I really ought to speak with {Male=him;Female=her}, but—)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_13": "(Better see Intendant Suoming first. Safer to let her decide how to approach the Arbiter.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_14": "At a tea stall, you overhear patrons trading hushed rumors that Xuanfang Hold is on the verge of collapse. They note that the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs has sent people into the Land of Xuanfang, surely a sign that something big is brewing. You suspect they must be here for Hsin the Moon Fox.\n \nUnnoticed behind you, Tangning of the Ministry passes by, heading to report to Intendant Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_2": "Of course! Once the Censure Courts clear out the last of the Tacet Discords, Xuanfang Hold will have served its purpose and collapse. We've known that since day one, haven't we?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_3": "It can't just crumble overnight, though. The Ministry of War would give notice first, wouldn't they?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_4": "Oh, please... Think about all the strange things that've been happening. Sit around waiting for an official notice, and you'll be caught with your trousers down.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_5": "And with the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs sending people now... something big's brewing. You can count on it...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_6": "Anyway, better to be ahead of the curve than buried under it. When things go sideways, who knows what else might happen...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_7": "That's... kind of jumping at shadows, isn't it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_8": "Ugh, you never see past your own nose. Forget it. Eat up, eat up.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_4_9": "(Xuanfang Hold collapsing... at a time like this? And the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_50_1": "What's happened to these Celestials?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_50_2": "The anomalies have affected their consciousness. They're riddled with errors now... There's nothing we can do.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_1": "...This is the place.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_10": "Th-this is Lady Hsin's power! Then maybe... Arbiter, come with me. Quickly!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_11": "Leyue leads you to one of the anomalies and explains that it appears to originate from the highest clearance level. There is nothing the Celestials can do but wait for Hsin to repair it Herself. And anomalies like this are far more numerous within the <b>Heart Realms</b>, where Xuanfang's history, culture, projected futures, and the Sentinel's own memories are all stored, all of it answerable only to Hsin the Moon Fox.\n \nIt is then that you discover the Prism of Fate can restore any Celestial affected by the anomalies.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_2": "Anomalies like this were rare in the early days, but the few that cropped up, Lady Hsin would fix quickly.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_3": "Why does this happen?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_4": "Lady Hsin said it's redundant data from repairing modular parts. But the root source... we've never been able to trace it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_5": "It seems to originate from the highest level of clearance. We cannot intervene. We can only wait for Lady Hsin to fix it Herself. And there are even more anomalies like this in the <te href=852012>Heart Realms</te>.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_6": "Heart Realms?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_7": "They make up the innermost region of the Simulacrum Nexus, storing not only Xuanfang's history and culture, but also the Sentinel's own memories. Projections of Xuanfang's fate, its web of possibilities... Everything is held in Lady Hsin's keeping.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_8": "We Celestials don't have the authority to enter the Heart Realms, so we can't fix the anomalies there. Right now, three Heart Realms are still in chaos.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_51_9": "There's no way for us to share Her burden. All we can do is... Hold on. That frequency, it's...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_52_2": "Arbiter, you bear the Prism of Fate. You should be able to make them stop!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_53_1": "The anomaly still hasn't been dealt with yet... I can't just walk away.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_1": "Incredible! You actually resolved the anomaly here!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_10": "This is a <b>Realm Key</b>. With it, you can pass through an <te href=852010>Inner Threshold</te> into a Heart Realm. We can't activate the keys ourselves... but you can, with the Prism of Fate.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_11": "Please, follow me!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_12": "Seeing that the Prism of Fate can also calm rampaging Autopuppets, Leyue grows hopeful and pleads with you to \"save Lady Hsin.\" You ask what Hsin is currently entangled in, but Leyue still cannot say. Instead, she hands you a <b>Realm Key</b> and tells you it will grant passage through an <b>Inner Threshold</b> into a Heart Realm, the most direct way to see Hsin.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_2": "Who knew the Prism of Fate was good for this...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_3": "I've seen Lady Hsin use a Prism of Fate when She fixed the Sanctum. She said it was Her \"backup plan.\" Now that it's in your hands, that means...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_4": "I see it now, Arbiter! Maybe... maybe you're the only one who can save Hsin now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_5": "The Heart Realms shift with the Sentinel's heart. Countless changes, yet each follows a set rule. If you can find the anomaly, the Realms will return to balance...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_6": "Save? What exactly is Hsin the Moon Fox caught up in?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_7": "...I'm sorry. This is as much as I can share.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_8": "But if you want to \"see\" Lady Hsin, this is the quickest way.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_54_9": "...Got it. Finding Hsin the Moon Fox is why I came here in the first place. Tell me what to do.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_55_1": "Arbiter, this is an <b>Inner Threshold</b>.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_55_2": "As long as you hold the right key, it will take you deep into a Heart Realm.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_1": "Suoming, what is it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_10": "Why are you giving me this?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_11": "Trust it or don't, the choice is yours. I only mean to guard you against the worst.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_12": "Tracking the anomalies in the Heart Realms is the obvious first step. But now I have a theory...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_13": "...That must be tested.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_14": "Before you go, Suoming tells you what she thinks. The Nexus Fox Shadow may not be acting on Hsin's own will at all. She gives you a Providence Lock, saying it will react if Hsin the Moon Fox seeks to do anything against you. Then she adds that she has a theory of her own to test.\n \nThe moment she takes out her Vermillion Lock, Mengxuan Vale begins to shake.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_2": "I'd say... after what I've gathered, the situation has become clear.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_3": "Splitting Her computational power to maintain the Celestial's minds. Remolding the Simulacrum Nexus into lush landscapes...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_4": "All of it fits what I know of Hsin the Moon Fox... She is soft on matters of the \"human heart.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_5": "And that's precisely why the Fox Shadow's behavior is so strange.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_6": "...You suspect it's not acting on Hsin's will?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_7": "Indeed. If that great shadow is the anomaly itself, then what has become of Hsin, who ought to be in control of this place?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_8": "And this is...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_56_9": "A Providence Lock. Should Hsin the Moon Fox seek to do anything against you, it will react.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_57_1": "...Go find Her.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_58_1": "(So this is the \"Heart Realm\" the Celestials talked about, deep in the Sanctum...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_58_2": "(Suoming didn't seem like she'd lost control. She let herself be taken on purpose.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_58_3": "(My Terminal... Signal's down, just as I thought. At least she and I agree on the priority. Finding the real Hsin the Moon Fox.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_59_1": "...Is that the same fox from earlier?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_5_1": "(Last time I saw Intendant Suoming, I was still a fresh recruit.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_5_2": "(Ten years, gone in a blink...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_1": "Ooh, its frequency... it smells similar to the one in the Prism of Fate!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_10": "...Is it leading me through there?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_11": "...Abby?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_12": "You... wha... how'd you turn into that?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_13": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_14": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_15": "...What the heck is going on here?!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_16": "The Celestial said the Sanctum shifts with Hsin the Moon Fox's heart, but that every change follows a rule. Could this... be one of those rules at work?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_17": "What kind of rule swaps people and foxes around...? So you think She's behind this?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_18": "If some restrictions kept me from acting freely, I'd find another way to get my message across, too.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_19": "I sensed nothing hostile from that fox. Maybe... I can only move through this Heart Realm in this form?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_2": "Are you... \"Hsin's\" messenger?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_20": "A thousand lanterns line up like clouds in motion, their songs and steps wake the sleeping stars.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_21": "If mortal smiles might yet be born of this, what harm to walk by moon and lantern light?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_22": "...Light the lanterns, gather the guests... Invite the Moon... All beings... rejoice...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_23": "...Was that Hsin?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_24": "\"Light the lanterns, gather the guests\"... Every lantern here is unlit.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_25": "Better keep moving for now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_26": "The little fox lets you pet it without protest. Abby notes that its frequency closely resembles the one in the Prism of Fate, though not quite the same as the Hsin frequency within Suoming's Vermillion Lock. Then, without warning, the fox snatches the Prism of Fate from your hands and darts toward a nearby door.\n \nYou chase it through, only to find that you and the fox have swapped bodies. Hsin's voice drifts from nowhere: \"Light the lanterns, gather the guests. Invite the Moon.\" You need the Prism back, so you listen to the voice and step forward.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_3": "Why doesn't the Moon Fox just come to you Herself? I mean, She created this whole place. What could possibly trap Her?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_4": "I'm afraid it's not that simple.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_5": "Ugh, why's it always such a mess... Oh! Come to think of it, that thing the umbrella girl was holding had Hsin's frequency in it, too. Only kinda different...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_6": "Different how...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_7": "Umm, like... plain rice versus egg fried rice? Both rice, sure, but the girl's had a lot more flavor... Hey! Hey! Are you ever gonna stop petting that fox?!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_8": "...!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_60_9": "What, now it's taking our stuff—!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_61_1": "You feeling okay in there?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_61_2": "I'm fine. Just... can't really swing a sword like this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_61_3": "Hehe, relax. I've got your back!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_62_1": "That frequency just now, it smells just like that big shadow outside!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_62_2": "Maybe the anomaly here is connected to whatever's restricting Hsin's authority.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_63_1": "Mmh... feels like something's watching us. Got this gross, squeezy feeling that won't go away.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_63_2": "Yeah. I've felt it too, ever since I took this form.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_63_3": "Unease, dread, and a suffocating sense of confinement hang over the heart like a shadow.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_64_1": "It went that way.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_65_1": "It returned the Prism of Fate... It was only showing me the way all along.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_65_2": "Hsin... what is it you truly want me to do?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_66_1": "Have you lost your mind? Out here lighting lanterns alone, at a time like this!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_66_2": "You know full well lantern light draws the Formrenders. Last time, you almost got...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_66_3": "I've been watching. They've gone quiet for now. Let me give it another go.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_66_4": "Wh-what's that?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_66_5": "Forget the lantern. Run!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_67_1": "(\"Light the lanterns, gather the guests\"... Am I supposed to light these?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_67_2": "(I'll pick up that Moon Lantern first.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_68_1": "Was that the Prism of Fate resonating?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_68_2": "Hehe, this gizmo Hsin gave you is pretty handy, huh!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_6901_1": "...Those who have seen it call it the Formrender. Blue of face, long of fang, it wears the shape of an Autopuppet, yet the air about it is foul. Its voice grates like a rusted blade scraping bone, and a red light sits in its eyes. It keeps to dark places, and loathes above all the joys of mortal men. At the sight of them it wakes to wrath, and in its wrath it devours that light.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_6902_1": "A note scrawled in a hurry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_6902_2": "\"...Tried to light a lantern. A Formrender was on me within seconds. Chased me to the end of the alley—I only escaped by luck. The new lantern shattered too... One Moon Lantern isn't enough. They have to go up together, many at once.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_6902_3": "\"Beware the paintings. If you see a Formrender, run. Don't stop.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_69_1": "...It has been ██ days since the Formrenders first appeared, and at last we have found a way to relight the Moon Lanterns.\n\nThose faint glimmers scattered through the alleys—Luobin calls them <color=Highlight>Nightlight Tokens</color>—carry some very peculiar frequency. <color=Highlight>Burn them in the Moon Lanterns, and the darkness gives way.</color> They suppress the Formrenders too: the brighter the flame, the heavier their limbs, the slower their approach. But each lantern lit also draws their attention, so we must move with care.\n\nWhere the glimmers come from, none of us knows. Faint as they are, one always rekindles somewhere just as the oil runs dry and the wick burns out. Whatever the truth of it, so long as we have the Nightlight Tokens, there is still hope. Jianwei believes it is a blessing bestowed by the Sentinel... But if it truly is a blessing, why has She never shown Herself?\n\n...Last night I heard the wind sweep down the corridor, and in my terror I snatched up a weapon and rushed outside, only to frighten my neighbors half to death. Then I remembered the Fortress and Gorges War ended long ago. My memory really has been failing me of late. Best to write it all down.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_6_1": "Tangning? Well, look at you. All dressed up.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_1": "Three more gone just like that. Now Nightlight Tokens are running low. This year's Waking Moon Festival... I doubt we can hold it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_10": "Haah, thought we'd finally catch a break after the Fortress and Gorges War.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_11": "Hm... how long ago was that again? Funny, I can't seem to remember...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_12": "From the residents, you gather that this Heart Realm reflects Xuanfang Hold in the years after the Fortress and Gorges War. The people here have given up on holding the Waking Moon Festival. Monsters called Formrenders prowl the streets, extinguishing every lit lantern and attacking anyone who dares try.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_2": "Ugh. All I want is to light one lantern. Say a prayer for peace. When did that get so hard?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_3": "And these <b>Formrenders</b>, heaven knows where those monsters came from. Not Autopuppets, not Tacet Discords... Just show up and snuff out any lantern they see, like they're possessed.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_4": "One nearly got that boy Luobin last time...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_5": "What else can we do? We've tried everything. These things won't leave. All of us are on edge.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_6": "Say... if we can't hold the festival, do you think Lady Hsin will still come?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_7": "...Has She given up on us?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_8": "Don't say such things. Why else would the Sentinel have built the Hold?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_70_9": "Let's lay low for now. Wait it out.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_71_1": "Weird. What kind of monster exists just to snuff out lanterns?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_71_2": "The Waking Moon Festival is an age-old tradition in the Land of Xuanfang, but here they're saying it can't be held this year.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_71_3": "What if the way to reach Hsin in this Heart Realm is to make the festival happen first?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_71_4": "Let's try lighting up those lanterns.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_72_1": "...!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_72_2": "Whoa, whoa! That thing just crawled right out of the painting... and now it's coming for us!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_72_3": "I've never seen a monster like this in Xuanfang. If it's only found in this Heart Realm, it's very likely part of the \"anomaly.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_72_4": "Let's shake it off for now!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_73_1": "Phew, too close. You all right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_73_2": "...I'm fine. But running in this form does take some getting used to.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_73_3": "What gives anyway? Why's that thing stopping people from lighting lanterns?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_73_4": "It's made this whole place all creepy and wrong... It's nothing like the real Xuanfang!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_73_5": "Putting out lanterns is just the surface. Its true goal is making sure the Waking Moon Festival doesn't happen.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_74_1": "<color=XinyuehuSub>They say that when the Moon Lanterns are lit at the festival, the Sentinel, who so cherishes the mortal world, will slip quietly into the crowd from some corner to walk among the people.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_74_2": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I... feel the things you cherished. I never knew that hearing people laugh could make me feel so at peace.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_74_3": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I wish to see the festival lights shine over the Land of Xuanfang once more.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_74_4": "<color=XinyuehuSub>Only... if they saw me as I am now, I fear they'd be disappointed.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_74_5": "(Is that Hsin's voice?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_1": "The lantern keeper tells me the Lantern Pavilion still won't open?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_10": "(Worth a try.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_11": "Overhearing a conversation between two locals, you learn that the \"Lantern Pavilion,\" which controls every Moon Lantern here, will only open to Hsin the Moon Fox's authority. You decide to try using the Prism of Fate.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_2": "Right. Without Lady Hsin's highest clearance, none of us can get in. Can't use the Nightlight Terrace either, so it's manual lighting or nothing.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_3": "Hmph. Is it not true that the more lanterns are lit, the slower the Formrender moves? Light them all at once, and it won't touch us.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_4": "That's the idea. But every lantern we light, it snuffs out. Nightlight Tokens are scarce, too. We can't keep up...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_5": "If only Lady Hsin were here. She would light up the whole street with one sweep of Her hand. Bright as noon, not a shadow left.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_6": "What I wouldn't give to see that again...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_7": "Don't give up yet. We'll think of something.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_8": "(By the sound of it, this \"Lantern Pavilion\" controls all the Moon Lanterns here.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_75_9": "(Hey, you've got Hsin's authority, right? Can't you just pop the door open?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_76_1": "This little fox, could it be... No, that can't be right...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_77_1": "...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_77_2": "Hm? What a special little fox...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_77_3": "I want to pet it so badly.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_78_1": "So that's why the Formrenders have been going crazy. That big shadow's getting fishier by the second.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_78_2": "Mm. Looks like the anomaly in the Heart Realms has something to do with this Fox Shadow.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_78_3": "The people want the festival. The Fox Shadow wants it gone... It's like two forces pushing against each other.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_791_1": "Whoa, it worked!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_79_1": "This is the spot, right?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_79_2": "Let me try using the authority in the Prism of Fate.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_1": "Tangning? Well, look at you. All dressed up.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_10": "I had no idea I was that good. And are you telling me to pick a fight with her...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_11": "Haha. Tell you what, I just made some Moon Fox Rice Cakes. Bring them along as a gift for your scary boss.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_12": "Oh... thank you.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_2": "Dressed up? Feels like a plain old work uniform to me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_3": "You? Work? I only ever see you loafing about the Hold, teasing birds, sipping tea, gabbing with anyone who listen.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_4": "Ouch. You make me sound useless... even if you're not wrong. Anyway, I'm off. Gotta go see the boss.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_5": "To be honest, I'm a little nervous. Heard she once ousted the local officials back home and took over herself...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_6": "Is this job of yours above board? Sounds like you work for a tyrant.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_7": "I just worry we won't see eye to eye. That what matters to me... might mean nothing to her.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_8": "What's with the doom and gloom? You'll be fine, I know it.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_7_9": "Remember that rogue Autopuppet that smashed into my house? You took it down with a yawn while fixing your hair.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_80_1": "...The authority that was split off... is hidden in the lantern's components. Bring them together at the Nightlight Terrace... and the town's Moon Lanterns can be rekindled. Control of this Heart Realm... reclaimed...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_80_2": "The corruption here runs too deep, and \"it\" has too many eyes. All I can do is... leave it to you...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_81_1": "The Sanctum's Terminal, \"Nightlight Terrace,\" has been activated.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_81_2": "Sentinel authority confirmed. Restoring Heart Realm standard processes. Command conflict detected. Beginning override of the \"extinguish lantern\" directive...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_81_3": "Failure. The \"Moon Lantern\" key is missing three critical parts.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_81_4": "...?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_81_5": "Check out the shape of this Moon Lantern projection. It's not the same as the one you've got, is it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_81_6": "Maybe we need to make ours look like that one?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_81_7": "Yeah, that makes sense.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_82_1": "\"It once said... Xuanfang Hold's foundation was not built on bronze and jade. It was built on every lantern that goes dark and is lit again.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_83_1": "\"I remember... every laugh and every tear, every reunion and every parting... written out as wishes on lantern paper, and carried down the water to me.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_84_1": "\"When the wind swept the long street, a thousand lantern tassels danced. Wave after gentle wave, gathering me into that sea of light and life.\"",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_85_1": "There... that should do it. Let's light the lanterns.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_1": "Everyone, look... the Moon Lanterns have been lit!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_10": "<color=XinyuehuSub>And yet... even this small thing, I can barely manage.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_11": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I know the hopes they carry in their hearts when they hold the festival. I want to give each of them what they wish for.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_12": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I want them to live better, happier lives.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_13": "One by one, the Moon Lanterns flicker to life along the streets. People rush out, spreading the news that the Waking Moon Festival can be held with joyous excitement. Amid the cheering and warm glow of the lanterns, Hsin's phantom appears, watching it all with a smile touched by loneliness.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_2": "This is wonderful!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_3": "Has Lady Hsin come back to us?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_4": "It must be the Sentinel's guiding hand!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_5": "She hasn't given up on us...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_6": "The Formrenders aren't moving anymore!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_7": "Hurry! Let's get ready for the Waking Moon Festival!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_8": "Come on, it's time to celebrate!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_86_9": "<color=XinyuehuSub>I am the Sentinel. Guidance is my charge. I ought to meet their hopes, guard the homes they hold dear.</color>",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_87_1": "With the lanterns burning, things are getting pretty lively around here!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_87_2": "Storehouses full, the year with plenty to spare. A thousand homes' laughter round one shared hearth.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_87_3": "After lighting the lanterns... comes \"inviting the Moon\"?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_87_4": "I know this one! It's gotta mean prepping the Waking Moon Feast. Yeah, chow time!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_87_5": "Mm. Let's see what we need to do this time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_88_1": "(The Moon Lantern's light has grown warmer.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_89_1": "How can we tempt the Sentinel to come be our guest...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_8_1": "(I heard Intendant Suoming dislikes anything bitter-tasting. These rice cakes might just be...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_90_1": "To \"invite the Moon,\" you set an extra bowl and chopsticks during the feast. That's how you welcome the Sentinel to your table.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_90_2": "Just a bowl and chopsticks?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_90_3": "Of course not. Lady Hsin loves lively gatherings and delicacies from all over Huanglong. The grander the feast, the happier She'll be. And don't forget to serve Her favorite snacks and light the Moon Lanterns...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_90_4": "Okay! I'll remember!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_90_5": "But it's just me and Grandma now. Do you think the Sentinel would find it too quiet?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_90_6": "She wouldn't, Jiu. Who knows? Maybe the snacks you make will happen to be Her exact favorites.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_90_7": "Now, off you go. Your Grandma will worry if you're not home soon.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_91_1": "Alright, I have to make this year's Waking Moon Feast perfect before Grandma gets back!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_91_2": "...Will Mommy and Daddy come home to visit me this time?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_91_3": "Mengzhou Fish in Vinegar, Stir-Fried Trio, Tanghulu, and Moon Fox Rice Cakes.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_91_4": "So hungry... No, no sneaking bites. I have to wait and share with everyone.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_92_1": "Geez.. Her tummy is literally rumbling...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_92_2": "That's it, I'm not letting a kid starve on my watch! Come on, let's get her something to eat!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_92_3": "Snff, snff... Aha! I smell pastries! Over there!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_1": "Whoa... I-is that a little fox?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_10": "(Stay silent.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_11": "(Shake your head.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_12": "Mm... I see. Grandma says our Sentinel is so majestic and beautiful, with a huge, lovely tail! But I've never seen Her myself.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_13": "But one time I did meet a little fox like you! It was right before the Fortress and Gorges War, back when Mommy and Daddy were still here.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_14": "I was home alone and found a skinny fox by the window, stealing sips of Mommy's Waking Moon Brew!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_15": "It had the prettiest gold and red eyes. So pretty I just... spaced out. When I finally snapped out of it, the brew was all gone, and so was the fox...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_16": "I thought Mommy would scold me, but she just smiled and patted my head. She said it was Lady Hsin's envoy—a sign of good luck!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_17": "The next day, we found a jar of flower wine, a sack of grain, and a beautiful golden flower at the door.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_18": "But... I never saw that little fox again.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_19": "I remember it was even smaller than you. I wonder if it's grown up big and strong now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_2": "Oh? Are you hungry? Here, you can have this rice cake.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_21": "Thank you for sharing your snack and listening to me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_22": "(This warmth...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_23": "(Is this... how Hsin felt back then?)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_24": "Alright! I need to get ready for the Waking Moon Feast. Why don't you stay and celebrate with us, little fox?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_25": "If we make this the liveliest feast ever, maybe the Sentinel really will show up!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_26": "You carry a rice cake to Jiu in your teeth. Taking you for a stray fox begging for food, she shares it with you and tells you of a strange encounter from years past. Once, a scrawny little fox stole sips of her family's Waking Moon Brew and later left gifts in return. She cannot wait for this year's festival. If the feast is lively enough, she dreams that the Sentinel might join them in celebration.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_3": "(Shake your head.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_4": "Huh? Do you... want me to eat it?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_5": "(Nod.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_6": "But...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_7": "(Spin in a circle.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_8": "I don't understand what you're trying to say. How about we share? Here, half for you, half for me?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_93_9": "Where did you come from? Are you... the Sentinel's envoy?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_94_1": "Hmm, which one should I choose?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_94_2": "Little fox, do you know what the Sentinel's favorite pastry is?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_94_3": "(I think it should be...)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_94_4": "(Moon Fox Rice Cake.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_94_5": "(Honeysuckle Cake.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_94_6": "\"This one!\" You point your paw at the rice cake.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_94_7": "...This one? Maybe the Moon Fox isn't partial to a single pastry.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_94_8": "Okay!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_95_1": "I heard those big monsters who snuff out lanterns have finally been driven off! Does that mean we can light up as many Moon Lanterns as we want?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_95_2": "Grandma and I made so many just for this day!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_95_3": "I wrote a lot of wishes on them. I really hope Daddy gets to see them.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_95_4": "Ugh. That lantern... I can't reach it...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_96_1": "Wow! You're a fantastic little fox, aren't you!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_97_1": "Oh, that's our family photo.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_97_2": "This is Daddy. He's a Xuanfang Warden guarding the borders. He was a hero in the Fortress and Gorges War.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_97_3": "Mommy here is an incredible Artisan! But she's always, always busy. I haven't seen her for a long time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_97_4": "...Do you think Mommy ever misses home?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_98_1": "Oh my, this is—",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_98_2": "Grandma! Over here! I made all this with a new friend! And look, we lit up all the Moon Lanterns too...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_98_3": "Can you rest easy now?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_98_4": "...Yes. Thank you for bringing me here, Lady Sentinel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_98_5": "I thought death had separated us forever. I never thought I'd get to see her grown up like this.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_98_6": "Shh... No need to thank me. This broke the rules, so keep it our little secret.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_98_7": "Thanks to you and Jiu, the feast is finally ready. Neighbors and relatives arrive one after another, filling the quiet house with warmth and laughter. In the midst of it all, only you notice Hsin appear, quietly bringing Jiu's mother, now a Celestial, to reunite with the family she has missed. Death parted them long ago, yet the <ano=Hsin>hearts</ano> held the thread between them all this time.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_99_1": "Gathering a thousand mortal wishes, turning into moonlight... to illuminate the dawn.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_99_2": "(The melody sounds cheerful this time.)",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_1": "Tangning...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_10": "No thanks. Whenever I'm stuck, big brother Tangning always comes to help me.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_11": "You've helped me so, so many times already!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_12": "Aww. You're too sweet, Yao. Now I feel like giving you all the rice cakes...",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_13": "But you're right! If you or anyone else might be in danger, I can't afford to freeze up. Not even in front of Intendant Suoming.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_14": "Mm... I don't really understand. But please don't get hurt, Tangning.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_15": "Don't worry about me. Now hurry back inside and rest. It's chilly out here. Don't catch a chill.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_2": "Up and about already, Yao?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_3": "Mm. I'm much better now.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_4": "Aw! You've been working hard, haven't you? For that, half these rice cakes are yours!",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_5": "Go easy on them, though. You just got better.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_6": "Thanks... Tangning, what's that thing on your waist?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_7": "This? It's called the <te href=852011>Providence Lock</te>. A gift from the Sentinel.",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_8": "From the Sentinel? Really?",
-+  "Main_Mengzhou_3_7_9_9": "Mm-hm. When I'm in trouble, it opens and helps me. Want it?",
-+  "ZXHSMST_1_1": "Yes... The likeness was uncanny. That's why I couldn't bring myself to do it.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_1": "Yes... The likeness was uncanny. That's why I couldn't bring myself to do it.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_10": "That must have been painful for you.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_11": "It's been a hundred years, Suoming, and what you feel for them is still strong. Does it hurt?",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_12": "Mm. The ache follows me like a shadow. But I need it. If I were to release every frequency sealed in the Vermillion Locks, I—",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_13": "...",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_14": "Arbiter, in my imagining, it would be a loneliness too heavy to bear.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_15": "So let it remain as it is.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_2": "At the sound of footsteps, Suoming moves to put the Vermillion Locks away. When she sees that it is you, she stops.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_3": "Arbiter.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_4": "Talking to them?",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_5": "Mm. I was telling them how Suhsin made a Ninth of its own.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_6": "Looking back, if it hadn't been so impatient, if it hadn't put words about letting go in Ninth's mouth, perhaps—",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_7": "I don't think it would've swayed you. If anything, using the Ten Seals Covenant against you would have done the opposite, wouldn't it?",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_8": "Hehe. You hold me to quite a standard, Arbiter. But it's true. They're sealed in my Locks. I would not be deceived.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_2_9": "But Suhsin's imitation was too convincing. I confess, I indulged myself. I let that false Ninth walk beside me longer than I should have.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_3_1": "Mm. This year, we'll return to Huating during the winter. It's been far too long since we last saw snow together.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_3_2": "Last time I returned, it was raining. A few people were huddled beneath that old statue, the one of Qinglang warding off the Evil Miasma.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_3_3": "It had fallen into disrepair over the years. Most of the detail was gone. But the umbrella's silhouette was still intact.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_3_4": "When I first had the Second Seal forge the <b>Nine Shadows</b>, my hope was that it would give Huating some cover from the <b>Evil Miasma</b>.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_3_5": "Seeing people still taking refuge beneath it today... it moved me.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_3_6": "For a moment, Suoming sets her burdens down, slipping into easy conversation with her companions...",
-+  "ZXHSMST_4_1": "Then stop arguing. Forget the whole idea.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_1": "Surely you jest. Shuyun's Moon Fox Rice Cakes are crisp on the outside with a sweet, chewy center. They hold their own against any of those famous shops!",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_10": "Is Intendant Suoming secretly a big eater?",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_11": "Done wasting time? Go. See Xuanfang Hold, both of you.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_12": "Yes, Intendant Suoming!",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_2": "Nothing beats them with afternoon tea!",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_3": "The Intendant has already tried those. She'll want something different today.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_4": "Little Snowy Moons are soft and airy, with a delicate sweetness. They are the perfect complement to Huating white tea.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_5": "I gave you both the day off. And instead of showing Jiqing around Xuanfang, you come here, Tangning?",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_6": "You need the rest more than we do, Intendant. Though we both know you couldn't take a day off if you tried.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_7": "So we thought we'd bring you something for afternoon tea. Give yourself the afternoon, at least.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_8": "Then stop arguing. Leave them both.",
-+  "ZXHSMST_5_9": "So... you're having both?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_1_1": "The Moon Fox Society. Hehe, what an amusing little group.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_1": "Arbiter! Where the Fox chases the Moon, all partings fade away!",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_10": "How did they take it? I wouldn't be surprised if they fainted on the spot and had to be carried off by Huaxu physicians.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_11": "At first, they stood quite frozen. It took two waves of my hand before they stirred from their daze.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_12": "Then came the bows, the reverent greetings, and, most tenderly, the concern over whether some ill fate had kept me from appearing all these years.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_13": "And in the end, they thanked me for guiding them through their lost days.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_14": "But Arbiter, I truly did nothing. And yet, now that I walk among them again, every gaze that falls upon me is filled with longing, with gratitude, with hope...",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_15": "Are you still afraid you won't live up to it?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_16": "No. Not anymore. I am simply moved. A hundred years and more I have been unseen, and still, their love burns undimmed.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_17": "I am so glad... My charge is to guide the people of Mengzhou forward. But in this moment, I wish only to step into their midst. To laugh as they laugh, to feel their joy as if it were my own.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_18": "If I were to steal a little time for myself, would the Arbiter indulge me?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_19": "You wouldn't be stealing time. This is exactly what Mengzhou's Sentinel ought to be doing.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_2": "Hm? Moon Fox Society?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_20": "Hehe, as the Arbiter says. Perhaps this, too, is the Sentinel It hoped I would become.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_3": "...?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_4": "That's the Moon Fox Society's code, isn't it? The next line goes: Where the Fox turns the wheel, fortune follows!",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_5": "Just so. Seems the Arbiter is a member of the Moon Fox Society too.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_6": "Hm? What does that mean?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_7": "The Arbiter doesn't know? No initiations into the Moon Fox Society for you then, hehe.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_8": "If memory serves, they're very fond of you. Fanatical, almost. Wait, did you actually go to meet them?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_2_9": "I did. I knew of the Moon Fox Society even in my years bound to the Sanctum. I have long wished to meet them.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_3_1": "Arbiter, did you catch the fire-breathers at the Waking Moon Festival? They were such fun.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_3_2": "I did. There were three of them.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_3_3": "I must have missed that.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_3_4": "Besides them, there were storytellers spinning tales at their stalls, acrobats juggling apples, and children performing the fish lantern dance.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_3_5": "Oh, and the Lantern Carriages, parading through the streets in rhythm with the fireworks. Such a lively, beautiful sight.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_3_6": "The Waking Moon Festival... what a joy.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_4_1": "Truly... what a year of blossoming bounty it has been.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_1": "Truly... what a year of blossoming bounty it has been.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_10": "Now that I can partake in the Festival again, I have seen so many lanterns bearing tidings of joy. It makes my heart feel full to bursting.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_11": "Would you hear a few more, Arbiter?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_12": "Of course. We have all the time in the world.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_13": "Wonderful! Then let me tell you of a boy who set out to find a Jadeplume Eagle...",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_2": "Arbiter, came across a young girl's story just now. A full year of her life, written upon a Moon Lantern. It gladdened my heart to read.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_3": "Tell me about it.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_4": "In the warmth of spring, her father, who had spent years defending Xuanfang Hold, laid down his armor and returned home.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_5": "By the height of summer, her mother, long confined to her sickbed, rose again under their shared care.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_6": "Free of burden at last, she set out beneath autumn's golden light to pursue her dream of studying medicine.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_7": "And as the first snow of winter began to fall, she met the one her heart had been waiting for.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_8": "She sounds like a strong soul.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_5_9": "She is. Her father was gone for years, and she cared for her mother alone. That takes something rare.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_1": "Arbiter, come. Rest a while, and tell me of the days you have left behind.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_2": "Me? Hmm...",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_3": "A flood of memories rises. You turn each one over in your mind, and after a pause, you begin to speak.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_4": "Joy and sorrow flicker across Hsin's face in turn, and every shift in Her expression makes the telling sweeter.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_5": "I may have gone on longer than I meant to. You did say the lanterns were only meant for happy stories, right?",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_6": "Yes. The people of Mengzhou know I have a taste for life's pleasures and little fortunes, so they fill their lanterns with happy tidings, hoping to draw me near.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_7": "But what I truly want is for them to set their old griefs aside during the Festival. I hope that in their writing upon the lanterns, they learn to see their yesterdays with grace.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_8": "Arbiter, should hardship find you again one day, should grief return, I hope you will remember the moments that rang with laughter, and let them carry you forward.",
-+  "ZXHXYHST_6_9": "So pray, continue, Arbiter. I would hear every word of it.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_1": "It's so beautiful...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_10": "I'm really looking forward to it...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_11": "...Looking forward to every morning I wake up beside you, every sight we share, every moment we experience together.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_12": "Whether they're ordinary or extraordinary, smooth sailing or rough waters... as long as I'm with you, I look forward to it all.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_13": "Fuling...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_14": "Me too. I feel the exact same way.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_15": "So, please... just stay by my side a little longer.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_16": "(It's Fuling and Wuli.)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_17": "(The last time I saw them was back in Rinascita... Their journey is still going strong.)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_18": "(Aww, look at those two lovebirds... Should we go over and say hi?)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_19": "(It's fine. What matters is that they're both safe and happy. Let's just leave them to enjoy the view.)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_2": "Would you like to paint here? Or should we head somewhere else to look around?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_20": "(If fate permits, our paths will cross again someday.)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_3": "Hm... I want to paint them all. It's so hard to pick...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_4": "Haha. No rush, then. We're staying here for a while anyway. I'll be right here with you.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_5": "<size=-18>Once I get the goldsmith's reply...</size>",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_6": "Hm? Did you say something?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_7": "Oh... nothing at all!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_8": "...Wuli.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_101_9": "Y-Yes?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_10_1": "Mmh... this is incredible! Seriously, you have to try it—Blegh!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_10_2": "Are you serious? You're literally throwing up! And tears are streaming down your face!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_10_3": "I just choked! Come on, I'd never lie to you! This is good stuff, I swear!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_10_4": "Really? Well, just one bite then... Blegh!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_10_5": "Ahahaha—Blegh!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_10_6": "You little—Blegh!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_10_7": "Stop talking—Blegh!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_1": "Oh, no... I spent all my pocket money. I'm so gonna get it this time...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_2": "What did you buy?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_3": "A Moon Fox lantern, two <ano=candied fruit>Tanghulu</ano> skewers, and a pack of Moonlight Sparklers...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_4": "I gave the lantern to Yishu, and the Tanghulu... I bought them for Mom and Dad, but they were so tasty I ate them...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_5": "I promised Mom I'd save my money... What if I say a big gust of wind blew the money away? Do you think she'd believe me?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_6": "Probably not...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_7": "Maybe you should just tell her the truth.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_8": "Ugh...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_11_9": "I can't... Mom's got a short fuse...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_1": "Zhumei! Th-there's something I've wanted to tell you for a long time! I, uh... well...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_10": "Mm-hmm... That sounds lovely.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_2": "Hm? What is it?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_3": "I mean... you... you look... really pretty today.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_4": "...Oh, thank you. You look quite sharp yourself, Maqing.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_5": "So... was there anything else you wanted to tell me?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_6": "Oh! Yes! I, uh... I've always...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_7": "You've always...?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_8": "Always... wanted to take you out to dinner at Yuan's Flavors!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_12_9": "...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_131_1": "Sir, the storyteller's legends are so different from what's written in our history books...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_131_2": "Hehe, legends reflect people's hopes and their longing for the unknown. Passed from mouth to mouth, facts gather embellishments, borrow from other tales, and drift away from history.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_131_3": "And so, uncovering why a tale took the shape it has today... is a fascinating discipline in its own right.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_131_4": "Yet, the way a story evolves across the ages reveals the world as it once was.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_13_1": "Sir, the storyteller's legends are so different from what's written in our history books...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_1": "Say, if Paragon Qingxiao and Sentinel Hsin the Moon Fox actually went all out, who do you think would win?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_2": "Is that even a question? Lady Hsin is a Sentinel. Who in this world is more powerful than a Sentinel?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_3": "But I heard Paragon Qingxiao can summon countless swords hundreds of meters tall! I'd say she's got a fighting chance.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_4": "Oh yeah? Lady Hsin can conjure an entire city out of thin air and drop it right on her head. Boom.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_5": "But then the Paragon could summon a vast formation of giant swords and channel her Sword Intent into an impenetrable shield!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_6": "...Then Lady Hsin could just turn all of Xuanfang Hold into one giant Autopuppet that swallows the Paragon whole, swords and all!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_7": "...Sure, but then the Paragon would make her swords go wild inside its belly and cut her way out from the inside!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_8": "Then... then Lady Hsin would just conjure another city!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_14_9": "Would there even be a Land of Xuanfang left after all that...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_15_1": "Mhm... This year's Waking Moon Brew... is so good...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_15_2": "Zzz... Zzz...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_1": "It's a quiet Autopuppet, but somehow, you feel like it's observing you.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_10": "...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_11": "Uh... please don't tell anyone...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_12": "This voice... Are you Leyue?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_13": "I knew it...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_14": "Ahaha... you really are sharp.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_15": "It's good to see you again. Yes, it's me—Leyue.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_16": "You vanished right in front of me last time. I thought you were...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_17": "Mmm... When I broke through the restrictions back then, I thought my time as a Celestial was over. But Lady Hsin pulled me back from the brink.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_18": "She saved my consciousness in the Prism of Fate. It took a few days for me to wake up.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_19": "So what are you doing here?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_2": "(Get close to study it.)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_20": "Ahem! Maintenance duty for Xuanfang Hold, of course...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_21": "Alright, fine. Lady Hsin loosened the restrictions so we could use these Autopuppets to explore the Hold. Everyone was so excited about the Waking Moon Festival...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_23": "It's pretty emotional, honestly. I thought everything from the Court of Savantae was long gone, but everywhere I look, I see traces of us.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_24": "And... the tree I planted before I left is still there. It's grown so tall and strong! How wonderful...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_3": "I see what you're doing here.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_4": "...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_5": "...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_6": "The Autopuppet stays put.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_7": "(Stare at it.)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_8": "(Leave.)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_16_9": "...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_1701_1": "Haah, it's so lively out there. Must be nice to be off duty and enjoying the Waking Moon Festival...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_17_1": "Haah, it's so lively out there. Must be nice to be off duty and enjoying the Waking Moon Festival...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_17_2": "You want to go join the celebration? I can cover your shift today.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_17_3": "Oh... Is that really okay?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_17_4": "I saw that girl waiting by the gate to bring you soup last time. Thought I wouldn't notice, kid?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_17_5": "If you want to go, go. It's rare to have the Waking Moon Festival around. Don't live with regrets.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_17_6": "Okay... Thank you so much, sir!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_1801_1": "Huh? Why's Chenfang on duty today? I thought he took a day off.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_18_1": "Huh? Why's Chenfang on duty today? I thought he took a day off.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_18_2": "Heard he covered for a rookie on his squad. Chenfang met his late wife at the festival years ago... It's probably hard for him to be out there celebrating.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_18_3": "Sigh... I see. I'd probably do the same if I were in his shoes...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_18_4": "Alright, your shift's over. Head back and get some rest. You haven't fully healed from last time, right?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_1_1": "Fuling... are you feeling all right now?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_1_2": "Mhm, don't worry about me. The new medicine is actually working really well. I feel surprisingly energetic now!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_1_3": "That's a relief... Kuiren mentioned that anyone who watches the Carriage Procession will be blessed with good fortune.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_1_4": "Just let me know if you get tired, okay? I can carry you back.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_1_5": "I-I'm fine, really... The doctor said I need to walk and stretch my legs anyway—Ah... look over there, Wuli! Isn't that beautiful?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_1_6": "Mm. Very beautiful indeed.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2001_1": "You said you're from Mengzhou City, right? Is the Waking Moon Festival there the same as here in the Hold?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_1": "You said you're from Mengzhou City, right? Is the Waking Moon Festival there the same as here in the Hold?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_2": "Oh, Mengzhou City throws quite the bustling Waking Moon Festival, too! Xuanfang Hold puts on a grand show, but compared to Mengzhou? It doesn't even come close.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_3": "Really?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_4": "Of course! During the Carriage Procession, the long main streets of Mengzhou are lit as bright as day... and the largest Lantern Carriage is taller than a small house!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_5": "Back then, the Lady Sentinel would appear in the heart of the crowd, light up an entire lake with Moon Lanterns, and dance under the moonlight...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_6": "It was something even more beautiful than a dream. Just one glimpse, and you'd remember it for a lifetime.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_7": "I wish I could've seen it myself...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_8": "But Mengzhou these days... Well. Best not to dwell on it.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_20_9": "So, I heard Lady Hsin the Moon Fox has appeared? Where is She right now?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2101_1": "The Sanctum is stable now. All abnormal frequency fluctuations are gone, and Lady Sentinel has made an appearance at today's festival...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_1": "The Sanctum is stable now. All abnormal frequency fluctuations are gone, and Lady Sentinel has made an appearance at today's festival...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_10": "Well then... I'd be honored to join.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_11": "Hehe, awesome! Let's go!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_2": "Huh? Lady Jiqing? Why are you here alone... Wait, are you still working?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_3": "Yes. I need to record the proceedings of the Waking Moon Festival and submit a report to the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_4": "Watching from afar isn't gonna give you anything worth writing about. Tell you what, I just clocked off. We can do a \"field investigation\" together! Come on, or the vendor lines are gonna be huge!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_5": "I... I'm fine. I don't want to bother you.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_6": "Oh, don't be a stranger! The Ministry handled all the cleanup after that mess. You deserve a break!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_7": "It was our oversight that caused the public panic. Putting things right was simply our duty, so please, think nothing of it.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_8": "Ahem... okay, those were just pleasantries. Truth is, I want to try every dish, but I can't eat it all alone.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_21_9": "Care to help me out? We've got Little Snowy Moons, Crab Braised Fish, Memories of Autumn, and Cloudward Stew! I saw three whole crates of fresh bamboo shoots come in this morning while I was patrolling!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_22_1": "He's just a little boy. How much could a Moonlight Sparkler even cost you...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_22_3": "Then why don't you buy it for him, huh?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_22_4": "Excuse me? I'm not his parent.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_1": "I want that! Pleeease!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_10": "Hey, hold on, {Male=young man;Female=young lady}!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_11": "It's not that I'm being stingy—I don't even know this kid!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_12": "Who knows if this is some new kind of scam? Have you seen those anti-fraud ads the Constables put out recently?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_13": "Maybe there's a misunderstanding here... Hey, little one. Where are your mom and dad?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_16": "Mommy and Daddy are on duty... No one will play with me...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_17": "See? Told you I don't know him!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_18": "Sob... I'm not lying...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_19": "You want Moonlight Sparklers, right? How about I take you to get some?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_2": "Ugh... Can you just be quiet for a second...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_20": "...Really?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_21": "Cross my heart. But what about this mister over here? Look... everyone around us thinks he's a bad guy. Grown-ups can get upset, too, you know.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_22": "Mm, okay... Mister, I'm sorry... I shouldn't have done that...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_24": "Sigh... It's alright, kid. Just don't go asking random strangers for stuff on the street. What if you run into a real bad guy?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_25": "...Thanks for clearing that up for me.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_27": "Alright. Let's go find that firework stall.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_28": "Yay! Follow me!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_3": "But I really want that! Wahhh...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_4": "What's going on here?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_5": "What do you want? I can buy it for you.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_6": "Waahh—Hic...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_7": "Listen, I can explain... It's not that I'm being stingy—I don't even know this kid!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_8": "He just ran up out of nowhere and nagged me to buy him stuff. Who knows if this is some new kind of scam?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_23_9": "Moonlight Sparklers... I wanna play Moonlight Sparklers with my friends...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_24_1": "Over here!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_1": "Sisi! Where on earth were you?! I told you to wait until my shift was over!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_10": "Moonlight Sparklers are my absolute favorite! Have you ever tried one? They're super pretty when you light them up!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_11": "Daddy says we should always share the joy with our friends, so... I want you to have this one!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_12": "Thank you.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_13": "Haha, I should be the one thanking you!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_14": "After offering his thanks once more, Gantang leaves with Sisi.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_2": "I just wanted to buy fireworks... and this {Male=mister;Female=lady} said {Male=he;Female=she} could take me to get some!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_3": "You can't just ask random strangers to buy you things! I already got you the fireworks you wanted!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_4": "I'm so sorry about him—Wait, you are... {PlayerName}?!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_5": "(Explain what happened.)",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_6": "I see... Sigh, I'm so sorry for the trouble. Sisi was lucky to run into someone as kind as you. Otherwise...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_7": "It's alright. I'm glad he's back with you.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_8": "Come on, Sisi—say thank you to {PlayerName}.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_25_9": "Hehe! Thank you, {PlayerName}.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2601_1": "Whoa, it's {PlayerName}!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2601_2": "Are you here to join me?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_26_1": "Look! A sparkle!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_26_2": "Whoa! So beautiful!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_1": "Aren't you the great hero who defended our Hold? What an absolute honor!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_10": "Don't mention it! We're the ones who should be thanking you!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_11": "It's been way too long since Xuanfang Hold was this lively.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_2": "With you around, customers will surely come flocking!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_3": "I heard you're the one who cleared up all those anomalies, too. Thanks to you, my little stall can open for business.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_4": "So, having a good time at the festival so far?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_5": "Very much!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_6": "Yeah, it's great.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_7": "Glad to hear it! Oh, here—have some Water Moon Buns fresh out of the steamer! I came up with a new recipe myself, and people just can't resist it.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_8": "If you'd come any later, they would've been all sold out. Here, let me pack some up for you!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_27_9": "Thank you...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_28_1": "Ah, there you are, hero! How'd you like those Water Moon Buns I gave you last time?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_28_2": "Feel free to look around! Is there anything else you'd like to try today?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_29_1": "Alright, it's working time!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_29_2": "Hey, Chen! Whip me up a bowl of Jade Mushroom Soup. I'm gonna have it before we open shop!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2_1": "\"I am Sentinel Hsin the Moon Fox. A sudden crisis has struck the Sanctum, leaving me trapped in its deepest depths...\"",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2_2": "\"You have been chosen to assist me in reclaiming Xuanfang Hold. As my next Resonator, you must...\"",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2_3": "...Send 80,000 Shell Credits to rebuild the Celestial Ring Formation? Wait, this is obviously a scam! Tell me you didn't actually send them money!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2_4": "Uh, no... I-I didn't...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_2_5": "By the way... do you mind buying me lunch today? I'm... a little strapped for cash lately.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_30_1": "Zzz... Zzz...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_30_2": "Excuse me... when will this stall open?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_31_1": "Today's tally... Hm, not bad at all...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_31_2": "Wait, I'm over by forty Shell Credits... Oh no, who did I give the wrong change to...?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_32_1": "Hello? How much for this pastry?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_33_1": "Which one looks better? This one... or that one?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_33_2": "Ugh, forget it. I'll just take both!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_1": "This Mung Bean Soup is, well... a local specialty. But honestly, very few outsiders can handle the taste.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_10": "See? Doesn't it grow on you after a few sips? How about another cup?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_11": "I-I'll pass... Ahaha...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_2": "Yeah... it's definitely something...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_3": "Look, if it's too much for you, I can get you the modified version!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_4": "No, no... Don't bother. I came here to sample the real deal!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_5": "Actually not bad. Better than the stuff in Mingting, and the texture's richer...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_6": "You're certainly being generous... But to us locals, this soup tastes like home.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_7": "After leaving home as I got older, this is what I missed most. Now that I'm back, I'm drinking my fill.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_8": "Hmm... though this shop's batch is a little milder than my grandma's... She knew I loved sweets, so she'd always add in extra sugar.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_34_9": "Yeah, I feel you...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_35_1": "Come on over and take a look!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_35_2": "You definitely don't want to miss our Waking Moon Festival specials!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_36_1": "The ultimate Waking Moon Festival day tour, planned out just for you!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_36_2": "Hit the stalls first to feast on local snacks, then catch the fish lantern show tonight!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_37_1": "Hey, {PlayerName}! Welcome! See anything you like?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_37_2": "Any recommendations?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_37_3": "That'd be our signature Mung Bean Soup! You can't get this anywhere outside of Mengzhou! One sip to clear your head, two sips to remember it for life!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_37_4": "Sounds a bit, uh ...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_37_5": "Fantastic! I'll take a jar of it!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_37_6": "Aiya, you're already here! Might as well give it a shot! Tell you what, this one's on me. Here, just try it!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_37_7": "Now that's the spirit! One Mung Bean Soup, coming right up! Here you go!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_37_8": "Just come on back for more if you like it!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_3_1": "Legend has it that the Ministry of Development once had a prodigy on their hands. One with the rare talent to command the mountains and oceans. She even built the entire Bird-Return Garden in a single night!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_3_2": "Impressive! And then what happened?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_3_3": "She just vanished into thin air one day...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_3_4": "Left nothing behind but a tuft of tail fur on the blueprints. That's when it hit them... she was Hsin the Moon Fox in disguise, come to help the Artisans crack what they couldn't!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_3_5": "Yeah, yeah, keep making things up. She's a Sentinel! Hsin the Moon Fox doesn't shed.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_4_1": "The Waking Moon Festival is finally here... When will Lady Sentinel arrive?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_4_2": "Grandma... Hsin the Moon Fox isn't coming. Just try not to think about it.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_4_3": "You always said She'd come, but She never shows. Those old legends are just made-up stories.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_4_4": "It's different this time. She will be here.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_4_5": "Someone saw Her walking down from the Sanctum alongside that great hero who saved Jinzhou!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_4_6": "Everything is going to get better... for all of Xuanfang.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_4_7": "...Xuanfang's been doing just fine on its own, even with Hsin the Moon Fox gone!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_4_8": "I'm gonna see what this long-lost Sentinel looks like for myself...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_5_1": "I heard the Ministry of Sentinel Affairs has sent someone to the Land of Xuanfang... Think you might know a thing or two about it?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_5_2": "Of course I do! They say that Intendant is no small figure, plus she's got history with Lady Hsin...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_5_3": "She dresses all in black, is always seen with an umbrella, and comes and goes without a trace. A mystery through and through, and worth ten of any other. Wherever she passes, folks can't help but stare...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_5_4": "...You're not just making this up?",
-+  "ZYHSGST_5_5": "That's just the word on the street.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_6_1": "First time at the Waking Moon Festival? Well, well, you've found the perfect guide!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_6_2": "For daytime, I'd say the Carriage Procession and a taste of Waking Moon Brew are a must. And by night? Go watch the fish lantern dances and make a wish with the Water Moon Lanterns. Trust me, it's a sight you won't want to miss!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_6_3": "So, how about it? Need a local guide? Honest prices, satisfaction guaranteed. I can even wait in line for you at Yuan's Flavors!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_6_4": "...No need? That's quite alright! Then how about these Xuanfang mechanism models? The craftsmanship is exquisite. They make perfect souvenirs!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_6_5": "Care for a look? Only 500 Shell Credits!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_7_1": "Alright, everyone! Today I'm gonna show you the must-try dishes at the Waking Moon Festival!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_7_2": "First up: Cloudward Stew. Savory, packed with flavor... Mmm, this is sooo good!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_7_3": "Next on the list: Stir-Fried Trio. Spicy, savory, perfect with rice. Yum yum!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_7_4": "Now for Mengzhou's No. 1 pastry: Moon Fox Rice Cake. Say less, people. This one's a solid ten out of ten!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_7_5": "Alright, now I'm taking you to try the signature dish at Yuan's Flavors. Stay tuned!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_8_1": "N-no way... The fourth and fifth volumes of \"Meteorite Tiger Blade\"?!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_8_2": "Hehe. A friend from Jinzhou came in for the Waking Moon Festival and brought them along by chance. I knew you were dying to read them, so I kept them right here just for you.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_8_3": "I can't believe my wish on the Moon Lantern came true so fast... Thank you SOOO much!",
-+  "ZYHSGST_9_1": "Don't gobble the Water Moon Cakes straight from the steamer. While they're still hot, add a scoop of ice cream and a drizzle of plum sauce...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_9_2": "You'll get a cool, creamy richness on the first bite, followed by the warm, pillowy cake. You'll enjoy that lovely contrast while the plum's tart bite cuts through the sweetness...",
-+  "ZYHSGST_9_3": "Just try it. One bite, and you'll be too busy enjoying it to talk.",
-+  "ZYHSGST_9_4": "You must be a true gourmet... Now I've gotta try one too!"
- }
-\ No newline at end of file
